<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Ndwewe Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matayu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nhalo ghwa Maha handa paghutyekitwe na Matayu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nhalo ghwa maha handa paghutyekitwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matayu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhalo ghwa Maha handa paghutyekitwe na Matayu, ndo ghumu mu hitabho ncheche hya Ninganilo lya Hyono, ghuulubhulila ubhumi Yesu Kilisito. Kila kitabho mu hitabho ahyo ncheche hingukemwa “Injili” fwambulo yake ndo “Nhalo ghwa Maha.” Hitabho ahyo hikityekwa na Matayo na Maliki na Lukasi na Yohane mbole ya kuhwegha kwa Yesu. Asomi abhegha ng'obhe na ulyaghilo ghwa pakiki Matayo kakityeka Nhalo ghwa Maha, peni yinguhwachilwa kukita yikibhegha mungungwa ya 60 Mbole ya kubhelekwa kwa Yesu. Kangi pala pakayekitwe kitabho aki kungumanyikwa ng'obhe, peni atangalo anguhwacha kukita pahala pakityekitwe yinguhwachilwa pangi ku Palesitina mukitami kya Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ntyeka ywa kitabho aki ndo Matayu, ywene kakibhegha nsumula sumu kukali na kukemwa na Yesu kubhegha nhundwa ywake. Kangi kakimanyikwa kwa lihina lya Lawi. Matayu kakibhegha yumu mu bhala andumila kumi na abhili bha Yesu, na kakikityeka kitabho aki kwa bhanakusoma bha Akaayahudi. Ayi yingubhoneka pee annda mwakabhuyila milando kuchweha kwa sitini kuhuma ku Ninganilo lya Makachu. Matayu kakipala kubhoneha kukita Yesu kakibhegha Kilisito ebu nkombohi ywakalondolitwe na Chapanga. Kangi Matayu kakityeka matangalo yakya Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga. Akaayahudi bhakihyubhalila kukita Kilisito katabhegha Mutwa na ntabhala mu nnima aghu. Matayu kangupingikiha kya umaha mahwacho agho kwa kulubhulila yakya milando ya kinhuki ya Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nhalo ghwa Maha handa paghutyekitwe na Matayo ndo kitabho kya maha kuyandiha Ninganilo lya hyono, kubhukana na kutumila hifungu hya Ninganilo lya Makachu. Kitabho aki kingulunganiha Maninganilo mabhili. Kangi Asomi bhangusigha kukita Matayo kayigha kuhwananiha handa hitabho hyakatyekite Musa, muhila hitabho nhano hya kalongohi hya Ninganilo lya Makachu. Malandamiho gha Yesu ku kitumbi (Matayu 5-7) ghanguhotoleka kuhwananihwa na pala Chapanga pakanpeghite Musa Malaghilo (Malaghilo 19:3—23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaabheghite</para>
  <para style="io1">Matayo kangughuyandiha Nhalo ghwa Maha kwa kulubhulila bhula Yesu Kilisito na kubhelekwa na uyandiho ghwa lihengo lyake mu hipalamande hya 1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbole Matayo kangulubhulila lihengo lya Yesu na mahundo ghake matangalo mu hipalamande hya 5-25</para>
  <para style="io1">Kipalamande kya uhiko kya Kitabho kya Matayo ndo kinemba kya lihengo lya Yesu mu Kiho na uhyuko ghwake 26-28</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Lukasi 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Aki ndo kitabho kya mahina gha lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisito ywa kibheleko kya Daudi, ywa kibheleko kya Abulahamu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibulahimu kakinlela Isaka, na Isaka kakinlela Yakobu, na Yakobu kakinlela Yuda na alongo bhake. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda kakinlela Pelesi papamu na Zela, bhene mama ywabhe kakibhegha Tamali, na Pelisi kakinlela Hesiloni, na Esiloni kakinlela Alamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alamu kakinlela Aminadabu, na Aminadabu kakinlela Nashoni, na Nashoni kakinlela Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni kakinlela Boasi, na mama ghwake Boasi kakibhegha Lahabu, Boasi kakibhegha tate ghwake Obedi na mama ghwake Obedi kakibhegha Luti, na Obedi kakinlela Yese. <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese kakinlela Mutwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Daudi kakinlela Selemani, kwa yula nhumbu ywa Ulia <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Selemani kakinlela Lehoboamu, na Lehoboamu kakinlela Abiya, na Abiya kakinlela Asafu. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asafu kakinlela Yehoshafati, na Yohoshafati kakinlela Yolamu, na Yolamu kakinlela Usia. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Usia kakinlela Yotamu, na Yotamu kakinlela Ahasi, na Ahasi kakinlela Hesekia. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hesekia kakinlela Manase, na Manase kakinlela Amoni, na Amoni kakinlela Yosia. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosia kakinlela Yekonia na alongo bhake, Mumanjubha gha kuhamihwa kughenda ku Babeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Mbole ya Akaayahudi kuhamihwa kughenda ku Babeli, Yekonia kakinlela Shealitieli, na Shealitieli kakinlela Selubabeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Selubabeli kakinlela Abihudi, na Abihudi kakinlela Eliakimu na Eliakimu kakinlela Asoli. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Asoli kakinlela Sadoki, na Sadoki kakinlela Akimu, na Akimu kakinlela Eliudi. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudi kakinlela Eliasali, na Eliasali kakinlela Matani, na Matani kakinlela Yakobu, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />naywo Yakobu kakinlela Yosefu ywakabheghite nngwana ghwa Malia mama ghwake Yesu, na Yesu ndo ywakakemwa Kilisito. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Habhu, hibheleko hyoha kutandila Abulahamu mbaka Daudi kukibhegha hibheleko kumi na ncheche, kangi kutandila Daudi mbaka kihamo kila kya ku Babeli kukibhegha hibheleko hingi kumi na ncheche, na kangi kutandila kihamo kya ku Baneli mbaka Kilisito kukibhegha hibheleko hingi kumi na ncheche.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Lukasi 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Kubhelekwa kwa Yesu Kilisito kukibhegha naha, Malia mama ywake Yesu pakaluhitwe na Yosefu, peni kukali na kughonja papamu, Malia kakibhonekana kabhegha na ndumbo kwa makakala gha Nhuki ywa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Naywo Yosefu nngwana ghwake, kiyaha kakibhegha mundu ywakughatughila ghala ghakaghapala Chapanga, kakipala ng'obhe kumpegha honi Maliamu pakindabhanji, ndo kakilamula kunleka kwa mbwepo. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Basi, pakabheghite mukuwacha kutenda nnando aghwo, lihoka lya Bambo likinbwitukila mumaloto na kakinng'ombela, “Yosefu mwana ywa Daudi, ghukotoke kuyoghopa kuntola Malia kabheghe nhumbu ghwako, kiyaha mata ghakamilite ndo kwa makakala gha Nhuki ywa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Katapapa mwana nnume, na ghwenga ghwanpegha mwana aywo lihina lyake Yesu, kiyaha mwene ndo kataalopoha bhandu kubhuka mu ulemwa ghwabhe.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Basi, agha ghoha ghatulukila ili ghatwihilike ghala ghakalongelite Bambo kwa njila ya mbuye ywa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />Nnole, “Nhinja kamwali katakamula ndumbo, naywo katapapa mwana nnume, Mwana aywo katakemwa lihina lyake Emanueli.” Fwambulo yake, “Chapanga papamu na twenga.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Naywo Yosefu pakayumukite mung'ono, kakitenda handa lihoka ywa Bambo pakanng'ombilite, kakintola nhumbu ywake. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Peni kanatyanga naywo ng'obhe mbaka Malia pakapapite mwana nnume. Naywo Yosefu kakinkema yula mwana lihina lyake Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ahenja kuhuma mbande ya Ngeha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yesu kakibhelekwa kumbwani ya Betelehemu, mu nkoa ghwa Yudea, manjubha agho Helode kakibhegha mutwa. Kamu, mbole ya kubhelekwa Yesu, bhanautendehi bha kumanya ndondwa kuhuma mbande ya ngeha bhakehika ku Yelusalemu <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />bhakikonya, “Kabhengha kwoki aywo mwana ywakabhelekitwe, ywakapala kubhegha Mutwa ywa Akaayahudi? Tuyibhona ndondwa yake payibwitukila kungeha, na twenga tuhika kumtundamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Mutwa Helode pakayihwite nnando aghu kakibhaghaya, ywombe papamo na bhandu boha bhubho bha ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Basi kakiakema papamu mandundame akulu bhoha na ahunda bha Malaghilo gha Musa, kakiakonya “Kilisito katabhelekwa kwoki?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bhombe bhakinng'ombela, “Katabhelekwa kumbwani ya Betelehemu kunkoa ghwa Yudea,” Handa pakalembite mbuye ywa Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Naghwenga Betelehemu munnima ghwa Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Ghwenga ghunndoko ng'obhe nkati ya hitami ihwadali hya ku Yudea;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Mana, kwa ghwenga katabwituka kilongohi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">ywakapala kualongoha bhandu bhangu Akaaisilaeli.”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Apo ndo Helode kakiakema pambwegha abho atendehi bha kumanya ndondwa, kakiakonya bhammanyihe nndaluko ghwa tela ghuubhonekanite yila ndondwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Mbole kakibhalaghila aghende Betelehemu pakiaghombela. “Nng'ende mukahingukihe maha mihalo ya mwana aywo. Mbole ya kummona mumuyihile mihalo yake, ngati na nenga ng'ende kuntundamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Mbole ya kunnyihwa Mutwa, abho atendehi bha kumanya ndondwa bhakibhuka, na kamu yila ndondwa bhaayibhonite mbande ya ngeha yikialongoha, nabhombe bhakiyitughila mbaka payiyimite pakabheghite mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Paayibhonite yila ndondwa yiyima bhakiyelelwa na kulumbilila kwa uyelelo. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Paayingilite unyumba bhakimmona mwana papamu na Malia mama ghwake, bhakichutama na bhakintundamila. Ndo bhakihughula lijamanda na bhakitola hupo hyabhe, bhakinpegha mahabha na ubanu na ntela ghwa bhana.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Mbole Chapanga kakiakinya mululoto bhakotoke kummuyila Helode, ndo bhakibhuya ukaya kwabhe kwa njila yingi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhutukila ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Mbole ya bhala ahenja kubhuka, lihoka lya Bambo likinbwitukila Yosefu mumaloto, na kunng'ombela, “Ghuyumuke na ghuntole mwana papamu na mama ghwake na mmutukile ku Misili. Ntame akwo mbaka panukughombela, kiyaha Helode kangupala kunkoma mwana ayu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Habhu, Yosefu kakibhuka pakilo kakintola mwana papamu na mama ghwake, na bhakighenda ku Misili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Bhakitama akwo mbaka pakahweghite Helode. Nnando aghu ghukibwituka ili litulukila lilagho lyakalongilite Bambo kwa ngulu ya mbuye, pakalongela, “Nikinkema mwana ghwangu nenga Chapanga kuhuma Kumisili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhana hing'enya bhangukomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helode pakang'amulite kukita bhala atendehi bha kumanya ndondwa bhantindila kya luhunga, kakikalala muno. Kakikwilikiha bhana alumi bhoha mu kitami kya Betelehemu na mumbwegha mbwegha yake akomwe, kutandila bhala bhana bhoha bhaabheghite na ngungwa mbili mbaka hing'enya. Kakitenda habhu kubhukana na manjubha kupita kutandila pakakonganite na bhala atendehi bha kumanya ndondwa.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ndo paghatulukilite malagho ghala ghaakambukitwe na mbuye Yelemia<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Lilobhe liyihwanika akwo Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Kililo na makukuliko matangalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli kangualilila bhana bhake;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">na kalema kuyonjokehwa mwoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kiyaha bhoha bhahwegha.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuya kuhuma ku Misli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Mbole ya kuhwegha Helode, lihoka lya Bambo likinbwitukila Yosefu mumaloto akwo Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />kakinng'ombela, “Ghuyumuke, ghuntole mwana papamu na mama ywake, ghubhuye kangi kunnima ghwa Isilaeli, kiyaha bhala bhaapalite kughubhuha ubhumi ghwa mwana ahwegha kala.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Basi, Yosefu kakiyimuka, kakintola mwana papamu na mama ywake, bhakibhuya mu nnima ghwa Isilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Peni Yosefu kakiyoghopa kughenda akwo Kuyudea pakayihwite kukita Alikelao kaghuhala utabhala ghwa tate ghwake Helode. Mbole ya kukinywa na lihoka lya Chapanga mumaloto, bhakighenda mbande ya Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />na kakighenda kutama kukitami kiikemitwe Nasaleti. Habhu ndo ghakitulukila malagho ghaakambukitwe na mambuye, “Katakemwa mundu ywa Kunasaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohane yunakubatisa kangualandamiha bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliki 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lukasi 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohane 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mumanjubha ghala Yohane yunakubatisa kakihika pakalandamiha mu kibhala kya Yudea, na kulongela, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />“Mulipetule ulemwa ghwenu, kiyaha ghubhutwa ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga ghuheghelela.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ayu ndo Yohane ywene ndo mbuye Isaya kakilondola ya kya ywombe pakalongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Lilobhe la mundu lingukema kukibhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Munntendekehele Bambo njila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">nng'ololehe ndyangilo yake.’”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yohane kakihwala mapinda ghaatendekehitwe kwa mayuni gha nnyama ywaakemitwe ngamia, na nkungi ghwa liyula mu kibhuno kyake. Hilyo hyaki hikibhegha mapalala na bhuchi. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Bhandu bhakinng'endela kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, na mbande hyoha ya Yudea na mumilima ya mbwegha mbwegha ya lukemba lwa Yoludani.<verse eid="MAT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Nabho bhakilipetula ulemwa ghwabhe, na kakiabatisa mulukemba lwa Yoludani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Peni pakaabhonite Akaafalisayo na Akasadukayo bhangung'endela ngati abatiswe, kakiaghombela, “Mwenga bhandu ahakata handa liyoka. Ndo ghani ywakaakinyite kukihepetuka kiyaghabhu kiipala kuhika? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Basi, mulilahe kwa mandendelo kukita mulipetula, <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />na kangi nkotoke kuhwacha na kulongela, ‘Tati ywetu Ibulahimu.’ Ninguaghombela hoto, Chapanga kaahotola kutendekeha kibheleko kya Ibulahimu kuhuma mu malibho agha. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Hata naha, libhaghu libhikwa kala mu ngigha hya nkongo. Nkongo ghwohele ghwangali kupambika mapambiko gha maha, ghwaadumulwa na kutaghwa mu mwoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Nenga nunguabatisa kwa machi kubhoneha kukita mulipetula. Peni ywakapala kuhika mbole ya nenga kabhegha na makakala kupitingana nenga, na yingunnogha ng'obhe hata kuyegha makobasi ghake. Mwene kataabatisa kwa Nhuki ywa Chapanga na kwa mwoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Ywombe kakamula mumabhoko ghake kipalo kya kupetela mbunje hyake, na katakilima muno kibhanja kya kukubhatila, ngati kakungane ngano hyaki mu luhanja, na mayeyele kaghayoche kwa mwoto ghwangahimika.”<figure style="fig" file="06 Threshing.jpg" size="col" ref="3:12">Mundu kangupeta </figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubatiswa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliki 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lukasi 3:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Mumanjubha agho Yesu kakihuma ku Galilaya na kakihika mu lukemba lwa Yoludani, ngati kabatiswe na Yohane. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Peni Yohane kakiyigha kunkanikiha pakanng'ombela, “Nenga ningupala kubatiswa na ghwenga, na ghwenga ghunguhika kubatiswa na nenga!”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Peni Yesu kakinnyanga, “Ghuleke yitulukile habhu kwa hinu. Mana habhu yingutunogha kughayitikila malaghilo gha Chapanga.” Habhu Yohane kakinnyitikila.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Naywo Yesu pakabatisitwe kala, kamu pakahumite mu machi, pindulu kunane kwa Chapanga kukihughuka, kakimmona Nhuki ghwa Chapanga pakahuluka handa ngunda na kutula unani mwake. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Mbole lilobhe kuhuma kunane kwa Chapanga likilongela, “Ayu ndo Mwana ghwangu mpalo, yunyelelwa naywo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangung'ehwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Maliki 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Lukasi 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Mbole Yesu kakilongohwa na Nhuki ghwa Chapanga mbaka kukibhala ngati kakang'ehwe na Nchipila. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Kakilikunga manjubha alobaini pamuhi na pakilo, kuuhiko yikimmina muno njala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Mbole, Nchipila kakinhikila na kunng'ombela, “Handa ghwenga ndo Mwana ghwa Chapanga, ghughakwilikihe malibho agha ghabheghe mangate.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Peni Yesu kakinnyanga, “Yityekwa mu Matyeko gha Chapanga, ‘Mundu katatama ng'obhe kwa kulyegha lingate ghweka, ngati kwa kila lilagho liikambukwa kwa nngulo ya Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Mbole Nchipila kakintola Yesu mbaka Kuyelusalemu, Kitami kiibhaghulitwe kwakya Chapanga, na kakimmika kunani kunnala ghwa Kitutubhi kya Chapanga, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />na kakinng'ombela, “Handa ghwenga Mwana ghwa Chapanga, ghuliponehe pahi, kiyaha yityekwa mumatyeko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Chapanga kataakwilikiha Mahoka bhake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">na bhombe bhaakukingama mu mabhoko ghabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">ghukotoke kuponekela mu liganga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yesu kakinnyanga, “Matyeko mang'anyimo ghangulongela, ‘Ghukotoke kunng'eha Bambo Chapanga ghwako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Mbole Nchipila kakintola Yesu mbaka kukinemba kya kitumbi kitandamaho na kakinnaha ghubhutwa ghwoha ghwa nnima na ukulu ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Kakinng'ombela Yesu, “Ahi hyoha ndaghupegha handa ghwanjutamila mayughwa na kundundamila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Peni Yesu kakinnyanga, “Ghubhuke muulongolo ghwangu, ghwenga Nchipila. Kiyaha Matyeko ghangulongela, ‘Ghuntundamile Bambo Chapanga ghwako, na ghuntumikile ywombe ghweka.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Basi, Nchipila kakinleka, nabho mahoka bha Chapanga bhakihika kuntumikila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguyanda lihengo lyake ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliki 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lukasi 4:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yesu pakayihwite kukita Yohane Yunakubatisa kahwindwa ku kibhopo, ywombe kakighenda akwo ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Kakibhuka Nasaleti, kakighenda kutama ku Kapelinaumu kitami kiibheghiti mbwegha ya lihibha lya Galilaya, mu mbakilo ya kitami kya Sabuloni na Nafutali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Ghakitulukila habhu ili lilagho lyakalongelite mbuye Isaya litwihilike kukita,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Milima ya Sabuloni na ghwa Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">milima yiibheghite mumbwegha ya njila yiighenda kulihibha kumwambo ya lukemba Yoludani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya, nnima ya bhandu bhangabhegha Ayahudi.<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Bhandu bhala bhaatamite mulubhindu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Bhalubhona lubhwelu lukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Nabho bhaatamiteghe mu nnima ghwa lubhindu na bhwaghalili ghwa kuhwegha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">lubhwelo lubhang'aliha.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kutandila apo, Yesu kakiyanda kulandamiha pakalongela, “Mulipetule, kiyaha Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga ghuheghelela.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguakema aghomeha homba ncheche</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliki 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lukasi 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yesu pakabheghite mukutyanga mumbwegha ya lihibha lya Galilaya, kakiabhona alongo abhili aghomeha homba, Simoni ywakakemwa Petili na Andelea ywakabheghite nnongo ghwake, paaghomeha homba kwa njaho. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Ndo Yesu kakiaghombela, “Mundughile, na nenga ndabhatenda munyeghele bhandu handa aghomeha pabhayegha homba mulubhagha lwabhe.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Kamu bhakihileka njaho hyabhe na bhakintughila.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Pabhaghendite paulogolo kya mandina, kakiabhona alongo bhangi abhili, Yakobu na Yohane, bhana bha Sebedayo. Abha bhakibhegha mubhwato papamo na tati ghwabhe Sebedayo, paatandambuha njaho hyabhe. Ndo Yesu kakiakema, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />kamu bhakighuleka bhwato papamu na tate ghwabhe, bhakintughila Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguahunda bhandu na kualamiha atamwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Lukasi 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yesu kakighenda muhitami hyoha hya Kugalilaya, kakihunda muhitutubhi hya kukonganila Akaayahudi na kulandamiha Nhalo ghwa Maha ya kya ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga, kakilamiha mihehemela nhanganganiko na matamwa ghaabheghite nagho bhandu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Mihalo yake yikikwila mbande hyoha hya ku Silia, na atamwa bhoha bhaabheghite na matamwa nhanganganiko, na bhala bhaabheghite na himbamanda nhanganganiko, bhaakwelitwe na mandilu, bhaabheghite na kihilika na alelebhaho, bhakigheghwa kwa Yesu, naywo kakialamiha bhoha. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Himati hitangalo hya bhandu bhakintughila, kuhuma ku Galilaya na Dekapoli na Yelusalemu na Yudea na kumwambo ya lukemba Yoludani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguahunda bhandu ku kitumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesu pakahibhonite himati hya bhandu, kakikwela kukitumbi na kakitama, na ahundwa bhake bhaking'endela, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />na ywombe kakiyanda kuahunda.<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uyelelo ghwa hoto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Lukasi 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Bhanonelwa bhoha bhaamanya kukita bhangumpala muno Chapanga mumihuki yabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">kiyaha Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga ndo ghwabhe.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Bhanonelwa bhaakukulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">kiyaha bhaayonjokehwa mwoyo.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Bhanonelwa bhaabheghite apole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">kiyaha bhaapeghwa nnima ghwakaalaghite Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Bhanonelwa bhaabhegha na njala na kilyakalyaka kya kughayitikila malaghilo gha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">kiyaha bhombe bhaayukutihwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Bhanonelwa bhaabheghite na lipyanda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">kiyaha bhaamokola lipyanda.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Bhanonelwa bhaabhegha na myoyo ya nyanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">kiyaha bhombe bhatammona Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Bhanonelwa bhala bhaalinganiha malobhe bhandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">mana bhaakemwa bhana bha Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Bhanonelwa bhaapungwa kwa kughayitikila malaghilo gha chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">kiyaha Ghubhutwa ghwa Kunani kwa Chapanga ndo ghwabhe.”<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Yesu kakighendelela kulongela, “Maanonelwa mwenga pala bhandu paabhakokela na kuakambukila uhakata ghwohele kwakya nenga. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Nnyelelwe kwa hilulu, kiyaha lilumbo lyenu ndo likulu kunani kwa Chapanga. Mana ndo ubhwabhu abhu ndo bhakiapamanda ambuye bha Chapanga bhaabheghite pakali ya mwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwenga ndo handa Mwinyu na bhwelu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliki 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Lukasi 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Mwenga ndo handa mwinyu ghwa nnima. Peni handa mwinyu ghwahobheha unogho ghwake ghwahotola bhuli kubhuyila kangi unogho ghwake? Ghungunogha kangi ng'obhe kwa kyohele, ngati ghwaataghwa panje ghulibhatwe na bhandu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Mwenga ndo lubhwelu lwa nnima. Kitami kiichengwite mu kitumbi kinguhotola ng'obhe kuhihika. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Ebu bhandu bhanguyakiha ng'obhe limbamba na kuligubika na kipumbulu ebu nkambo, ngati bhangulubhika pakinyuta, ngati lubhang'alihe bhandu bhoha bhaabheghite unyumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Ubhwabhu abhu lubhwelu lwenu lung'alihe mu ulongolo ghwa bhandu, ngati amokole kughabhona mandendelo ghenu gha maha na bhantike Tate ghwenu ywakabheghite kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahundo kwakya Malaghilo gha Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Nkotoke kuhwacha kukita hika kughabhuha malaghilo gha Musa na mahundo gha ambuye, hika ng'obhe kughabhuha ngati kughatengeleha. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, mbaka nnima na kunani payipala kupita, peni kahone hata kipalamande kichoko kya malaghilo gha Musa kiipala kubhuhwa, mbaka ghoha ghatwihilike. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Basi, ywohele ywakakiluka yimu mu ngwiliho njoko kupitingana kwa hyoha, na kuahunda bhandu bhakatende habhu, kaabhegha nndokwa mu Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga, peni mundu ywakaghatenda malaghilo na kuahunda ayake, aywo kaabhegha nkulu mu Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Ndo mana nunguaghombela yinguakwiliha mughayitikile Malaghilo gha Chapanga kwa kuchweha gumaha muno kupitingana ghula ghwa ahunda bha Malaghilo na Akaafalisayo. Hela bhubho maayingila ng'obhe mu Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makinyo kwa bhandu akotoke kubhegha na kiyaghabhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Lukasi 12:57-59</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />Yesu kakighendelela kulongela, “Nnyihwa kukita bhandu bha makachu paaghombelwa, ‘Ghukotoke kukoma mundu, na mundu ywohele ywakakoma mundu katanoghwa katoswe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Peni nenga ninguaghombela kukita, mundu ywohele ywakannyaghabhalila nnongo ghwake, katanoghwa katoswe. Ywakannyuyuha nnongo ghwake katayeghwa ku libalasa. Na ywohela ywakanng'ombela nnongo ghwake ‘Ghwenga mmughabhugha ghukotolwe.’ Katanoghwa toso ya kutaghwa mu mwoto ghwa kumambe. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Basi, paghuyegha hupo hyako kulikuta na kunu paghukulungwa kukita nnongo ghwako kabhegha na nnando na ghwenga, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />ghuleke hupo hyako apo paulongolo ghwa likuta, ghughende huti ghukalingane malobhe na nnongo ghwako, mbole ghubhuye na ghutule matulo ghako.”<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Kangi kakilongela, “Ghulingane malobhe nkokela ghwako kya kuyumbatika paghubhegha naywo munjila kughenda kulibalasa, ngati nkokela ghwako kakotoke kukukamuha mumabhoko gha nndumula nongwa, naywo nndumula nongwa katakukamuha mumabhoko gha anjolinjoli, na ghwenga ghwaabhopwa mukibhopo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Kulyaghila nungukughombela, ghwaabhuka kata amwo, mbaka paghukamuha ligwala lya uhiko.”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makinyo ghakulinga kuleka utyahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />Yesu kakighendelela kulongela, “Nnyihwa kukita bhandu bhakighombelwa, ‘Nkotoke kubhegha atyahe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Peni nenga nunguaghombela kukita, mundu ywohele ywakannolekeha nndala kwa uhongo ghwa kutyaha naywo, aywo katyaha kala mumwoyo ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Liho lyako lya kibhoko kya nnilo palighutenda ghutende ulemwa, mbaha ghulikolopole, kuliko mmili ghwoha kutaghwa mumwoto ghwa kumambe. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Handa kibhoko kyako kya nnilo pakighutenda ghutende ulemwa, mbaha ghukidumule, kuliko mmili ghwako ghwoha kutaghwa mu mwoto ghwa kumambe.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makinyo yakya kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayu 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliki 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lukasi 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Bhubho yikikambukwa kukita, ‘Mundu ywohele ywakanneka nhumbu ghwake yingukwiliha kanpeghe lihamba lya kulekana.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Peni nenga nunguaghombela, mundu kangunoghwa ng'obhe kunneka nhumbu ywake kwa uhokelo ghwohele, pangi kwa kutenda utyahe, na mundu ywakanneka nhumbu ghwake kwa uhokelo ghwohele ghula, kanguntenda kabheghe ntyahe. Na yula ywakantolela nndala ywakalekitwe, kangutenda utyahe.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makinyo yakya kulapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Kangi nnyihwa kukita bhandu bha makachu bhakighombelwa, ‘Ghukotoke kulaghila kulapa kwa uhwangi, ngati ghutwihilihe kilagho kyako kwa kighunnapilite Bambo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Peni nenga nunguaghombela, kabhone kulapa, hangi kwa kunani kwa Chapanga, kiyaha ndo kiteho kya ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />hangi nkotoke kuulapila nnima, kiyaha nnima ndo pahala pamwene pakuyeghemela maghulu ghake, ebu kwa lihina lya Yelusalemu, kiyaha ndo kitami kya Mutwa nkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Nkotoke kulapa kwa mitwe yenu, kiyaha ghwahotola ng'obhe kutenda luhwili lumu lubheghe lwambulete ebu lupili. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Paghulongela ‘Ena’ Yibheghe ‘Ena’ Na paghulongela ‘Ng'obhe’ Yibheghe ‘Ng'obhe’ Kiyaha ghohele kuchweha kwa agha ghanguhuma kwa yula nhakata.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahundo gha kukanikiha kubhuyiha kibhuyiho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Lukasi 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Nnyihwa kukita yikikambukwa, ‘Mundu pakalikuchumbula liho lyako na ghwenga ghunkuchumbule, na mundu pakaghutupula lino lyako na ghwenga ghuntupule lino lyake.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Peni nenga nunguaghombela, nkotoke kummuyihila kibhuyiho kwa mundu nhakata. Mundu pakakubhakula kulikanja lyako lya nnilo, ghumghalambuhile na lingi. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Handa mundu ywakapala kukutosa ngati katole lighwanda lyako, ghumpeghe na likoti bhubho. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Mundu pakaghulemelela ghupape nhigho ghwake mwanja ghwa maili yimu, ghuupape maili mbili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Ghunpeghe ywakakuyupa, hangi ghukotoke kumdumbila kihogho ywakapala kukuyahika kilibhi.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahundo yakya upalo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Lukasi 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Nnyihwa kukita yikikambukwa, ‘Ghunpale ghanja ywako na ghunkalale myanja ywako.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Peni nenga nunguaghombela, muapale amyanja bhenu na mubhayupile bhala bhaabhakalalila, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />ngati mmokole kubhegha bhana bha Tate ywenu ywakabheghite kunani. Kiyaha ywombe kanguang'aliha luchubha lwake bhandu ahokela na bhandu bha maha, naywo kanguakomela hula bhandu bhanakutenda ghanakunnoghela Chapanga na bhangali kutenda ghangali kunnoghela Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Pamuapala bhala bhanakuapala ghweka, maapata hupo yoki? Bhuli asumula sumu bhangutenda ng'obhe habhu? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Na handa munguatendela gha maha alongo bhenu ghweka, Bhuli mungutenda kyoki kupitingana kwa bhangi? Hata bhandu bhangali kummanya Chapanga bhangutenda ubhwabhu abhu. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Kya habhu mwenga mmeghe atwihiliko handa Tate ywenu ywa kunani pakabhegha ntwihiliko.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Mahundo gha kuatangatila bhandu kapukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Mulindakile, nkotoke kutenda milando ya maha muulongolo ghwa bhandu ngati bhabhatikile, mana pantenda handa habhu, mungumokola ng'obhe hupo kwa Tate ywenu ywakabheghite kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Basi, pamuapegha hilibhi kapukwa, nkotoke kulandamiha handa paatenda afyangu mu nyumba hya kukongamila Akaayahudi na mu hindandabhanji, ngati atikilwe na bhandu. Kulyaghila nunguaghombela akingama kala hupo yabhe. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Peni mwenga pamuapegha hilibhi bhandu kapukwa, mundu ywohele kakotoke kumanya kimukitenda. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Ngati matulo ghako ghabheghe gha lupwepo. Ndo Tate ywako ywa Kunane ywakabhona kwa lupwepo katakupeha hupo pakindandabhanji.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahundo gha mayupo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Lukasi 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Pammegha munguyupa nkotoke kubhegha handa afyangu, kiyaha bhombe bhangupala kuyupa paayima mu nyumba hya kukonganila Ayahudi na mumbwegha ya njila ngati atikilwe na bhandu. Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, bhombe amokola kala hupo yabhe. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Peni ghwenga paghuyupa, ghuyingile mu nyumbakati yako, ghutate nlyango na ghunnyupe Tate ywako ywakabheghite mulupwepo. Naywo Tate ywako ywakabhona mulupwepo katakupegha hupo yako.”<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Na mwenga pammegha mukuyupa, nkotoke kulongela malagho ghangamanyikwa handa paatenda bhandu bhangammanya Chapanga. Kiyaha bhombe bhanguhwacha kukita bhaayunilwa kwa malagho ghabhe matangalo. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Nkotoke kubhegha handa bhombe, kiyaha Tate ywenu kangumanya kila kimukipala kukali na kunnyupa. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Habhu, ndo mungunoghwa kuyupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Tate ghwetu ghuubheghite kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Lihina lyako litikilwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Ghubhutwa ghwako ghuhike</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Lighulipala litendeke kunani na litendeke bhubho mu nnima.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Ghutupeghe lelo hilyo hyetu hya kila linjubha.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Ghutulekekehe ulemwa ghwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">Handa patualekekeha bhala bhaatuhokela.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ghukotoke kutuyingiha mu mayigho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">peni ghutulopohe kuhuma kwa yula nhokelo. Kiyaha Ghubhutwa ndo ghwako na makakala na ukulu hata manjubha ghoha. Ayi mwika.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Kiyaha pamualekekeha bhandu bhangi mahokelo ghabhe, Tate ywenu ywa Kunane naywo kataalekekeha mwenga bhubho. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Peni handa pamualekekeha ng'obhe bhangi bhaabhahokela, na Tate ywenu ywa Kunane kutabhalekekeha ng'obhe uhokelo ghwenu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo gha kulikunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Pamulikunga kulyegha hilyo, nkotoke kutenda handa afyangu, bhaalitenda bhangubhegha na mahyongololo na kukikinala hibhungi hyabhe, ngati abhonekane na bhandu kukita bhalikunga. Kulyaghila nunguaghombela bhombe bhakingama kala hupo yabhe. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Peni pamulikunga kulyegha, nkuhe hibhungi hyenu mpakale mahuta mu mitwe hyenu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />ngati kulikunga kwa mwenga kukotoke kulibhoneha kwa bhandu bhangi, ngati Tate ywenu ywakatama palupwepo, naywo Tate ywenu ywakabhona mu lupwepo kataapegha hupo yenu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhanja lwa Kunane kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Lukasi 12:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Nkotoke kulibhikila luhanja apa pannima, pahala pene hipuluputu na kutu bhanguhanjaghana, na bhanabhwihi bhangutungunyula na kuyibha. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ngati mulibhikile mihanja hyenu kunani kwa Chapanga kwene hipuluputu na kutu bhanguhanjaghana ng'obhe, ebu bhanabhwihi bhangutungunyula kata na kuyibha. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kiyaha palubheghite luhanja lwako, apo ndo mwoyo ghwako ghungubhegha.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liho ndo limbamba lya mmili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Lukasi 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Liho ndo limbamba lya mmili. Handa liho lyako lingubhona maha, mmili ghwako ghwoha ghwaabhegha na bhwelu. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Peni handa liho lyako lya maha ng'obhe, mmili ghwako ghwabhegha na lubhindu. Kya habhu, handa bhwelu luubheghite mu nkati yako ndo lubhindu, alwo ndo lubhindu lwa totoloo!”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumpala Chapanga ebu kuupala utopelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Lukasi 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Kabhone mundu ywakahotola kuatendela mahengo abambo abhili, Kiyaha katankalalila yumu na katanpala yula yungi, ebu katabhegha benibeni na yumu na kumpughana yungi. Maahotola ng'obhe kuntumikila Chapanga na utopelo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Habhu nunguaghombela, nkotoke kubhegha na bhwaghalili yakya ubhumi ghwenu, maalyegha niki ebu maanywegha niki ebu kwakya mmili ghwenu handa maahwala niki. Bhuli, ubhumi ghwenu ghwapitingana ng'obhe kwa hilyo na mmili kupitingana maghwanda! <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Mubhalole hiyuni bha kubhwelo, bhombe bhangubhatika ng'obhe mbeyu ebu bhangubena ng'obhe ebu kubhika mbunje muluhanja, peni Tate ywenu ywa kunani kanguapegha hilyo. Bhuli, mwenga chepa bha utopelo kupitingana abho hibhumbe hya kunani? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ndo ghani mu mwenga ywene kwa bhwaghalili katahotola kuliyonjokehela hata lisaa limu mu ubhumi ghwake?”<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Namwenga, kya bhuli mungughayila mapinda? Mughahwachile malubha gha kumighunda paghamela, ghangutenda lihengo ng'obhe ebu ghangulitendekehela ng'obhe mapinda ghabhe. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Peni nunguaghombela, hata mutwa Sulemani mwene muukulu ghwake ghwoha kakihwalihwa ng'obhe maha handa limoo lya agha malubha. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Basi, handa Chapanga kangughahwaliha habhu manyahi gha kunng'unda, ghene ghangubhegha lelo na kilabho ghangutaghwa mu mwoto, Mwenga bhandu bha uhyubhalilo nchoko! Bhuli Chapanga kataandendela ng'obhe mwenga kupitingana malubha agho?”<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Hinu nkotoke kubhegha na bhwaghalili, pannongela, ‘Twaalyegha niki?’ Ebu ‘Twaanywegha niki?’ Ebu ‘Twaahwala niki?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Mana bhandu bhangammanya Chapanga ndo bhangughayila agho, peni Tate ywenu ywa Kunani kangumanya kukita mungunoghwa kubhegha na ahyo hyoha. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Peni mughupalahe huti Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga, na kughayitikila malaghilp ghake na ghangi ghoha maayonjokehelwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Hino, nkotoke kughayila kilabho, kiyaha kilabho yalighayila yene. Yingunoghwa kwa kila linjubha libheghe na maghayo ghake.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahundo gha kukanikiha kuatosa bhangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Lukasi 6:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Mbole Yesu kakilongela, “Ghukotoke kunng'ombela mundu ywohele kukita ghwenga ndo nhakata, paghutenda habhu Chapanga kataghughombela ghwenga ndo mundu nhakata, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />mana kyabhula pamunng'ombela mundu yungi ndo nhakata, ndo bhubho Chapanga kataghughombela ghwenga ndo nhakata na kipimilo kilakila kighukitumila kwa yungi ndo Chapanga katakitumila kwa ghwenga. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Kyaniki ghungululola lukapi luubheghite mu liho lya nnongo ghwako, peni ghungulilola ng'obhe ghumwene libaku luubheghite mu liho lyako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ebu, ghunguhotola bhuli kung'ombela nnongo ghwako, ‘Ghuleke huti nulubhuhe lukapi luubheghite mu liho lyako, peni liho lyako libhegha na libaku?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Ghwenga nfyangu, ghulibhuhe huti ghumwene libaku liibheghite mu liho lyako, na mbole ghwahotola kubhona maha na kubhuha lukapi luubheghite mu liho lya nnongo ywako.”<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Nkotoke kuapegha galu hilibhi hing'anyimo, bhaaghalambuka na kuakwalambula mabhene, na nkotoke kuapegha maghulubhe hilibhi hya utopelo, kiyaha bhahilibhata.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghuyupe, Ghupalahe na ghukong'onde nlyango</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Lukasi 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Nnyupe kwa Chapanga, namwenga maapeghwa, mpalahe namwenga maamokola, nkong'onde nlyango na mwenga maahughulihwa nlyango. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Mana kila ywakayupa kangupeghwa, ywakapalaha kangumokola na yunakukong'onda nlyango kanguhughulighwa nlyango. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Bhuli, kabhegha ywoheli mu mwenga ywene mwana ywake pakannyupa lingate katampegha libho? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Ebu, handa pakannyupa homba katampegha liyoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Basi, handa mwenga mmegha maahokelo, mungumanya kuapegha bhana bhenu hilibhi hya maha, kulyaghila Tate ywenu ywabheghite Kunane kataapegha kyanalumu hilibhi hya maha bhala bhanakunnyupa.”<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Basi, ghoha ghamughapala kutendelwa na bhandu, na mwenga mubhatendele ubhwabhu abhu. Mana aghu ndo utwihiliko ghwa Malaghilo gha Musa na mahundo gha mambuye bha Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njila yiikepite na njila yiikondite</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Lukasi 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Nnyingile kupitila nlyango ghuukepite, mana nlyango na njila yiighenda kuuhobhelo yikonda, na bhaaghenda mu njila ayi ndo atangalo. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Peni njila yiighenda ku ubhumi yikepa, na nlyango ghwa kuyingilila amwo ndo ghukepa, ndo bhandu bhamandina bhaapala kuyibhona njila ayi.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo na Mapambika ghake.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Lukasi 6:43-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Mulindakile na ambuye ahwangi, bhanakuhika kwa mwenga kunu paahwala mpinda handa mene kwa panje, peni unyumba abhegha handa galu bha kunhitu. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Mutabhamanya kwa mapambika ghabhe ghene ndo mandendelo ghabhe. Bhuli, bhandu bhangunokola misabibu mu mihomi ebu tini mu mitunguluja? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Ubhwabhu abhu nkongo ghwa maha ghungupambika mapambika gha maha, na nkongo nhakata ghupambika mapambika mahakata. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Nkongo ghwa maha ghunguhotola kata kupambika mapambika mahakata na nkongo nhakata ghunguhotola kata kupambika mapambiko gha maha. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Nkongo ghwohele ghwangapambika mapambika gha maha ghwaadumulwa na kutaghwa mu mwoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Habhu, mutabhamanya kwa ndendelo yabhe.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nungubhamanya ng'obhe mwenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Lukasi 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Chepa kila mundu ywakang'ombela, ‘Bambo, Bambo,’ katayingila mu ghubhutwa ghwa kunani, ngati ndo yula ywakatwihiliha ghanakunnoghela Tate ywangu ywa kunani. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Linjubha alyo bhandu atangalo bhatanng'ombela, ‘Bambo, Bambo, tukilandamiha Lilagho lyako kwa lihina lyako na kubhuha mandilu na kutenda mihabho mitangalo!’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Ndo ndabhaghombela, ‘Kulyaghila nikibhamanya ng'obhe. Mmuke kwa nenga, mwenga atenda mahokelo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achenga nyumba abhili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Lukasi 6:47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Habhu, ywohele yunakuyihwa malagho ghangu na kughatenda, ndo handa mundu yunamahala ywakachengite nyumba yake mulitalabha. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Hula yikikoma, na ngumbwa ya machi yikihika na liyegha likipula na kuyituta nyumba yila, peni yikighwegha ng'obhe kiyaha kitamiho kyake kikibhegha mu litalabha.”<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />“Peni ywohele yunakuyihwa malagho ghangu na kutenda kata, aywo ndo handa mundu mmughabhugha ywakachengiti nyumba yake mu nhanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Hula yikikoma, na ngemba yikimema machi ngumbwa na liyegha lukipula na kuyituta nyumba yila, nayo yikighwegha na nging'indo yikibhegha ngulu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likalama lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesu pakayomolite kulongela agho, lumati lwa bhandu lukikangahwa muno na mahundo ghake. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Kiyaha kakihunda handa mundu yunalikalama, hangi chepa handa ahunda bhabhe bha Malaghilo.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangunlamiha mundu yunamaloha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliki 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lukasi 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu pakahulukite kukitumbi, lumati lukulu lwa bhandu lukintughila. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Mundu yumu yunamaloha kakihika na kakinchutamila mayughwa paking'ombela, “Bambo, handa ghungupala, ghwahotola kunyoha.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yesu kakigholoha kibhoko kyake, kakinnyabhika pakalongela, “Nungupala ghuyoheke.” Kamu yula mundu kakilama maloha ghake. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Mbole Yesu kaking'ombela, “Ghuyihwe, ghukotoke kunng'ombela ywohele, ngati ghughende ghukalibhonehe kwa ndundame, na kutula matulo gha ghalaghilitwe na Musa ngati yibheghe ubhoneho kukita ghulamihwa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangunlamiha ndumindumi ywa machonda kilongohi ghwa Akaaloma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Lukasi 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu pakayingiliti ku Kapelinaumu, machonda yumu kilongohi kakinhikila pakinnyupa utangwo, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />kakilongela, “Bambo, ndumitumi ghwangu kaghonja ukaya, ntamwa ghwa ulelebhalo kangi kangubhina munu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Ndahika na kunlamiha.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Peni yula kilongohi ywa machonda kakinng'ombela, “Bambo, nenga nungunoghwa ng'obhe kwa ghwenga kuyingila mu lubhagha lwangu. Peni ghukambuke lilagho ghweka, na nndumindumi ghwangu katalama. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kiyaha na nenga ndo mundu numeghite na makakala, abhegha machonda pahi ya nenga. Panunng'ombela ayu ‘Ghughende,’ naywo kangughenda, na yungi panung'ombela ‘Ghuhike.’ Naywo kanguhika. Na panung'ombela nndumindumi ghwangu ‘Ghutende kilibhi aki.’ Naywo kangutenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu pakayihwite malagho agho kakikangacha, na kakiaghombela bhala bhandu bhaantughilite, “Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, nenga nangammona ng'obhe mundu ywohele hata mu Isilaeli, kabhegha na uhyubhalilo handa aghu. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Basi, nunguaghombela kukita bhandu atangalo bhaahika kuhuma kungeha na kulutipikila luchubha, nabho bhaatama mu chekwa ya kulyegha papamu na Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobu mu Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Peni bhala bhene Akaaisilaeli atangalo bhaahwacha ghubhutwa aghwo ndo ghwabhe, bhatataghwa panji mulubhindu, akwo bhaalila na kuhyagha mino.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Mbole Yesu kakinng'ombela yula machonda kilongohi, “Ghughende ukaya kwako, na yibheghe handa paghuhyubhalila.” Na yula ndumindumi ywake kakilama lisaa lila lila.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangualamiha bhandu atangalo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliki 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lukasi 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesu pakahikite ukaya kwa Petili, kakimmona mama ywa nhumbu ywa Petili kaghonja paulili kangubhina nhehemela. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Kakinnyabhikila kibhoko aywo mama na utamwa ghukinleka, kakiyinuka na kuyanda kukeya kuntelekela.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Payihikite makimuhi bhakinnyeghela bhandu atangalo bhaabheghite na mandilu. Naywo kakighabhuha ghala mandilu kwa lilagho lyake na kualamiha atamwa bhoha. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Agha ghakitendeka ngati litwihilike lila lilagho liikambukitwe na mbuye Isaya handa, “Ywombe katola mihehemela yetu na katola matamwa gha twenga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhanakunoghwa kuntughila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Lukasi 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesu pakabhonite lumati lwa bhandu paluntindila, kakiakwilikiha ahundwa bhake bhayomboke kumwambo ya lihibha. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Nhunda yumu ywa malaghilo kakinng'endela, pakinng'ombela, “Nhunda, nenga ndakutughila kwohele kughupala kughenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yesu kakinnyanga, “Mabweha abhegha na mbako, na hiyuni abhegha na hiyumba, peni Mwana ghwa Mundu kabhegha ng'obhe na pakupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Mundu yungi mu ahundwa bhake kakinng'ombela, “Bambo, ghundegheke huti nikankulile tate ghwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Peni Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Ghundughile, ghubhaleke bhaaghweghite abhakulile bhala bhaaghweghite bhabhe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulinyamahila likusi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliki 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lukasi 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yesu kakikwela mubhwato, na ahundwa bhake bhakintughila. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Paabheghite mu mwanja, pindulu likibwituka likusi likulu mu lihibha mbaka bhwato ghukiyanda kudibala kwa mayukano, peni Yesu kakibhegha kaghonja ng'ono. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Ahundwa bhake bhaking'endela, bhakinnyumuha paalongela, “Bambo, ghutulopohe, tunguhwegha.”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Naywo Yesu kakiaghombela, “Mwenga bhandu munakuhyubhalila kyamandina, kiyaha niki munguyoghopa?” Mbole kakiyinuka na kakililakalila lila likusi na lihibha, na kukibhegha tuli.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Bhala bhandu bhakikangacha, paalongela, “Ayu ndo mundu ywa kya bhuli mbaka likusi na lihibha hingunnyitikila!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangualamiha bhandu abhili bhaabheghite na mandilu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliki 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lukasi 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesu pakahikite kumwambo, ku nnima ghwa Akaagelasi, bhandu abhili bhaakwelitwe na mandilu bhakikongana na Yesu paahuma ku mandogholo. Bhandu abha bhakibhegha akalipa munu, mbaka kahone mundu ywakahotolite kupita mu njila yila. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bhakituta kyobho paakilongela, “Ghubhegha na niki na twenga, Mwana ghwa Chapanga? Bhuli ghunguhika apa kutupamanda kukali ya linjubha liikwilikihitwe?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Patali pamandina kuhuma pahala paabheghite, kukibhegha na lumati lwa maghulubhe paluhakilwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ghala mandilu ghakinnyupa Yesu, “Handa paghutubhuha, ghutuleke tughende, tuyingile mu lula lumati lwa maghulubhe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Kakiaghombela, “Nng'ende.” Habhu bhakiabhuka bhandu bhala. Lumati lwoha lwa maghulubhe likihulukila kwa lubhilo uhelelo nkulu ghwa kitumbi, likiyingila mu luhibha na likihwegha mumachi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Bhala bhaabheghiti mu kuahakila maghulubhe bhakibhutuka lubhilo na bhakeyingila mu kitami, bhakighenda kuaghomela bhandu mihalo hyoha ya milando yiibhabwitukilite bhala bhandu bhaakwelitwe na mandilu. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Mbole bhandu bhoha bha nnima ghula bhakibhuka na kughenda kukongana na Yesu. Na paammonite bhakinnyupa kabhuke mu nnima ghwabhe.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangunlamiha mundu ywakalelebhalite</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliki 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lukasi 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yesu kakikwela mubhwato, kakiyomboka lihibha na kuhika mu kitami kyabhe. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Linjubha alyo alyo bhakinnyeghela mundu ywakalelebhalite, kaghonjekwa mu likahe. Yesu pakabhonitie kuhyubhalila kwabhe, kakinng'ombela yula ywakalelebhalite, “Ghukotoke kutunyuka mwoyo mwana ghwangu, ghulekekehwa ulemwa ghwako.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Kwakya nnando aghwo, amoo bha ahunda bha malaghilo bhakiyanda kuhwacha mu myoyo yabhe, “Mundu ayu kangukundula.”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Peni Yesu kakighamanya mahwacho ghabhe, kakiaghombela, “Kiyaha niki munguhwacha uhokelo mu myoyo yenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Kyoki kiibheghite kiyeyebhu, kulongela, ‘Ulemwa ghwako ghulekekehwa,’ ebu kulongela, ‘Ghuyime ghutyange?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Peni nungupala mmanye kukita Mwana ywa Mundu kabhegha na makakala gha kulekekeha ulemwa mu nnima” Ndo kakinng'ombela yula mundu ywakalelebhalite, “Ghuyime ghutole likahe lyako na ghughende ukaya kwako.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Yula mundu kakiyima, na kakighenda ukaya kwake. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Bhandu bhoha mulula lumati paabhonite agho bhakiyingilwa lyogha, bhakintika Chapanga, ywakaapeghite makakala ghala kwa bhandu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangunkema Matayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliki 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lukasi 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu pakabheghite mu kubhuka akwo, kakimmona mundu yumu lihina lyake Matayu katama pakusulumula sumu. Kakinng'ombela, “Ghundughile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Matayu kakibhuka na kakintughila.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yesu pakabheghite mulubhagha lya Matayu katama kulyegha hilyo, asumula sumu atangalo na bhanaulemwa bhakihika kutama papamu naywo na ahundwa bhake. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Afalisayu paabhonite milando ayi, bhakiakonya ahundwa bhake, “Kiyaha niki nhunda ghwenu kangulyegha papamu na asumula sumu na bhanaulemwa?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Peni Yesu pakaghayihwite agho kakiaghombela, “Bhandu bhanga utamwa bhangumpomela ng'obhe nng'anga ngati bhala bhanautamwa bhangumpomela. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Basi, nng'ende mukalihunde fwambulo ya malagho agha, ‘Ningupomela lipyanda, ngati chepa nyambi.’ Kiyaha hika ng'obhe kuakema bhaabheghiti bha maha, ngati bhanaulemwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangukonywa kwakya kulikunga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliki 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lukasi 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Ahundwa ghwa Yohane yunakubatisa bhakihika na kunkonya Yesu, “Kya bhuli twenga na Akaafalisayu tungulikunga, peni ahundwa bhako bhangulikunga ng'obhe?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Bhuli, ahenja bha yunakutolela bhaahotola bhuli kukukulika paabhegha na yunakutolela? Linjubha lyahika pakabhuka bambo yunakutolela, apo ndo bhatalikunga.”<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Kahone mundu ywakapabhika kipabhiko kya hyono mu likama<figure style="fig" file="11 Unshrunk Patch.jpg" size="col" ref="9:16">Kipabhiko kya hyono mu likama</figure>, kiyaha kila kipabhiko kyakakuka mu likama alyo na pala pakapabhikiti paayonjokeheka. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Ebu bhandu angubhika ng'obhe difwai ya hyono mu nhako ghwa liyula ghuuhakaliti. Handa paatenda naha ghula nhako ghwa liyula lwaabaluka na difwai ya yitika. Na nhako ghwa liyula lyakanjaghanika, peni difwai ya hyono yabhikwaha mu hibhigha ya liyula lya hyono, na hibhigha yaabhegha tela.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhinja ywa kilongohi na nhumbu ywakabyalite lipinda lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliki 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lukasi 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesu pakabheghite kangulongela agho, kamu kakiyingila kilongohi ywa nyumba ya kukonganila Akaayahudi, kakinchutamila mayughwa muulongolo ghwake na kunng'ombela, “Nhinja ghwangu kahwegha hinu hinu. Peni ghughende na ghunnyabhikile kibhoko kyako naywo katalama.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yesu kakibhuka na kakilongohana naywo, ahundwa bhake nabho bhakintughila.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Lisaa alyo alyo nndala yumu ywakabheghite na liholobhela kwa ngungwa kumi na ibhili, kakinhikila Yesu kya kuhyetu na kakilibyala lipinda lyake, <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Kiyaha kakilighombela mumwoyo ghwake, “Handa ndalibyala lipinda lyake, ndaalama.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yesu kakikilibhuka, naywo pakammonitie kakinng'ombela, “Nhinja ghwangu, ghukotoke kutunyuka mwoyo, kuhyubhalila kwako kukulamiha.” Naywo yula nndala kakilama lisaa lilalila.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yesu pakahikite kulubhagha lwa yula kilongohi ywa nyumba ya kukonganila Ayahudi, kakiabhona bhandu bhakipyemba filimbi na lumati lwa bhandu lukibhegha lungukukulika, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />kakiaghombela, “Mmuke, kiyaha nhinja kahwegha ng'obhe ngati kaghonja.” Peni bhombe bhakinheka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Mbole lumati lwa bhandu lukibhuhwa panje, Yesu kakiyingila unyumba na kakinkamula kibhoko, yula nhinja kakiyumuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Mihalo ayi yikikwila munnima ghula ghwoha.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangualamiha bhangabhona abhili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yesu pakabheghite mukubhuka pala, bhangabhona abhili bhakintughila, bhakiyobha kyobho na bhakilongela, “Mwana ywa Daudi ghutupeghe lipyanda.”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yesu pakayingiliti munyumba bhala bhangabhona bhakinhikila. Naywo kakiakonya, “Munguhyubhalila kukita ndahotola kutenda nnando aghu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Bhakinnyanga, “Ena Bambo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Ndo Yesu kakiabyala meho ghabhe na kulongela, “Na yibheghe kwa mwenga handa panhyubhalila.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Meho ghabhe ghakihughuka. Yesu kakiakanikiha, pakalongela, “Nnole, mundu ywohele kakotoke kughumanya nnando aghu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Peni bhombe bhakighenda na kulandamiha mihalo ya Yesu mu nnima ghula ghwoha.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangunnamiha ywangahotola kulongela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Bandu bhala abhili paabheghite bhangubhuka, mundu yumu ywakakwelitwe na mandilu na ywakabheghite ng'obhe na uhotolo ghwa kulongela kakiyeghwa kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Kamu, palibhuhitwe lila lindilu, yula ywangahotola kulongela kakilongela. Lula lumati lwa bhandu lukikangacha na kulongela, “Nnando handa aghu ghunabhonekana ng'obhe mu Isilaeli.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Peni Afalisayu bhakilongela, “Aywo kangughabhuha mandilu kwa makakala gha nkulu ghwa mandilu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atendalihengu bhamandina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yesu kakighenda mu hitami hyoha hya ku Galilaya, kakihunda mu hitutuhi ya kukonganikila Akaayahudi na kulandamiha Nhalo ghwa Maha ya kya ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga, kakilamiha mihehemela nhanganganiko na matamwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Pakaabhonita bhandu himati himati kakiabhonela luhungu kiyaha bhangughaya kyangali utangwo, handa mene bhangali na nhakila. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Habhu kakiaghombela ahundwa bhake, “Mabeno ndo matangalo peni atendalihengo bhamandina, <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Basi, munnyupe Bambo ywa mabeno, ngati kabhalaghile atendalihengo bhabene mabeno ghake.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangualaghila Ahundwa bhake kumi na abhili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliki 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lukasi 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yesu kakiakema bhala ahundwa bhake kumi na abhili, kakiapegha makalama gha kughabhingabhinga mandilu na kulamiha matamwa ghoha. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Agha ndo mahina ghabhe bhala ahundwa kumi na abhili, ghwa ulongohi ndo Simoni ywakakemitwe Petili na Andelea nnongo ghwake, Yakobu mwana ghwa Sebedayu na Yohane nnongo ghwake, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo na Batolomayu, Tomasi na Matayu ywakabheghite nsumula sumu na Yakobu mwana ywa Alufayu na Tadei, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni mundu ywakatutanilite nnima ghwake Yuda Isikaliyote ywakankilukite Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengo lya abho ahundwa kumi na abhili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliki 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lukasi 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesu kakialaghila abho kumi na abhili na kuapegha malagho, “Nkotoke kughenda kwa bhandu bhaabheghite ng'obhe Ayahudi, hangi nkotoke kuyingila mu kitami kyohele kya Akaasamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Peni mbaha nngende kwa Akaisilaeli bhaahobhite handa mene. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Panng'enda mukalandamihe pannongela, ‘Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghuheghelela.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Mualamihe atamwa, mukaahyuhe bhaahweghite, mubhayohe bhabheghite na maloha, mmuhe mandilu. Mpeghwa yaghi, na mwenga muapeghe yaghi. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Nkotoke kutola sahabu, ebu madini ghaakemwa fesa, ebu ngalabha mumihako ya mikungi yenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Nkotoke kutola nhako ghwa mu mwanja, ebu maghwanda mabhili, ebu makubasi ghangi, ebu nkongocho, kiyaha ntendalihengu kangunoghwa kukingama mulyo ghwake.”<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Pannyingila mu kitami ebu kijiji kyohele, mumpalahe mundu ywakapala kuakingama, na ntame kwa ywombe mbaka pampala kubhuka. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Pannyingila mu lubhagha, muajambuhe huti uhihimilo ghubheghe namwenga. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Handa abhegha bhandu bha maha munyumba ayi Chapanga kabhanonele. Peni handa abhegha ng'obhe bhandu bha maha, Chapanga kataanonela ng'obhe bhandu abho. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Handa mundu kanguakingama ng'obhe kubhayihwa mwenga. Basi, mpumunde lihu mumaghulu ghenu pammegha mu kubhuka mu nyumba ayo. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, linjubha lya toso, kitami akyo kyamokola kihyato kikulu kupitingana kila kyaakimokolite bhandu bha hitami hya Sodoma na Gomola.”<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kimbamanda kiipala kuhika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliki 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Lukasi 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Nnole nungualaghila handa mene munkati ya galu bha kunhitu. Hinu mmeghe na malango handa liyoka na apole handa ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Mulindakile na bhandu, kiyaha bhatabhayegha mu njengakaya yabhe na kuatuta mu nyumba hyabhe hya ngonganilo. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Maayeghwa kwa atabhala na abhatwa kwakya nenga, ngati mmokole muaghombele bhombe yakya nenga na kwa bhandu bhaabheghite ng'obhe Ayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Peni paabhayegha munjengakaya, nkotoke kuhwacha kya kulongela, kiyaha maapeghwa kya kulongela lisaa alyo alyo. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Mana chepa mwenga mumpala kulongela, ngati Nhuki ywa Tate ywenu kutalongela kupitila mwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Nnongo katankiluka nnongo ywake kakomwe, na tate katankiluka mwana ywake, bhana bhataakiluka abhele bhabhe na kuatenda akomwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Bhandu bhataapala ng'obhe mwenga kwakya kuhyubhalila nenga. Peni yunakulimbilila mbaka kuuhiko aywo katalopohwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Bhandu paabhapamanda mukitami kimu nng'ende kitami kingi. Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, mayiyomola ng'obhe hitami hyoha hya ku Isilaeli kukali na kubhuya kwa Mwana ywa Mundu.”<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Nhundwa kaahotola ng'obhe kulikweha kwa nnhunda ywake ebu nndumitumi kaahotola ng'obhe kulikweha kwa bambo ywake. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Nhundwa kangunoghwa kubhegha handa nhunda ywake, na nndumindumi kangunoghwa kubhegha handa bambo ywake. Handa nenga ndo nkulu ywa nyumba yenu bhangungema Belisebuli, bhuli mwenga chepa bhaabhakema mahina mahakata kyanalumu!”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ywakanoghwa kuyoghopwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Lukasi 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Basi, nkotoke kubhayoghopa bhandu abho, kiyaha kahone kiigubikitwe kyene kyangagubutuligwa, na kila kiihihitwe kyaahumbulwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Linuaghombela mwenga mu mbwepo, mwenga mulilongele pakindandabhanji, na lila linubhapwepwela, mulilandamihe ngati kila mundu kaliyihwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Nkotoke kubhayoghopa bhala bhanakughukoma mmili peni bhaahotola kata kuukoma nhuki. Mungunoghwa munnyoghope Chapanga ywakahotola kughukanjaghana nhuki na mmili mu mwoto ghwa kumambe. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Bhuli, hidunduli abhili bhanguhemelwa ng'obhe kwa ligwala yimu ghweka? Peni kahone hata yumu ywabhe ywakapala kuponeka kyangali kummanya Tate ywenu. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Hata hwili hya mitwe hyenu Chapanga kahimanya mmalango ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Habhu nkotoke kuyoghopa, kiyaha mwenga bha maha muno muulongolo ghwa Chapanga kupitingana hidunduli atangalo.”<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunnyitikila na kunkana Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8">Lukasi 12:8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Mundu ywohele ywakanyitikila nenga muulongolo ghwa bhandu, na nenga ndannyitikila ywombe muulongolo ghwa Tate ywangu ywa kunani. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Peni ywohele ywakangana nenga mu ulongolo ghwa bhandu, na nenga ndankana mu ulongolo ghwa Tate ywangu ywa kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyegha ng'obhe uhihimilo ngati nyegha ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-52">Lukasi 12:51-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26">14:26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:27">27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Nkotoke kuhwacha kukita nyegha uhihimilo mu nnima, nyegha ng'obhe uhihimilo ngati ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kiyaha hika kuatenda tate na mwana ywake nnume abheghe amyanja, kangi nhinja na mama ywake abheghe amyanja, nakamwa na mama ywa nngwana ywake, <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />na amyanja bha mundu bhaabhegha bha mukaya yake.”<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Mundu ywohele ywakampala tate ywake ebu mama ywake kupitingana nenga, kangunoghwa ng'obhe kubhegha nhundwa ywangu. Na ywohele ywakampala mwana ywake ebu nhinja ywake kupitingana nenga, kangunoghwa ng'obhe kubhegha nhundwa ywa nenga. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Kangi mundu ywohele ywakatola ng'obhe lupingika lwake na kundughila, kangunoghwa ng'obhe kubhegha nhundwa ywanenga. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Ywombe ywakapala kuulamiha ubhumi ghwake kataghuhobheha, naywo ywombe ywakapala kuuhobheha ubhumi ghwake kwakya nenga kataulopoha.”<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaapala kukingama hupo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliki 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Mundu ywohele ywakaatekula mwenga kangundekula nenga na ywohele kangundekula nenga, kanguntekula ywakalaghilite. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Mundu ywohele ywakantekula mbuye kiyaha aywo ndo mbuye, kaakingama hupo ya mbuye, na ywakantekula mundu ywa maha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga, kaakingama hupo ya mundu ywa maha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Mundu ywohele ywakapala kumpegha nnobho ghwa machi, yumu ywa abha adoko kiyaha ndo ahundwa bhangu, kulyaghila nunguaghombela, katapeghwa hupo yake.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohane yunakubatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Lukasi 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesu pakayomolite kualaghila ahundwa bhake kumi na abhili, kakibhuka apo na kakighenda kulandamiha na kuhunda mu hitami hyabhe.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yohane yunakubatisa pakabheghite mu kibhopo, kakiyihwa mihalo yakatenditi Kilisito, kakialaghila ahundwa bhake, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />ngati bhakankonye, “Ghwenga ndo yula ywakapala kuhika, ebu tunlindilile yungi?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Mmuye mukanng'ombele Yohane milando yimuyiyihwa na kuyibhona. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Bhangabhona bhangumokola kubhona, ngwabhengwabhe bhangutyanga, bhanamaloha bhanguyohwa, bhangayihwa bhanguyihwa, bhaahweghiti bhanguhyuhwa na kapukwa bhangulandamihwa Nhalo ghwa Maha. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Kanonelwa mundu yula ywakabheghite ng'obhe na bhwaghalili na nenga.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Bhala ahundwa bha Yohane paabheghite mu kubhuka, Yesu kakiyanda kughomba na bhandu kwa kya Yohane Yunakubatisa. Kakiakonya, “Panng'endite ku kibhala, mukighenda kubhona niki? Nndenge paghupulwa na liyegha? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Handa chepa, mukighenda kubhona niki? Mundu ywakahwaliti mapinda gha maha? Aka kaa, bhala bhaahwaliti mapinda gha maha bhangutama mu nyumba ya abhatwa! <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Basi, mukighenda kubhona niki? Bhuli, kummona mbuye ghwa Chapanga? Ena, kulyaghila mukighenda kummona ywakabheghite nkulu kupitingana mbuye ywa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Aywo ndo ywene mihalo yake yikityekwa, ‘Nnole nungunlaghila mjumbe ywa nenga kakulongolele muulongolo ghwako, ywakapala kuyitendekeha njila yako’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, mu bhandu bhoha bhaabhelekitwe na adala, kanabwituka ng'obhe mundu ywakabheghite nkulu kupitingana Yohane Yunakubatisa, hata habhu, yula ywakabheghite nchoko mu ghubhutwa ghwa kunani, ndo nkulu kupitingana Yohane. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kutandila manjubha gha Yohane Yunakubatisa mbaka hinu, Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghungupundangilwa kwa makakala, na bhabheghite na makakala bhanguyigha kughutola ghubhutwa aghwo. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Mana mambuye bhoha na malaghilo gha Musa mbaka manjubha gha Yohane Yunakubatisa, bhakilondola milando yiipala kubhegha manjubha agha. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Handa mmegha kala kuyitikila ali, ywombe Yohana ndo Eliya ywakalondolitwe kukita katahika. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Ywakabheghite na makutu, kayihwe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Peni kibheleko aki nikihwananihe na kilibhi ghani? Kingulihwana na bhana bhaatamite paligulio paabhakema ayabhe na kualongela, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Tukiahonela ng'oma, peni mukikina ng'obhe, tukiayimbila luyimbo lwa kibhembo peni mukikukulika ng'obhe.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kiyaha Yohane yunakubatisa kakihika, kakilikunga na kakinywegha ng'obhe difwai, nabho bhakilongela, ‘Aywo kakwelwa na lindilu!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana ywa Mundu kakihika, kakilyegha na kunywegha, nabho bhangulongela, ‘Nnole, ayu ndo nhukila na nlobhi, nng'anja ywa asumula sumu na bhanaulemwa.’ Peni malangu gha Chapanga ghangubhonehwa kubhegha gha maha kubhukana na mandendelo ghake.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makinyo kwa hitami hya bhandu bhanga kuhyubhalila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Lukasi 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Mbole Yesu kakiyanda kuhikinya hitami hyakatendite mihabho mitangalo kupitingana kwingi, kiyaha bhandu bhake bhakilipetula ng'obhe. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Kimmone, mwenga mabhandu bha Kolazini na bha ku Betisaida. Kiyaha handa mihabho yiitendikite kwa mwenga, yingalitendekite kwa bhandu bha ku Tilo na bha ku Sidoni, bhandu abho bhangalipetulite kutandila makachu kwa kuhwala malobota na kulityelemeka malihu. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Peni nunguaghombela, mu linjubha lya toso, mwenga maamokola toso ngulu kupitingana bhandu bha ku Tilo na bha ku Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Na mwenga mabhandu bha Kapelinaumu, bhuli, maakwehwa mbaka kunani kwa Chapanga? Aka kaa, maahuluhwa mbaka pahi munu. Mihabho yiitendikite kwa mwenga yingalitendekite kwa bhandu bha Sodoma, kitami kyabhe kingabheghite mbaka lelo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Peni nunguaghombela kukita, linjubha lya toso mwenga maamokola kihyato kikulu kupitingana kya bhandu bha Sodoma.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhike kwa nenga ngati npumulile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Lukasi 10:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Mumanjubha agho Yesu kakilongela, “Ningukulumba Tate, Bambo ghwa kunani na nnima, kiyaha ghukiyihiha mihalo ayi kwa bhanamalango na asomi, na ghughagubutula kwa bhaabheghite handa bhana hing'enya. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ena Tate, ghukighatenda habho kiyaha yikikunogheha. <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Tate ghwangu, kambegha hilibhi hyoha. Kahone mundu ywakammanya Mwana ngati Tate, ebu kahone ywakammanya Tate maha nga Mwana na ywohele yula mwene Mwana kapala kunhwimulila Tate ghwake.”<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Nhike kwa nenga mabhoha munng'ayaghaya na kutopehwa na mihigho, na nenga ndabhapumuliha. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Mulikunge kingongolo kyangu, mulihunde kwa nenga, kiyaha nenga ndo npole na yunauhwamo ghwa mwoyo, na myoyo yenu yaapumulila. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kiyaha kingongolo kyangu kiyeyembhu, na nhigho ghunuapegha muupape ndo nnyeyebhu.” <figure style="fig" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Senga abhili bhangulima paahwala kingongolo</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Bambo ywa Lijubha lya kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliki 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lukasi 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Linjubha limu, Yesu kakibhegha kangutyanga mu mighunda ya ngano Mulinjuba lya Kupumulila. Na ahundwa bhake bhakibhegha na njala, ndo bhakiyanda kughadunyula mahonjo gha ngano na kulyegha mbunje hyake. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Peni Afalisayo paaghubhonite nnando agho, bhakinng'ombela Yesu, “Ghulole, ahundwa bhako bhangutenda nnando ghuukanikihwa Mulinjubha lya Kupumulila!”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Bhuli, munasoma ng'obhe kyakatendite Daudi na ayake paabheghite na njala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Kakiyingila mu Nyumba ya Chapanga na kakilyegha mangati ghaabhikitwe muulongolo ghwa Chapanga, ywombe ebu abho ayake bhakinoghwa ng'obhe kughalyegha, maha bhakiteghekwa kulyegha andundame ghweka chabhe. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Ebu munasoma ng'obhe mu kitabho kya Malaghilo gha Musa kukita kila linjubha lya kupumulila andundame bhanguhokela Malaghilo mu Nyumba ya Chapanga peni angubhonekana ng'obhe kukita ahokela? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Nunguaghombela hoto kukita, ywakabheghite nkulu kupitingana Nyumba ya Chapanga kabhegha apa. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Handa mungamanyite mana ya malagho agha, ‘Ningupala lipyanda, ngati ng'obhe nyambi,’ mangaatosite ng'obhe bhandu bhangauhokelo, <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />kiyaha Mwana ywa Mundu ndo Bambo ywa Linjubha lya Kupumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangunlamiha mundu ywakalelebhalite kibhoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliki 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lukasi 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yesu kakibhuka apo na kakiyingila munyumba yabhe ya kukonganila, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Amwo kakibhegha mundu ywakalelebhalite kibhoko. Bhombe paakipalaha kihokonyo kya kunkokela Yesu, ndo bhakinkonya Yesu, “Bhuli yibhegha tela kulamiha mulinjubha lya Kupumulila?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Ndo ghani mu mwenga ywakabheghite na mene ywake ywene kachumbukila mulibhumba Linjubha lya Kupumulila, katammuha ng'obhe? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Peni mundu ywa utopelo kupitingana mene. Basi, yibhegha tela kutenda gha maha Mulinjubha lya kupumulila.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Ndo kakinng'ombela yula mundu, “Kigholohe kibhoko kyako.” Kakikigholoha nakyo kikibhegha kyamaha handa kila kingi. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Peni Akaafalisayo bhakibhuka panje na bhakighombana yakya kunkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndumitumi ywakahaghulitwe na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Peni Yesu pakaghamanyite mahwacho ghabhe, kakibhuka pahala apo. Bhandu atangalo bhakintughila, naywo kakialamiha bhoha, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />kakiaghombela bhala bhakaalamihite kukita akotoke kulongela ywombe ndo ghani. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Ngati litwihilike lila lilagho lyakakambukite mbuye Isaya pakilongela,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Ghulole nndumitumi ywangu yununhaghulite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">npalo ghwangu yununhaghulite, nyelelwa naywo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Ndaabhika nhuki ghwangu kwa ywombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Naywo katalandamiha ghala ghanuapala bhandu bhaghatende munnima hyoha.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Katalimbana ng'obhe na bhandu ebu kuyobha kyobho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">hangi kahone ywakapala kuyihwa lilobhe lyake mu njila.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Nndenge ghuubajanganite kataudumula ng'obhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Ebu lutambi lututuma lyohi katauhima ng'obhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Mbaka pakapala kutwihiliha toso ya ghala ghaapala kutendekwa yatabhale<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Na kwa ywombe bhandu bha milima hyoha yaabhika udumbilo ghwabhe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliki 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lukasi 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Bhandu bhakinnyeghela mundu ywakakwelitwe na lindilu, naywo ndo ywangabhona na ywangahotola kulongela, Yesu kakinlamiha naywo kakihotola kulongela na kubhona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Bhandu bhoha bhakikangacha na kulongela, “Bhuli, ayu chepa Mwana ywa Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Peni Afalisayu paayihwite nnando aghwo bhakilongela, “Mundu ayu kangughabhuha mandilu kwa makakala gha Belisebuli aywo ndo nkulu ywa mandilu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yesu pakaghamanyite mahwacho ghabhe, kakiaghombela, “Ghubhutwa ghwohele ghuughabhanikite mu himati himati hinakupingikana, ghwaaghendelela kata kubhegha, na nnima ghwohele ebu lubhagha lwohele luughabhanika mu himati himati hinakupingikana ghwatengeleheka kata. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Handa Nchipila kangumminga Nchipila, kangulipingika mwene. Basi, ubhutwa ghwake ghwatengelehwa bhuli? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Na nenga handa nungughabhuha mandilu kwa makakala gha Belisebuli, bhuli afwasi bhenu angughabhuha mandilu kwa makakala gha ghani? Hinu naha, abho ndo bhataatosa mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Peni handa nenga nungughabhuha mandilu kwa Nhuki ghwa Chapanga, ndo nmanye kukita Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga ghubhahikila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Ebu mundu katahotola bhuli kuyingila mu nyumba ya mundu yunamakakala na kughupoka utopelo ghwake handa kanammopa ng'obhe yula yuna makakala? Pakammopa kala, kulyaghila katahotola kumpoka utopelo ghwake.”<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Ywoheli yunakubhegha ng'obhe papamu na nenga kangumbingikiha, na ywakakungana ng'obhe papamu na nenga, kangupwilinganya. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Basi, nunguaghombela, bhandu bhaalekekehwa, ulemwa ghwohele na ngundulo, peni ywaankundula Nhuki ghwa Chapanga kaalekekehwa kata. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Mundu ywohele ywakakambuka lilagho kihyengo kya Mwana ghwa Mundu katalekekehwa, peni ywohele yaakambuka lilagho kihyengo kya Nhuki ghwa Chapanga kahone kulekekehwa, mu nnima aghu ebu mu nnima ghuupala kuhika.”<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo na mapambiko ghake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Lukasi 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Ghuutende nkongo ghubheghe ghwa maha na mapambiko ghake ghaabhegha gha maha, ebu ghuutende nkongo ghubheghe nhakata na mapambika ghake ghaabhegha mahakata, kiyaha nkongo ghwaamanyikwa kwa mapambika ghake. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Mwenga kibheleko kya liyoka. Mahotola bhuli kukambuka mihalo ya mah, na mwenga malemwa? Kiyaha nnomo ghwa mundu ghwaakambuka ghala gha memiti mu mwoyo ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mundu ywa maha ghuyibhuha mihalo ya maha kuhuma muluhanja lwa mwoyo ghwake, naywo mundu nhakata kangubhuha malagho mahakata kuhuma muluhanja lwa mwoyo ghwake.”<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Peni nunguaghombela, mulinjubha lya toso bhandu bhaabhuha mmalango mumalagho ghoha gha uhila mahala ghabhaghakambukite. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kiyaha kwa malagho ghako ghwaabhalangwa kukita ghwangauhokelo muulongolo ghwa Chapanga, kwa malagho ghako ghwatoswa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naho ya Yona</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliki 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Lukasi 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Mbole amoo bha Afalisayo na ahunda bha malaghilo bhakinng'ombela Yesu, “Nhunda tungupala kubhona naho kuhuma kwa ghwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Peni ywombe kakiayanga, “Kibheleko kihakata na kya utyahe kingupala naho. Peni kyaakamuhwa ng'obhe naho ywohele ngati nga yila ya mbuye Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Kiyaha handa bhula Yona pakabheghite mulutumbo lwa homba Ywakakemwa nyangumi kwa manjubha mandatu pamuhi na pakilo, ubhwabhu abhu Mwana ywa Mundu katabhegha mu mwoyo ghwa nnima majubha mandatu, pamuhi na pakilo. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Linjubha lya toso bhandu bha Ninawi bhaayima papamu na kibheleko aki na kukitosa, kiyaha bhombe bhakilipetula paalandamihitwe na Yona, hinu apa kabhegha nkulu kupitingana Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Mutwa nndala ywa kusini katayima mu linjubha lya toso na katakitosa kibheleko aki, kiyaha mwene kakihika kuhuma ku uhiko ghwa nnima ngati kakaghayihwe mahala gha Solomoni na mu mwenga kabhegha nkulu kupitingana Solomoni.”<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuya kwa lindilu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Lukasi 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Lindilu palimmuka mundu, lyabhyelabyela pahala paabheghite ng'obhe na machi pakipalaha ng'ebhu ya kupumulila, peni katamokola ng'obhe. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Mbole lyaalongela, ‘Ndabhuya mu nyumba yangu yimukite’ Naywo pakabhuya kaayibhona yila nyumba ya yaghi, yipyaghilwa na kubhikwa maha. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Mbole lyaaghenda na kubhayegha mandilu bhangi saba, ahakata kupitingana ywombe, nabho bhaayingila na kutama amwo. Na kuuhiko aywo mundu katabhegha tepatepa kupitingana kalongohi. Habhu ndo yabhegha kwa kibheleko aki kihakata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mama ywa Yesu na alongo bhake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliki 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lukasi 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesu pakabheghite mukulongela na lumati lwa bhandu, mama ywake na alongo bhake bhakiyima panje bhakipala kuyobhela naywo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Ndo mundu yumu kakinng'ombela Yesu, “Bambo, mama ywako na alongo bhako ayima panje, bhangupala kuyobhela na ghwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Peni Yesu kakinnyanga na kunng'ombela yula mundu, “Mama ghwangu ndo ghani, na alongo bhangu ndo aghani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Palapala, kakiakigholohela kibhoko kyake kuabhonea ahundwa bhake, pakilongela, “Abha ndo mama ywangu na alongo bhangu. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Kiyaha ywohele ywakatenda mapalo gha Tate ywangu ywa kunani, aywo ndo nnongo ywangu, nhacha ywangu na mama ywangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa Nkweta mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliki 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lukasi 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Linjubha alyo alyo Yesu kakihuma panje ya nyumba na kakitama pambweha ya Lihibha. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Lumati lukulu munu lwa bhandu lukikwemukana pa lukintindila mbaka yikinkwiliha kayingile mu bhwato na kakitama amwo, na bhandu bhoha bhakeyima mu mbwegha ya luhibha. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ndo kakiaghombela milando miyoloho kwa mihwano, pakalongela, “Nkanda lutupi kakighenda kukweta mbeyu hyaki kunng'unda. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Pakabheghite mu kukweta mbeyu ahyo, yingi yikiponeka umbwegha ya njila, hiyuni bhakiihonyola. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Mbeyu yingi yikiponeka mu malibho ghaabheghite na lutupi luchoko. Kamu, yikibhonekana yikimela kya kulopokela kiyaha lutupi lukibhegha luchoko. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Peni luchubha paluhomokite, mimela yila yikiyuma kiyaha hikibhegha ng'obhe na ngigha ndali. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbeyu yingi yikiponeka mu mikongo ya mihomi, nahyo yikiyukwa na mihomi ahyo. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Mbeyu yingi yikiponeka mu lutupi lwa mbosela nayo yikimela na kupambika mapambika, yimu kwa mbinda mabhoko kumi, yingi kwa mbinda mabhoko sita na yingi kya mbinda mabhoko ndatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Ndo Yesu kakiaghombela, “Yunamakutu na kayihwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likaho lya kuhunda kwa mihwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliki 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lukasi 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ahundwa bhake Yesu bhaking'endela na bhaknkonya, “Kiyaha niki ghunguyobhela na bhandu kwa mihwano?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Mwenga nnonelwa kuyimanya mbwepo ya Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani, peni abha bhanapeghwa ng'obhe kughamanya agha ghoha. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Mana mundu ywohele ywene kangumanya yakya ghubbhutwa ghwa kunani, Chapanga katannyokehela kumanya kyanalumu, peni yula ywakamanya kachoko yakya Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani, Chapanga katabhuha hata kila kichoko kyakakimanya. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ndo mana nunguyobhela nabho kwa mihwano, kiyaha bhangulolekeha ghanughatenda peni handa bhangughabhona ng'obhe, bhanguyihwa ghanughalongela peni bhangughayihwa ng'obhe na bhangumanya ng'obhe. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Habhu, kwa bhombe ghungutwihilika ulondohi ghwa mbuye Isaya pakalongelite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Abha bhandu bhaayihwa na kuyihwa, peni bhaamanya ng'obhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kulola bhaalola, peni bhaabhona ng'obhe.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Kiyaha mioyo ya bhandu abha yibhegha na unonopo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">bhanguyihwa ng'obhe kwa makutu ghabhe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na bhaghagubika meho ghabhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Hela bhubo, bhangabhonite kwa meho ghabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">bhangamanyiti kwa mahala ghabhe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na kunkilibhukila na kualamiha, kalongela Bambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na nenga ningabhalamihite.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Peni mwenga nnonelwa, kiyaha Chapanga kabhatangatila mwenga mmone na machikilo ghenu ghanguyihwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Kulyaghila nungubhaghombela, Ambuye atangalo na bhandu bha maha bhakibhegha na uhongo ghwa kughabhona ghala ghamughabhona peni bhakighabhona ng'obhe, na bhakibhegha na uhongo ghwa kughayihwa ghala ghamughayihwa peni bhakighayihwa ng'obhe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangufwambula nhwano ghwa nkweta mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliki 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lukasi 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Basi, mwenga nnyihwe fwambulo ya nhwano ghwa yula mundu ywakaghendite kukweta mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Mundu ywohele pakayihwa lilagho lya Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga kyanga kulimanya, ndo handa yila mbeyu yiiponikiti munjila, yula Nchipila katahika na kunyahula kila kiibheghite mumwoyo ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Yila mbeyu yiiponikiti mu malibho luubheghite nalutupi luchoko ndo nhwano ghwa mundu ywakayihwa lilagho alyo na kamu kangulikingama kwa kuyelelwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Peni kabhegha ng'obhe na ngigha mumwoyo ghwake, kataghendelela kulibhika kwa manjubha machoko na paghuhika nndaluko ghwa himbamanda na lung'ahi kwakya lilagho alyo, kamu kangudunyuka mwoyo. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Yila mbeyu yiiponikite mu mikongo ya mihomi, ndo nhwano ghwa mundu ywakayihwa alyo lilagho, peni bhwaghalili ghwa nnima aghu na unyeghelehi ghwa utopelo ghunguliyuka lilagho alyo, nalyo kupambika kata. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Peni yila mbeyu yiimelite mu lutupi lwa mbosela ndo nhwano ghwa mundu ywakayihwite lilagho alyo na kulimanya. Kulyaghila aywo kangupambika mapambika, paka pambika yimo mbinda mabhoko kumi, yingi mbinda mabhoko sita na yingi mbinda mabhoko ndatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa misapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesu kakiaghombela bhandu nhwano ghungi pakalongela, “Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghungulihwana na mundu ywakakwetiti mbeyu ya maha munng'unda ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Peni bhandu paaghonjite, nmyanja ywake kakihika na kakikweta masapi mumpunga ghula, na kakibhuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Paghumelite mpunga na kusukuka, masapi nagho ghakibhonekana. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Andumindumi bha yula nkolanng'unda bhaking'endela na kunng'ombela, ‘Nkulu, twenga tukikwenta mbeyu ya maha munng'unda ghwako. Hinu, masapi ghahuma kwoki?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Kakiayanga, ‘Nmyanja ndo ywakatendite nnando aghwo.’ Bhakinkonya, ‘Bhuli, ghungupala tughende tukaghatupule?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Peni ywombe kakiayanga, ‘Ng'obhe, nkotoke kughatupulanga, kiyaha pamughatupula masapi maahotola kutupula na mpunga bhubho. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Nneke mpunga na misapi yikule papamu mbaka manjubha gha mabeno. Mumanjubha agho gha mabeno ndabhaghombela bhanakubena bhakakungane misapi huti, bhaghabhope hinginja hinginja ngati bhaghayoche mwoto, mbole bhakungane ngano na kuhiyegha mu luhanja lwangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwno ghwa Mbeyu yiikemwa Haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliki 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lukasi 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesu kakiaghombela bhandu nhwano ghungi, “Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghungulihwana na mbeyu ya nkongo ghuukemwa haladali yiitolitwe na mundu yumu na kuyikweta munng'unda ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Mbeyu ayi ndo njoko munu kupitingana mbeyu hyoha, peni payimela kala yingubhegha ngulu kupitingana mimela hyoha. Na kangi yingukula na kubhegha nkongo, mbaka hiyuni ghwa kubhwelo bhanguhika na kuchenga hiyumba mu mapanyu ghake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa Amila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20">Lukasi 13:20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesu kakiaghombela nhwano ghungi, “Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghungulihwana na amila yene nndala kakitola na kuyihangangana na ukobha hikapu hindatu mbaka ghwoha ghukitutumuka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likaho lya Yesu kutumila mihwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maliki 4:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yesu kakiaghombela bhandu agha ghoha kwa nhwano. Kakiaghombela ng'obhe kyohele kyanga nhwano. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Ngati lilagho liikambukitwi na mbuye ywa Chapanga libwitukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ndalongela nabho kwa mihwano;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">ndafwambula ghala ghahihitwe kutandila kubhumbwa kwa nnima aghu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fwambulo ya nhwano ghwa misapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Mbole Yesu kakialagha bhala bhandu, na kakiyingila mu nyumba. Ahunda bhake bhakinng'endela na bhakenng'ombela, “Ghutufwambulile ghula nhwano ghwa misapi kunng'unda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Nkweta mbeyu ywa yila mbeyu ya maha ndo Mwana ywa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Ghula nng'unda ndo nnima aghu. Yila mbeyu ya maha ndo bhala bhandu bhene ghubhutwa ndo ghwabhe. Peni yila misapi ndo bhala bhandu bha yula Nchipila. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Nmyanja ywakakwetite ghala misapi ndo Nhipila. Mabeno ndo uhiko ghwa nndaluko na bhanakubena ndo mahoka bha Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Handa bhula misapi payikunganwa na kuyochwa mwoto, ubhwabhu abhu ndo yabhegha manjubha gha uhiko, <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana ywa Mundu kataalaghila mahoka bha Chapanga, nabho bhataakungana kuhuma mu Ghubhutwa ghwake bhala bhoha bhanakuyambuha ulemwa, na bhanakutenda uhokelo, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />na kubhatagha mu mwoto ghwa lihumbika, na akwo bhaalila na kuhyagha mino kubhukana na mabhino makalipa. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Mbole bhala bhandu bhaatenda ghanakunnogheha Chapanga handa luchubha mughubhutwa bha Tate ghwabhe. Yunamachikilo na kayihwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa utopelo ghuhihitwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghungulihwana na utopelo ghuhihitwe munng'unda, mundu yumu pakang'amulite kakighuhiha kangi. Kakiyelelwa munu mbaka kakighenda kuhemengana hyoha hyakabheghite nahyo, na kakighuhemela nng'unda ghula.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa usanga ghuukemwa Lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Kangi Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapangu ghungulihwana na mundu yumu nhemengana ywakapalaha madini gha lulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Pakapatite lulu yimu ya utopelo nkulu, kakighenda kuchuusa hyoha hyakabheghite nahyo na kakiihemela lulu yila.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa njaho ya kughomeha homba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Kangi, Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga ghungulihwana na njaho yiitaghitwe na aghomeha homba mulihibha, na yikighomeha homba nhanganganiko. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Payimemite bhandu bhakiyikwemula pambweha ya lihibha, bhaketama na bhakeahaghula homba bha maha na bhakeabhika mu hikapu hyabhe na bhala bha maha ng'obhe bhakeatagha. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Habhu ndo yaabhegha linjubha lya kuuhiko, bbaabwitukila mahoka bha Chapanga na bhataabhaghula bhandu ahakata na bhala bha maha, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />na kuatagha bhala ahokelo mumwoto ghwa lihumbika. Akwo bhaalila na kuhyagha mino.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhanja lwa hyono na lwa makachu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yesu kakiakonya, “Bhuli, muyimanya fwambulo ya agho ghoha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Bhakinnyanga, “Ena tuyimanya.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ndo kakiaghombela, “Habhu, nhunda ywa Malaghilo gha Musa ywakabhegha nhundwa ywa Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga kangulihwana na nkolakaya ywakabhuha muuhanja lwake hilibhi hya hyono na hya makachu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulemwa akwo Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliki 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lukasi 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesu pakayomolite kulongela mihwano ayi kakibhuka apo, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />na kakighenda ku kijiji kyake. Akwo kakibhegha kanguahunda bhandu mu nyumba hya ngonganilo hyabhe mbaka bhakikangacha, bhakilongela, “Ayu kaghamokola kwoki malango na mihabho ayi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Bhuli, ayu chepa yula mwana ywa ntendehi ywa uselemala? Bhuli, mama ywake chepa kangukemwa Malia? Na alongo bhake chepa Yakobu na Yosefu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Na ahacha bhake chepa abha bhangutama papamu na twenga? Basi kaghamokola kwoki agha ghoha?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ndo bhakinlema. Peni Yesu kakiaghombela, “Mbuyi ywa Chapanga kanguhokamilwa kwoha, ngati chepa mu nnima ghwake mwene na mualongo bhake” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Kya habhu, kakitenda ng'obhe mihabho mitangalo kwakya kulepelwa kuhyubhalila kwab bhombe.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Kiho kya Yohane Yunakubatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliki 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lukasi 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Mumanjubha agho, Mutwa Helode ywa ku Galilaya kakiyihwa mihalo ya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Ndo kakiaghombela andumindumi bhake, “Aywo ndo Yohane Yunakubatisa, kahyuka, na makakala gha kutenda mihabho ghangutenda lihengo kwa ywombe.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Helonde ndo ywakankamulite Yohane, na kakimmopa na kakinnhwinda mukibbopo kwakya Helodia nhumbu ywa Filipo nnongo ghwake, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />kiyaha Yohane kakinnongela Helode kukita, “Yingunoghelwa ng'obhe kwa ghwenga kuntola nndala aywo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helode kakipala kunkoma Yohane, peni kakiayoghopa bhandu kiyaha bhombe, bhakinng'amula kukita Yohane kakibhegha Mbuye ywa Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Linjubha limu muchekwa ya kukulungwa kubhelekwa kwake Helode, nhinja ywa Helodia kakikina muulongolo ghwa bhandu mbaka Helode kakiyelelwa munu, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />hata kakilagha kwa kulapa, kunpegha aywo nhinja kyohele kyakapala kukiyupa.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Naywo kunu paanyeghelehwa na mama ghwake, kakilongela, “Ghumbeghe mutwe ghwa Yohane Yunakubatisa mu kipalo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mutwa kakihyongoloka muno, peni kubhukana kila kilapo kyakalapitie muulongolo ghwa bhandu, kakikwilikiha kukita kapeghwe nyupo yake. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Basi, Helode kakikwilikiha Yohane Yunakubatisa kakadumulighwe mutwe mula mukibhopo. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Mutwe ghwake ghukiyeghwa mu kipalo, na bhakenpegha yula nhinja, naywo kakinnyeghela mama ywake. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ahundwa bha Yohane bhakihika, na bhakiutola mmili ghwake na bhakighukulila. Mbole bhakighenda kunng'ombela Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguapegha hilyo bhandu elfu nhano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliki 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lukasi 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohane 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yesu pakayihwite mihalo ya kukomwa kwa Yohane, kakibhuka apo kwa bhwato na kakighenda pahala pangali bhandu ngati kabheghe ghweka. Peni bhandu paamanyite kwakaghendite bhakintughila kupitila kuluhingu kuhuma mu hitami. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Basi, pakahulukiti pambwegha ya luhingu, kakilubhona lumati lukulu lwa bhandu, kakiabhonela luhungu na kakialamiha atamwa bhabhe.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Payihikite makimuhi, ahundwa bhake bhakinng'endela na bhakinng'ombela, “Apa patubheghite kahone bhandu bhaatama, na luchubha lungutipika. Hinu ghubhalaghe bhandu ngati aghende muhijiji hyabhe bhakalihemelele hilyo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Bhangunoghwa ng'obhe abhuke Mwenga muapeghe hilyo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Peni bhombe bhakinng'ombela, “Tubhegha nagho mangati nhano ghweka na homba abhili.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Munyeghela apa.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Kakiakwilikiha bhandu atame mumanyahi, mbole kakighatola ghala mangate nhano na bhala homba abhili, kakilolekeha kunani kwa Chapanga kakighanonela na kakighametulanga, mbole kakiapegha ahundwa bhake agho mangati na bhala homba, nabho ahundwa bhake bhakiapegha bhandu abho. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Bhandu bhoha bhakilyegha na bhakiyukuta. Mbole ahundwa bhakikungana mahighalo na bhakimemekeha hikapu kumi na hibhili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Mmalango ghwa bhandu bhaalyeghite bhakibhegha alumi elfu nhano, kyanga mmalango ghwa adala na bhana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangutyanga unane mwa machi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliki 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohane 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Kamu, Yesu kakiakwilikiha ahundwa bhake ayingile mubhwato, bhalongolele kumwambo ya lihibha ywombe pakabheghite mukualagha himati hya bhandu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Mbole ya kubhalagha bhandu, kakikwela ku kitumbi ghweka chake kuyupa. Payibheghite makimuhi, ywombe kakibhegha akwo ghweka chake, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Na mumasaa agho ghula bhwato ghukiheghelela kuhika pakati ya lihibha, peni yikibhegha mumapughwo kwakya liyegha lighuututite.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Pakilo ugheghela na kuchegha, Yesu kakiaghendela ahundwa bhake pakatyanga unani mwa machi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ahundwa bhake paammonite pakatyanga unani mwa machi bhakiyoghopa munu, bhakilongela, “Ndo lijini” Bhakiyobha kyobho kwa lyogha. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Kamu, Yesu kakilongela nabho, “Ntetebhale. Ndo nenga nkotoke kuyoghopa” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Petili kakinng'ombela, “Bambo, handa ndo ghwenga hoto, ghung'ombele hike kwaghwenga ndyange unani mwa machi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Ghuhike!” Basi, Petili kakihuluka mubhwato na kakityanga mumachi kakinng'endela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Peni pakabhonite likusi kakiyingilwa na lyogha, naywo kakiyanda kudibala, kunu pakayobha kyobho, “Bambo, ghunopohe.”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Kamu, yesu kakigholoha kibhoko kyake na kakinkamula na kakinng'ombela, “Ghwenga ghwa uhyubhalilo nchoko, kya bhuli ghukibhegha na lyogha?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Na paakwelite mu bhwato likusi likiyima. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Ndo bhoha bhaabheghite mubhwato bhakintundamila Yesu paalongela, “Kulyaghila ghwenga ndo Mwana ywa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangualamiha atamwa akwo Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliki 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Bhakiyomboka lihibha na bhakihika ku nnima ghwa Genesaleti <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Bhandu bha akwo pabhanmanyite kukita ndo Yesu, bhakikweha nhalo aghwo kwoha mu nnima aghwo. Habhu, bhakinnyeghela atamwa bhoha, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bhakinnyupa kabhategheke anbyale nga lupindo lwa lipinda lyake, nabho bhoha bhaanbyalite bhakilamihwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mahundo gha hilongohi bhetu Akaayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliki 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Mbole, amoo bha Afalisayu na ahunda bha Malaghilo bhakihika kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, bhakinhikila Yesu na bhakinkonya.<verse eid="MAT 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Kyabhuli ahundwa bhako bhangughakiluka mahundo gha ahunda bhetu bha makachu? Mana bhombe bhangukuha ng'obhe muhinoghwa handa hitohe hyetu, kukali ya kulyegha.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Kyabhuli na mwenga munguyitikila ng'obhe Malaghilo gha Chapanga kwakya mahundo gha aghohi bhenu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kiyaha Chapanga kakilongela, ‘Ghubhahokamile Tate na mama ywako na ywakanligha tate ebhu mama ywake, kakomwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Peni mwenga munguhunda kukita, handa mundu abhegha na kilibhi kya kuntangatila tate ywake ebhu mama ghwake, peni kalongela, ‘Aki kya Chapanga.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Basi, munguhunda ghungunoghwa ng'obhe kunhokamila tate ebhu mama ywako kwa kuntangatila kumpegha kilibhi akyo. Ndo pamuliyuyuha Lilagho lya Chapanga kwa kutughila mahundo ghenu mabhene. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Mwenga maafyangu. Isaya kakilondola tela yakya mwenga pakalongela,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Chapanga kangulongela bhandu abha bhangulongela bhanguhokamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">peni myoyo yabhe yibhegha kutali na nenga<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Kutundamila kwa bhombe kungutangatila ng'obhe kilibhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">bhanguhunda mahundo ghaayandihitwe na bhandu ghweka, na chepa mahundo gha nenga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milando yakuntenda mundu kayitikilwe kubhegha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliki 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yesu kakilukema lula lumati lwa bhandu na kakiaghombela, “Nnyihwanile na mmanye. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Kiintenda mundu kakotoke kuyitikilwa kubhegha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga, chepa kila kiinnyingila mu nnomo ghwake, ngati ndo malagho ghanakummuka munnomo ghwake.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Mbole ahundwa bhake bhakinng'endela na bhakinng'ombela, “Ghungumanya kukita akaafalisayo bhakekalala munu paayihwite mihalo yila yighuyikambukite?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Peni ywombe kakiayanga, “Mmela ghwohele ghuupanditwe ng'obhe na Tate ywangu ywa kunani, ghwatupulwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Mubhaleke bhene, mana bhombe ndo hilongohi bha bhangabhona, bhaabhalongoha bhangabhona ayabhe. Na handa ywangalbhona katanlongoha ywangabhona nnyaki, bhoha abhili bhaachumbukila mulibhumba.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petili kakilongela, “Ghutufwambulile mana ya nhwano agho.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yesu kakiakonya, “Hata mwenga nkali kang'amula? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Bhuli, mungumanya ng'obhe kukita kyohele kiyingiliti mu nnomo kyaghenda mu lutumbo na mbole kyabhuhwa panje kupitila mumahi? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Peni kila kihuma mu nnomo kinguhuma mu mwoyo, na akyo ndo kinguntenda mundu kakotoke kuyitikilwa muulongolo ghwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kiyaha mu mwoyo ghanguhuma mahwacho gha uhakata, kukoma, utyahe, ungongola, bhwihi, uyimiho ghwa uhwangi na maligho. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Agho ndo ghanguntenda mundu kakotoke kuyitikilwa kubhegha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga, peni kulyegha kyangakuha mabhoko kunguntenda ng'obhe mundu kakotoke kuyitikilwa kubhegha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhyubhalila kwa nndala ywa kuhuma ku Kanani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliki 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yesu kakibhuka pala na kakighenda ku milima yiibheghite ugheghela na mbande hya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Basi, nndala yumu ywa ku Kaanani ywakatamite ugheghela na mbande ahyo kakinhikila Yesu, kakiyobha kunu pakalongela, “Ghummonele luhungu Bambo, Mwana ywa Daudi, nhinja ywangu kakwelwa na lindilu na kangupamandika munu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Peni Yesu kakiyanga ng'obhe lilagho. Ndo ahundwa bhake bhaking'endela paannyupa munu, bhakenng'ombela, “Ghunng'ombele kaghende kiyaha kangugendelela kutututila kyobho.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Naghilwa kwakya kualopoha mene bha Chapanga bhaahobhite, bhandu bha Isilaeli.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Peni yula nndala kakihika, pakanchutama mayughwa mukulongolo ghwa Yesu, pakalongela, “Bambo ghundange.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yesu kakinnyanga, “Yibhegha maha ng'obhe kuhitola hilyo hya bhana na kuataghila galu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Yula nndala kakinnyanga, “Kulyaghila Bambo, peni hata galu bhangulyegha mahighalo ghaahighalo gha abambo bhabhe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Ndo Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Nndala, kuhyubhalo kwa ghwenga kubhegha kukulu, yabheghe kwa ghwenga handa mughupala.” Naywo nhinja ywake kakilama kutandila lisaa lila lila.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangualamiha bhandu atangalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yesu kakibhuka apo na kakighenda mumbweghambweha ya lihibha lya Galilaya, kakikwela kitumbi na kakitama. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Bhandu atangalo bhakinhikila, bhakiayegha atebhalo, ngwabhengwabhe, bhangbhonaa, bhangayihwa, na bhangi atangalo, bhakiatamika mu ulongolo ghwa maghulu ghake naywo Yesu kakialamiha. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Bhandu abho bhakikangacha muno paabhonite bhangalongela bhangulongela, atebhalo bhakilamihwa, ngwabhengwabhe bhangutyanga na bhangalola bhangubhona, bhakinkweha Chapanga ywakatundamilwa na Akaaisilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguapegha hilyo kangi bhandu elfu ncheche</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliki 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Basi, Yesu kakiakema ahundwa bhake kakiaghombela, “Nungulubhonela luhungu lumati alu lwa bhandu, kiyaha abhegha na nenga kwa manjubha mandatu na abhegha ng'obhe na hilyo hyohele hiihighalite, na nenga mbala ng'obhe kubhalagha paabhegha na njala ngati akotoke kuhima mu njila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Ahundwa bhake bhakinkonya, “Apa tubhegha pangabhandu, twamokola kwoki hilyo hya kuakwila bhandu abha bhoha?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yesu kakiakonya, “Mmegha na mangati malingi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Bhakinnyanga, “Mangate saba na hihomba hyamandina.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yesu kakilughombela lula lumati lwa bhandu atame pahi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Kakighatola ghala mangate saba na hila hihomba hyamandina, kakinnumba Chapanga, kakihimetula na kakiapegha ahundwa bhake, nabho bhakiaghabhila bhandu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Bhoha bhakilyegha na kuyukuta, mbole ahundwa bhake bhakikungana mahighalo na bhakimemekeha hikapu saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Bhala bhaalyeghiti bhakibhegha alumi elfu ncheche, kyanga kubhalangwa adala na bhana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ndo Yesu kakialagha bhandu, kakihubhuka mu bhwato na kakighenda ku mbande ya Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhangupala naho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliki 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Lukasi 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Amoo bha Afalisayo na Asadukayo bhakinhikila Yesu na kung'eha kwa kunnyupa kabhatendele naho kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Peni Yesu kakiayanga, “Payihika makimuhi mwenga mungulongela, ‘Kilabho kwaachegha maha, mana bhwelo lubhegha nkele.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na malabhila mungulongela ‘Lelo kwabhegha na hula, kiyaha bhwelo lubhegha lukele na mahundi ghabhegha totolo.’ Basi, mwenga mungumanya muno kufwambula midaluko kwa kulola bhwelu, peni mungulepelwa kumanya mmoneho ghwa naho ghabhoneka manjubha agha. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Kibheleko kya bhandu ahokelo na kyangali kuhyubhalika kwa Chapanga! Kingupala naho, peni kyapeghwa ng'obhe naho yohele ngati kyapeghwa yila naho ya Yona ghweka.” Yesu kakialeka na kakibhuka.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amila ya Afalisayo na Asadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliki 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ahundwa bha Yesu pabhayombokite kumwambo ya lihibha, bhaking'amula kukita bhakilibhala kutola mangate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Mulindakile mulikingikihe na amila ya Afalisayo na Asadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Bhombe bhakiyanda kughombana bhombe kwa bhombe, paalongela, “Kangulongela habhu kiyaha tutola ng'obhe mangate.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesu kakimanya kyakabheghite mukulongela, ndo kakiaghombela, “Mwenga bhandu mummeghite na uhyubhalilo nchoko! Bhuli, mungughombana kyangali kutola mangate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Bhuli, nkali kumanya? Bhuli mungukulugwa ng'obhe pametulite ghala mangate nhano bhakelyegha bhandu elfu nhano? Bhuli, mukimemekeha mahighalo hikapu hilingi? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ebu ghala mangate saba bhakeghabhilwa bhandu elfu ncheche, bhuli mukikungana mahighalo gha hikapu hilingi. <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Bhuli mukimanya ng'obhe kukita nikibhegha nungulongela ng'obhe na mwenga yakya mihalo ya mangate? Mulindakile na amila ya Afalisayo na Asadukayo. <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Apo ndo ahundwa bhakimanya kukita kangulongela ng'obhe kwakya amila ya kutendekeha mangate, ngati kwakya mahundo gha Afalisayo na Asadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kangulongela pekupeku kukita Yesu ndo Mwana ywa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliki 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lukasi 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu pakahikite mbande ya Kaisalia Filipi, kakiakonya ahundwa bhake, “Bhandu bhangulongela kukita Mwana ywa Mundu ndo ghani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bhakinnyanga, “Bhangi bhangulongela kukita ndo Yohane Yunakubatisa, bhangi Eliya, bhangi Yelemia ebu yumoo ywa akaambuye.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yesu kakiakonya, “Bhuli, mwenga mungulongela kukita nenga ndo ghani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Petili kakinnyanga, “Ghwenga ndo Kilisito, Mwana ywa Chapanga ywakabheghite na ubhumi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yesu kakilongela, “Mbaha ghwenga, Simoni mwana ywa Yona, kiyaha kahone mundu ywohele nhalo aghu, ngati Tate ywangu ywa Kunane ywakakubhonehite. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Na nenga ningukughombela, ghwenga ndo Petili na mulitalabha ali ndachenga ngwemuko lya bhandu bhanakunhyubhalila Kilisito, kangi makakala gha kiho ghatalihotola ng'obhe. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ndakupegha kihughulilo kya Ubhutwa ghwa kunani, ngati lyohele lighulitata mu nnima, lyaatatwa na Kunane, na lyohele lighukihughula mu nnima, lyahughulighwa na Kunane bhubho.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Mbole kakiaghombela ahundwa bhake akotoke kunng'ombela mundu ywohele kukita ywombe ndo Kilisito.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulongela yakya kimbamanda na kiho kyake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maliki 8:31—9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lukasi 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kutandila manjubha agho Yesu kakiyanda kuaghombela ahundwa bhake kukita yingunkwiliha kughenda ku Yelusalemu, na kumokola hibamanda hitangalo kwa mayambuho gha aghohi, akulu bha andundame na ahunda bha malaghilo na kukita yaannogha kuhwegha na linjubha lya ndatu katahyuka.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Apwo Petili kakintola pambwegha na kakiyanda kunlakalila, kakilongela, “Chapanga kaghatakulile kutali milando ayi, milando ayi yikotoke kukubwitukila.”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yesu kakinng'alambukila kakinng'ombela Petili, “Ghubhuke muulongolo gwangu, Nchipila. Ghwenga ndo kipingiko kwanenga. Ghwenga ghunguhwacha ng'obhe gha Chapanga ngati gha anabhandu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Mbole, Yesu kakiaghombela ahundwa bhake, “Mundu ywohele ywakapala kubhegha nfwasi ywangu, yingunkwiliha kalileme mwene, kalutole lupingika lwake na kandughile. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kiyaha ywohele ywakapala kughulopoha ubhumi ghwake kataghuhobheha. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Peni mundu ywakaghuhobheha ubhumi ghwake kwakya nenga kataghumokola. Bhuli, mundu katamokola niki handa pakaghumukola utopelo ghwoha ghwa unnima na kunu kanguhobheha ubhumimi ghwake? Ebu mundu katabhuha kilibhi ghani kihyengo kya ubhumi ghwake? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kiyaha Mwana ywa Mundu katahika mu ukulu ghwa Tate ghwake papamu na mahoka bhake, na apo katankamuha kila mundu kubhukana na mandendelo ghake. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Nunguaghombela hoto, Abhegha bhangi bahapa apa bhene bhaahwegha ng'obhe kukali na kummona Mwana ywa Mundu pakahika mu Ghubhutwa ghwake.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangughalambuka Kibhungi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliki 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lukasi 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Mbole ya manjubha sita Yesu kakiatola Petili, na Yakobu na Yohane nnongo ghwake, kakighenda nabho mbaka kunani mwa kitumbi kitandamaho akwo akibhegha ghweka chabhe. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Akowo Yesu kakighalambuka kibhungi muulongolo ghwabhe, kibhungi kyake kiking'ala handa lichubha na mapinda ghake ghakibhegha ghambulete handa lung'ali. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Kamu, bhala ahundwa andatu bhakiabhona Musa na Eliya, paayobhela na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Apwo Petili kakinng'ombela Yesu, Bambo, nungubhona maha twenga tutame apa. Na handa ghwapala ndachenga hibanda hindatu, kimu kyako, kingi kya Musa na kingi kya Eliya.<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Pakabheghite kakali pakalongela agha lihundi liing'anyimiti, likiagubika na lilobhe likilongela kuhuma mulila lihundi, “Ayu ndo Mwana ywangu yunumpala, yunyelilitwi naywo munu, mu nnyihwe ywombe.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Bhala ahundwa paaghayihwite agha bhakeghwegha pahi makukama, na bhakeyingilwa na lyogha. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Peni Yesu kakihika na kuabyala kakiaghombela, “Nkotoke kuyoghopa nnyinuke.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Pabhayinulite meho ghabhe, bhakimmona ng'obhe mundu yungi ywohele ngati ndo Yesu ghweka.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Paabheghite mukuhuluka ku kitumbi, Yesu kakialaghila, “Nkotoke kunng'ombela mundu ywohele mabhono agha ghamughabhonite, mbaka Mwana ghwa Mundu pakahyuka kuhuma mu kiho.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Bhala ahundwa bhakinkonya, “Kya bhuli ahunda bha malaghilo bhangulongela kukita yingunkwiliha Eliya kahike huti?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Aywo ndo hoto, yingunkwiliha Eliya kahike huti kutendekeha milando hyoha. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Peni nunguaghombela, Eliya kahika kala, nabho bhandu bhakimmanya ng'obhe, na bhakintendela ghoha ghabhaghapalite. Ubhwabhu abhu Mwana ywa Mundu katapamandwa mu mabhoko ghabhe.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ndo bhala ahundwa bhakimanya kukita kakibhegha kanguyobhela nabho mihalo ya Yohane Yunakubatisa.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangunnamiha nhongolo yunalindilu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliki 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Lukasi 9:37-43a</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Pabhahikite mu lumati lwa bhandu, mundu yumu kakinhikila Yesu na kunchutamila mayughwa muulongolo ghwake, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />kakilongela, “Bambo, ghummonele luhungu mwana ywangu. Ywombe kanakihilika na kangubamandika munu. Maghenda maghenda kangughwegha mu mwoto ebhu mu machi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Nikinnyegha kwa ahundwa bhako peni bhakelepelwa kunlamiha.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yesu kakiyanga, “Mwenga kibheleko kyanga kuhyubhalila na kiihobhite, ndaatama na mwenga mbaka pakiki? Munnyeghe nhongolo apa kwa nenga.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yesu kakililakalila lila lindilu, nalyo likimmuka yula nhongolona kakilama lisaa lila lila.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Mbole, ahundwa bhake bhaking'endela Pahala paabheghite bhombe ghweka chabhe, na bhakinnkonya, “Kiyaha niki twenga tukilepelwa kulibhuha lila lindilu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Kubhukana na kuyubhalila kwa mwenga kuchoko. Nunguaghombela hoto, pammegha na kuhyubhalila kuchoko handa mbunje ya nkongo nhaladali, maahotola kukighombela kitumbi aki, ‘Ghubhuke apa ghughende pala,’ nakyo kyaabhuka. Hangi kahone nnando ghwangahotoleka kwa mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Lindilu handa ali, habhu lyabhuka kata kyangali kuyupa na kulikunga.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulongela kangi kulinga kiho kyake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliki 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Lukasi 9:43b-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Linjubha limu paabheghite bhangutama papamu na ahundwa bhake akwo Galilaya, Yesu kakiaghombela, “Mwana ywa Mundu katakamuhwa mu mabhoko gha bhandu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Nabho bhatankoma na linjubha lya ndatu katahyuka.” Ahundwa bhake bhakihyongoloka munu.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhomba sumu ya Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Mbole ya Yesu na ahundwa bhake kuhika ku Kapelinaumu, asumula sumu ya Nyumba ya Chapanga bhakinnhikila Petili na kunnkonya, “Bhuli, nhunda ywenu kanguhomba sumu ya Nyumba ya Chapanga?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Petili kakiayanga, “Ena, ywombe kanguhomba.” Petili pakabhuyite ukaya kukali hata na kunng'ombela kilibhi, Yesu kakiyanda kunkonya, “Ghwenga ghungumanya niki Simoni? Abhatwa bha nnima bhangupongola mapongolo na sumu kuhuma kwa aghani? Bhuli, kuhuma kwa akola nnima bhabe ebu kwa ahenja?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petili kakinnyanga, “Kuhuma kwa ahenja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Hinu akola nnima bhabhe bhalekekehwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Peni ngati tukotoke kuakalaliha myoyo yabhe, ghughende ku lihibha ghukataghe ndoano. Ghuntole homba ywa ulongolo ghuunng'omeha, ghubakatule nnomo ghwake, amwo ghwayibhona ngalabha, ghuyitole ghukahombe sumu ya ghwenga na nenga.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Ghani ywakabheghite nkulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliki 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lukasi 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Mu manjubha ghala ahundwa bha Yesu bhaking'endela na bhakinkonya, “Ywoki ywakabhegha nkulu mu Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yesu kakinkema mwana yumu, na kakinnyimiha pakati yabhe, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />mbole kakilongela, “Nunguaghombela hoto, handa panng'alambuka ng'obhe kubhegha handa bhana, maayingila ng'obhe mu Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ywohele ywakalihuluha handa mwana ayu, aywo ndo kaabhegha nkulu mu Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Ywohele yunakunkingama mwana nchoko handa ayu kwakya nenga, kangungingama nenga.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyabuha bhangi kutenda ulemwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliki 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lukasi 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Handa mundu ywohele kangunnyambuha yumoo ywa bhana adoko abha bhaanakuhyubhalila nenga atende ulemwa, yingabheghite mbaha kwa ywombe kabhopwe libho likulu lya kuhyaghila mu nntandala ghwake na kadibahwe mu machi njulwa gha lihibha. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Mutakibhona bhandu bha nnima aghu kubhukana na milando ya yinakuyambuha bhandu bhangi atende ulemwa. Milando ayi mbaka yibheghe, peni kimmone yula ywakayiyambuha.”<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Handa kibhoko ebu kighulu kyako kingukuyambuha kutenda ulemwa, ghukidumule na ghukakitaghe kutali na ghwenga. Yibhegha mbaha kwa ghwenga kuyingila mu ubhumi paghubhegha ng'obhe na kibhoko kimu ebu kighulu kimo, peni chepa kutaghwa mu mwoto paghuhegha na mabhoko mabhili ebu maghulu mabhili. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Na liho lyako palikuyambuha ghutende ulemwa ghulikopole na kulitagha kutali. Yibha mbaha kwa ghwenga kuyingila mu ulami na liho limo, peni chepa kutaghwa mu mwoto gha manjubha ghoha ghwanga kuhimika paghubhegha na meho mabhili.”<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa mene ywakahobhite</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Lukasi 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Mulindakile, nkotoke kumpughana yumoo ywa adoko abha. Nunguaghombela, mahoka bhabhe akwo kunani abhegha manjubha ghoha muulongolo ghwa Tate ywangu ywa kunani. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Kiyaha Mwana ywa Mundu kakihika kualopoha bhala bhaahobhite.”<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Mungubhona bhuli? Handa mundu kabhegha na mene mia yimu, na yumu mubhala pakahobha, kataaleka ng'obhe bhala tisini na tisa ku kitumbi na kughenda kunnonda yula yumu ywakahobhite? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Nunguaghombela hoto pakammona, katayelelwa kyanalumu kwakya aywo mene yumu kupitingana kwa bhala tisini na tisa bhangahobha. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Ubhwabhu abhu Tate ywenu ywa kunani kangupala ng'obhe hata yumu mu abha adoko kahobhe.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnongo ywako ywakakuhokela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Handa nnongo ywako kaghuhokela, ghughende ghukammonehe uhokelo ghwake pammegha abhili ghweka chenu. Handa katakuyihwa ghwammokola kangi nnongo ghwako. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Handa kaghuyihwa ng'obhe, ghuntole mundu yumu ebu abhili papamu na ywombe, ngati kwa mahwacho gha bhandu abhili ebu andatu nnando ghwohele ghuyimihwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Handa pakalema kuayihwa abho ghulighombele ngwemuko ya bhandu bhaanhyubhalila Kilisito na abho ayimiho abhili, handa pakalema kuliyihwa ngwemuko alyo, aywo kabheghe kwa ghwenga handa mundu ywangammanya Chapanga na nsumula sumu.”<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukanikiha na kutegheka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Nunguaghombela hoto, kyohele kimukitata munnima, kyatatwa kunani, na kubhopa mu nnima kyabhopoleghwa kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Kangi nunguaghombela, handa abhili mumwenga, bhaayitikilana munnando ghwohele ghwa kuyupa, bhaatendelwa na Tate ywangu ywa kunani. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kiyaha pohele pala paakwemuka bhandu abhili ebu andatu kwakya nenga, nenga mmegha pakati yabhe.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa ndumindumi ywangalekekeha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Mbole Petili kakinkonya Yesu, “Bambo, nnongo ghwangu kanhokele mala hilingi na nenga nunlekekehe? Bhuli, mala saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yesu kakinnyanga, “Nungukughombela ng'obhe mala saba ghweka, ngati saba mala sabini. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Kiyaha Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghungulihwana na mutwa yumu ywakapalite kukaghula mmalango ghwa ngalabha hyake na andumindumi bhake. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Pakayandite kutenda mmalango ghwa ngaabha hyake, mundu yumu ywakabheghite na lighambo lya hichako elfu kumi hya sahabu, kakiyeghwa kwa ywombe. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Kiyaha aywo mundu kakibhegha ng'obhe na kya kubhuyiha lila lighambo, bambo ywake kakikwilikiha kachuhuswe ywombe, nhumbu ywake, bhana bhake na hyoha hyakabheghite nahyo ngati lila lighambo libhuyihwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Yula nndumindumi kakinchutamila mayughwa pakannyupa yula bambo pakalongela, ‘Nungukuyupa ghunimbilile, na nenga ndalibhuyiha lighambo ali’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Yula bambo ywa yula nndumindumi kakimmonela luhungu, na kakililekekeha lighambo lyake lyoha na kakinneka kaghende.”<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Peni yula nndumindumi pakabheghite mu kubhuka panje, kakikongana na nndumindumi nnyake ywakannyahikilite ligwala mia yimu ya madini gha fesa. Kakinkamula, kakintita ntandala na pakinng'ombela, ‘Ghummuyihile kila kinukuyahikiti.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Yula nndumitumi nnyaki kakichutamila mayughwa, pakinnyupa, ‘Nungukuyupa ghunimbilile, na nenga ndakuhomba lighambo lyako lyoha.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Peni kakilema. Kihyengo kyake, kakighenga kunhwinda mukibhopo mbaka pakabhuyiha lila lighambo. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Andumindumi ayake paabhonite ghaabwitukilite, bhakikalala munu, nabho bhakighenda kunng'ombela bambo ghwabhe milando hyoha yiibwitukite. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Ndo yula bambo kakinnkema yula nndumindumi na kakinng'ombela, ‘Ghwenga nndumindumi nhakata. Nenga nikighulekekeha lighambo lyako lyoha paghunyupite. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Bhuli, yikikungogha ng'obhe kunmonela luhungu nndumindumi nnyako handa nenga panughubhonilite luhungu?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Kwa kiyaghabhu yula bambo ghwake kakinkamuha yula nndumindumi ghwake kwa machonda bha kibhopo ngati kapamandwe mbaka pakahomba lighambo lyoha lyakayahikitwe.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yesu kakiyomolela pakalongela, “Habhu ndo Tate ywangu ywa kunani katantendela ywohele mu mwenga handa katanlekekeha ng'ohe nnongo ywake ywakanhokelite kuhuma mumwoyo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulongea kulinga nhalo ghwa kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliki 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu pakayomolite kulongela malagho agho, kakibhuka Galilaya na kakighenda ku Yudea, kumwambo ya lukemba lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Lumati lukulu lwa bhandu lukinntughila, naywo Yesu kakialamiha ukwaku ako.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Amoo bha Afaliayu bhaknhikila bhankonye kyakuntegha, “Bhuli, yibhegha tela kwa nngwana kumpegha nhumbu ywake lihamba lya kulekana kwa nnando ghwohele?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Bhuli, mukisoma ng'obhe mumalemba gha Chapanga kukita kundandila makachu apo, Chapanga kakiabhumba mundu nngwana, na mundu nhumbu. <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Chapanga kakilongela, ‘Kya habhu, mundu katanneka tate ywake na mama ywake naywo bhaalungana na nhumbu ywake na abho abhili bhaabhegha mmili ghumu.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Habhu, abho chepa abhili kangi, ngati abhegha mmili ghumu. Kya abhu kila kyakakilungite Chapanga, mundu kakotoke kughabhaniha.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Peni bhombe bhakinkonya, “Kiyaha niki Musa kakilaghila kukita mundu katanpegha nhumbu ywake lihamba lya kuleka na kunneka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Musa kakiategheka kualeka ahumbu bhenu kubhukana na unonopo ghwa myoyo yenu. Peni kutandila makachu yikibhegha habhu ng'obhe. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Nenga nunguaghombela, mundu ywohele ywakanneka nhumbu ywake, manipangi kwa kutenda utyahe ghweka, pakatolela nhumbu yungi aywo kangutenda utyahe. Naywo ywakatolela yula nhumbu ywakalekitwi kangutenda utyahe ubhwabhu abhu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Ahundwa bhake bhakinng'ombela, “Handa milando yene ndo habhu kwa nngwana na nhumbu, mbaha mundu kakotoke kutolela.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Chepa bhandu bhoha bhanakuhotola kulikingama lilagho ali, ngati kwa bhala ghweka bhanakutangatilwa na Chapanga kutenda habhu. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Mana kubhegha bhaaponekiliywe na lukuhu kiyaha abhelekwa habhu, bhangi atendwa habhu na bhandu, na bhangi bhalitenda habhu kwakya Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani. Ywombe ywakahotola kulikingama lilagho ali na kalikingame.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguanonela bhana adoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliki 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lukasi 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Mbole, amoo bhandu bhakennyeghela Yesu bhana adoko ngati kabhayabhikile mabhoko ghake mu mitwe yabhe na kubhayupila. Peni ahundwa bhake bhakialakalila bhala bhaabhayeghite bhana. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yesu kakilongela, “Mualekeke bhana adoko ahike kwa nenga, nkotoke kuakanikiha, kiyaha Ghubhutwa ghwa Kunane ndo ghwa bhala bhaabheghite handa bhana abha.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Naywo kakiayabhikila mabhoko ghake mu mitwe yabhe, mbole, kakibhuka akwo.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhongolo yunautopelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliki 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lukasi 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Mundu yumu kakinhikila Yesu na kakinkonya, “Nhunda ywa maha, ndende nnando ghani ghwa maha ngati mokole ubhumi ghwa manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Kiyaha niki ghungungema ywa maha? Kahone ywakabhegha ywa maha nga Chapanga ghweka chake. Peni paghupala kuyingila mu ubhumi ghuyitikile ngwilikiho.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Yula mundu kakinkonya, “Ngwilikiho hyoki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu kakinnyanga, “Kukoma kata, utyahe kata, kuyibha kata, uyimiho ghwa uhwangi kata, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />ghubhayitikile tate ywako na mama ywako, na ghunpale nnyako handa paghulipala ghumwene.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Yula nhongolo kakinng'ombela, “Agha ghoha nighakamula kala, ndende niki kangi?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Handa paghupala kubhegha ntwihiiko, ghughende ghukahemengane hilibhi hyoha highubheghite nahyo na ngalabha ahyo ghukaapeghe kapukwa, na ghwabhegha na utopelo ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga, mbole ghuhike ghundughile.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Yula nhongolo pakayihwite agho, kakighenda kunu pakahyongoloka, kiyaha kakibhegha na utopelo ntangalo.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Ndo Yesu kakiaghombela ahundwa bhake, “Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, yabhegha unonopo kwa yunautopelo kuyingila mu Ghubhutwa ghwa kunanie kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Nungubhuyila kuaghombela, yabhegha uyeyebhu kwa nnyama ywakakemwa ngamia kupita mu lilanga lya sasia peni chepa kwa yunautopelo kuyingila mu Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ahundwa bhake paayihwite agho bhakikangacha munu na bhakinkonya, “Ndo ghani hino kaahotola kulopoka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Peni Yesu kakialolekeha na kakiaghombela. “Kwa anabhandu nnando aghu ghwaahotoleka kata, peni kwa Chapanga milando hyoha yinguhotoleka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Ndo Petili kakinnyanga, “Ghulole, twenga tuhileka hyoha na kughutughila ghwenga, twaamokola niki?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, Mwana ywa Mundu pakapala kutama mukiteho kyake kya Utabhala kya ukulu mu unnima ghwa hyono, mwenga mundughilite maatama mu hiteho kumi na ibhili pamuatosa kabila kumi na ibhili hya Isilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na ywohele ywakalekite nyumba ebu nnongo ebu nhacha ebu tate ebu mama ghwake ebu bhana bhake ebu mighunda, kwakya nenga, katamokola mala mia yimu kuchweha, na katapeghwa ubhumi ghwa manjubha ghoha ghangapela. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Peni atangalo bhaabheghite bha kalongohi bhaabhegha bha uhiko na bhaabheghite bha uhiko bhabhegha bha kalongohi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Atenda lihengo munng'unda ghwa misabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghungulihwana na mundu ywakabheghite na nng'unda ghwa misabibu, ywene kakibhuka malabhila putiputi kuabhika atendalihengo mu nng'unda ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Kakilingana nabho kuapegha ligwala limu lya madini gha fesa kwa linjubha, mbole, kakiayegha ku nng'unda ghwake ghwa misabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Payihikite musaa ndatu malabhila, kakiabhona bhandu bhangi bhaabheghite ng'obhe na lihengo lya kutenda, ayima mu ligulio. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Kakiaghombela, ‘Nng'ende mukatende lihengo munng'unda ghwangu ghwa misabibu, na nenga ndabhapegha kiibhanoghwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Basi, bhakighenda. Aywo nkola nng'unda kakibhuka kangi payihikite saa sita na bhubho saa tisa kakitenda ubhwabhu habhu. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Hata payihikite saa kumi na yimu makimuhi, kakibhuka kangi, kakiabhona bhandu bhangi bhaayima pala paligulio. Basi, kakiakonya, ‘Kiyaha niki muyima apa leghi leghi tipi kyanga lihengo?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bhakinnyanga, ‘Kiyaha kakibhegha ng'obhe mundu ywakatupeghite lihengo lya kutenda.’ Naywo kakiaghombela, ‘Nng'ende mukatende lihengo mu nng'unda ghwangu ghwa misabibu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Payihikite makimuhi, yula nkola nng'unda ghwa misabibu kakiaghombela nnyimiha ywake, ‘Ghubhakeme atendalihengo na ghubhahombe lihombo lyahabhe, ghutandile kwa bhala bhaninganite nabho kuuhiko na mbole kwa bhala bhaaninganite nabho kalongohi.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Basi, atenda lihengo bhaakemitwe mu saa kumi na yimu, bhakikingama kila yumu ligwala yimu lya madini gha fesa. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Habhu, bhala bha kalongohi paahikite bhakihwacha kukita bhaahombwa kyanalumu, peni kila yumu kakihombwa bhula bhula ligwala limu lya madini gha fesa. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Paahombitwe kala ligwala lya madini gha fesa, bhakinhyongolekela yula nkola nng'unda, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />paalongela, ‘abha bhandu bhaahikite kuuhiko bhatenda lihengo kwa lilaa limu ghweka, bhuli ghututendela tela na bhombe kunu twenga tulimbilila lihengo linakutopo, na leghi leghi tipi muluchubha?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Yula nkola nng'unda kakinnyanga yumoo ywabhe, ‘Ghanja, nughupugha ng'obhe kilibhi. Bhuli, tukilingana ng'obhe nikuhombe lihombo lya ligwala limu kwa linjubha limu? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Ghutole lihmbo lyako, ghughende ukaya. Nungupala kunhomba ayu ywa kuuhiko handa panughupeghite ghwenga. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Bhuli, nenga nungunoghwa ng'obhe kutenda kila kinukipala muutopelo ghwangu namwene? Bhuli, ghungubhona tama kiyaha nenga ndo mundu ywa maha?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yesu kakiyomola kwa kulongela, “Ubhwabhu abhu ywa uhiko katabhegha ywa kalongohi na ywa kalongohi katabhegha ywa uhiko.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulongela kangi mala ya ndatu yakya kiho na kuhyuka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliki 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lukasi 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu papamu na ahundwa bhake atangalo bhakibhegha bhangughenda ku Yelusalemu, pakabheghite munjila, kakiatola bhala ahundwa bhake kumi na abhili, kakighenda nabho pambwegha, na kuyobhela nabho ghweka chabhe, kakiaghombela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Nnyihwe. Tungughenda ku Yelusalemu, na akwo Mwana ywa Mundu kaayeghwa mumabhoko kwa mandundame akulu na ahunda bha Malaghilo, na akwo bhatantosa kakomwe, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />mbole, bhatannyegha kwa bhandu bhaabheghite ng'obhe Ayahudi ahotole kunnyuyuha na kuntuta hinjupunjupu na kummamba mulupingika, peni linjubha lya ndatu katahyuhwa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mama kangupala bhana bhake bhabheghe akulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliki 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Apwo mama ywabhe bhana bha Sebedayo kakinhikila Yesu papamu na bhana bhake, kakichutamila mayughwa mu ulongolo ghwake na kunnyupa kilibhi.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yesu kakinnkonya, “Ghungupala niki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Aywo mama kaking'ombela, “Ghulaghe, kukita yumu ywa abha bhana bhangu abhili, yumu katame mu mbande yako ya nnilo na yungi mu mbande yako ya ngiya ku Ghubhutwa ghwako.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yesu kakinnyanga, “Mwenga mungukimanya ng'obhe kila kimukiyupa. Bhuli, manguhotola kunyweghela nnobho ghumbala kunyweghela nenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Bhakinnyanga, “Tunguhotola.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Kulyaghila nnobho ghwangu ghwa kimbamanda mutaghunywela, peni kutama mbande yangu ya nnilo ebu ya kungiya, ali lyanenga kata kuapegha. Tate ywangu kalamula kala ndo ghani kaatama ku nnilo ebu ku ngiya ya nenga.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Bhala ahundwa bhangi mbinda mabhoko yimu paaghayihwite agho, bhakiakalalila abho alongo abhili. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Habhu, Yesu kakiakema bhoha papamu, na kakiaghombela, “Mungumanya kukita atabhala bha nnima aghu bhanguatabhala bhandu kwa makakala, na hilongohi bhabhe bhanguatumikiha bhaabheghite mu utabhala ghwabhe. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Peni kwa mwenga yikotoke kubhegha habhu, ngati ywakapala kubhegha nkulu mu mwenga kangunoghwa kabheghe ndumintumi ywa bhoha, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />na kila ywakapala kubhegha ghwa kalongohi mu mwenga kangunoghwa kabheghe mmandwa ywenu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Handa bhula Mwana ywa Mundu kakihika ng'obhe kutumikilwa, ngati kuatumikkila na kuuhobhegha ubhumi ghwake kwa kuatenda bhandu atangalo ahotole kulopoka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangualamiha bhangalola abhili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliki 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lukasi 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesu na ahundwa bhake paabheghite bhangubhuka ku kitami kya ku Yeliko, lumati lukulu lwa bhandu lukintughila. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Basi, kukibhegha na bhangalola abhili atama pambwegha ya njila. Pabhayihwite kukita Yesu kangupita apwo, bhakiyobha kyobho paghalongela, “Bambo, Mwana ghwa Daudi, ghutubhonele luhungu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Lula lumati lwa bhandu lukialakalila na kualongela atame jii. Peni bhombe bhakichweha kuyobha kyobho, “Bambo, Mwana ywa Daudi, chonde ghutubhonele luhungu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yesu kakiyima na kakiakema, kakiakonya “Mungupala nuatendele niki?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bhakinnyanga, “Bambo tungupala tuhotole kubhona.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yesu kakiabhonela luhungu, kakiabyala meho ghabhe, kamu bhakihotola kubhona, nabho bhakintughila.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguyingila ku Yelusalemu kwa Chekwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliki 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lukasi 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohane 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yesu na ahundwa bhake pabhaheghelelite kuhika ku Yelusalemu, bhakihika ku Betifage mukitumbi kya Miseituni, apo kakialaghila ahundwa bhake abhili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />kakiaghombela, “Nng'ende mbaka ku kijiji kiibheghite muulongolo ghwenu, maammona kaputa kabhopwa, na mwana ywake kabhopwa pambwegha, muabhopole na mubhayeghe kwa nenga. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Handa mundu pakabhakonya kiyaha niki munguatola, munnyange, ‘Bambo kanguapala,’ kamu, kataabhuyiha.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Nnando aghu ghukitendekwa ngati ghatwihilike ghala ghaalongelitwe na mbuye,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Mukighombele kitami kya Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Nnole mutwa ywako kanguhika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Ndo mpole na ywakahika katama unane mwa kaputa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">unane na mwa kaputa, mwana ywa kaputa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Habhu, bhala ahundwa bhakighenda kutenda handa paalaghilitwe na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Bhakinnyegha yula kaputa na mwana ywake, bhakiyalila ngubho hyabhe mu mighongo yabhe na Yesu kakitama kunani mwabhe. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Lumati lukulu lwa bhandu lukiyalila ngubho hyabhe munjila, na bhandu bhangi bhakidumula hiputila gha mikongo na kuhiyalila munjila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Lumati lwa bhandu hiilongohanite na bhala bhaantughilite bhakikweha malobhe, “Katikilwe Mwana ywa Daudi. Yunakunemelwa ndo aywo ywakuhika kwa lihina lya Bambo. Tiko kwa Chapanga kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesu pakayingilite ku Yelusalemu, kitami kyoha kikibhegha na mbilingembilinge, bhandu bhakibhegha bhangukonya “Ayu ndo ghani?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Bhandu mulula lumati bhakilongela, “Ayu ndo Yesu, mbuye kuhuma ku Nasaleti kitami kya Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguabhingabhinga achuusa Munyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliki 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lukasi 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohane 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Basi, Yesu kakiyingila pahala pa Nyumba ya Chapanga, na kakiabhingabhinga bhoha bhaabheghite mu kuhemela na kuchuhusa hilibhi mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, kakihipalangula hindambi hya bhala bhaabheghite mukuhemengana ngalabha na hiteho hya bhanakuhemengana ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Kakiaghombela “Yityekwa mu Matyeko gha Chapanga, ‘Nyumba yangu yibhegha nyumba kya kutundamila.’ Peni mwenga mukitenda kibheghe mbaku ya apoka.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Bhangalola na bhanautebhalo bhakinng'endela ku Nyumba ya Chapanga, naywo Yesu kakialamiha. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Basi, akulu bha andundame na ahunda bha Malaghilo paabhonite milando yakatendite Yesu, na kuayihwa bhana paalumbilila pahala pa Nyumba ya Chapanga paalongela, “Tuntike Mwana ywa Daudi.” Bhombe bhakikalala. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Bhakinkonya Yesu, “Bhuli, ghunguyihwa agho ghaaghalongela?” Yesu kakiaghombela, “Ena nunguyihwa! Bhuli, mukisoma ng'obhe Matyeko gha Chapanga? ‘Kwa ngulo ya bhana adoko na hing'enya ghubhakwilikiha bhakutike kwa utwihiliko?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Basi, kakialeka, kakibhuka panji ya kitami na kakighenda ku kijiji kya Betania na kakighonja akwo.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangughukotola nkongo ghuukemwa Ntini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliki 11:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Yesu pakabheghite kangubhuya kumbwani malabhila putiputi, njala yikimmina. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Kakighubhona nkongo ghuukemwa Ntini pambwegha ya njila, kakighughendela, peni ghukibhegha ng'obhe na mapambika ngati ghukibhegha na mahamba ghweka. Basi, kakighughombela ghula nkongo, “Ghukotoke kupambika mapambika kangi.” Pala pala ghula nkongo ghukinyaluka. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ahundwa bhake paabhonite nnando aghu bhakikangacha, bhakinkonya, paalongela, “Yibhegha bhuli nkongo aghu ghwa ntini ghunyaluke kanongola?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, handa panhyubhalila na nkotoke kubhegha na bhwaghalili, maahotola, chepa ghweka kutenda habhu, ngati hata pamukighombela kitumbi aki, ‘Ghutupuke ghukalitaghe ku lihibha.’ Yaakitendeka habho. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Na lyohele limulipala kuyupa mumayupo, malikingama.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangukonywa yakya Likalama lyake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliki 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lukasi 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesu kakiyingila pahala pa Nyumba ya Chapanga, kakiyanda kuhunda, mandundame akulu na hilongohi bha aghohi bhakinhikila na bhakinkonya, “Ghungutenda milando ayi kwa makakala gha ghani? Na ghani ywakakupeghite makakala agha?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Na nenga ndabhakonya likonyo limu, pamunyanga, na nenga ndabhaghombela ndo kwa likalama lyoki nungutenda milando ayi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Ubatisa ghakihuma kwa ghani? Bhuli, ghakihuma kwa kunani ebu kwa bhandu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Bhakiyanda kughombana bhombe kwa bhombe na kulongela, “Patulongela ghakihuma kunani katatukonya, ‘Kyabhuli mukinhyubhalila ng'obhe?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Na patulongela, ‘Ghakihuma kwa bhandu.’ Yaabwituka bhulwa kiyaha bhandu abha bhoha bhanguhyubhalila kukita Yohane ndo mbuye ywa Chapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Habhu, bhakinnyanga, “Twenga tungumanya ng'obhe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Naywo Yesu kakiaghombela, “Nenga bhubho ndabhaghombela ng'obhe ndo kwa likalama lyoki nungutenda milando ayi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa bhana abhili alume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Basi, mwenga munguhwacha niki? Mundu yumu kakibhegha na bhana abhili. Kakinng'endela yula ywa kalongohi na kunng'ombela, ‘Mwana ywangu, lelo ghughende ghukatende lihengo munng'unda ghwa misabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Yula mwana kakinnyanga, ‘Nenga ndaaghenda ng'obhe,’ mbole kakikilibhuha mahwacho ghake kakighenda kutenda lihengo. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Yula tate kakinng'endela yula mwana ywa ubhili na kakinng'ombela bhula bhula. Ywombe kakinnyanga, ‘Ndaaghenda tate,’ peni kakighenda ng'obhe kutenda lihengo. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Ndo ywoki nkati ya abha abhili ywakannyitikilite kyakakipalite tate ywake?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Bhakinnyanga, “Yula ywa kalongohi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Habhu, Yesu kakiaghombela, “Kulyaghila nenga nunguaghombela, asumula sumu na angongola bhataalongola kuyingila ku Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Mana Yohane yunakubatisa kakihika kwa mwenga kuabhoneha njila ya hoto ya kutama, mwenga mukinhyubhalila ng'obhe, peni asumula sumu na angongola bhakinhyubhalila. Hata payibhele mwenga pammonite agho ghoha mukilipetula ng'obhe na kunhyubhalila.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa akulima munng'unda ghwa misabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliki 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lukasi 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Nnyihwe nhwano ghungi, mundu yumu nkola nng'unda kakilima nng'unda ghwa misabibu, kakighutindihila kindupa, kakikimba libhumba lya kukamila difwai. Kakichenga kinala kya ukingikiho. Mbole, kakiayahikila bhanakulima bhamu nng'unda aghwo ghwa misabibu, mwene kakibhuka kakitenda mwanja kughenda ku nnima ghungi. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Paghaheghelelite manjubha gha mabeno, kakialaghila andumindumi bhake kwa bhala akulima bhakaayahikilite, ngati apongole mafungu ghake gha mabeno. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Bhala bhaayahikilitwe bhakibhakamula bhala andumindumi, yumu bhakintuta, yungi bhakinkoma na yungi bhakintuta kwa malibho. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Nkola nng'unda aywo kakialaghila andumundumi bhangi atangalo kupitingana bha kalongohi, nabho bhala bhaayahikilitwe bhakiatendela bhula bhula. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Kuuhiko kakinlaghila mwana ywake kwa bhombe pakalongela, ‘Pangi bhatanhokamila mwana ywangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Peni bhala bhaayahikilitwe paammonite mwana ywake bhakighombana bhombe kwa bhombe, ‘Ayu ndo yunakuhala. Hinu nhike na tunkome ngati tulitole lipala lyake.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Habhu bhakinkamula, bhakinpiha panje ya nng'unda ghula ghwa misabibu na bhakinkoma.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Yesu kaakonya, “Hinu, aywo nkola nng'unda ghwa misabibu pakapala kuhika katabhatenda niki bhala bhakaayahikilite nng'unda?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Bhombe bhakinnyanga, “Kulyaghila katabhakoma bhandu abho ahokelo, mbole kataayahikila bhandu bhangi nng'unda aghwo bhene bhatampegha lusumulo lwake kwa nndaluko ghuutwihikilite.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Apo Yesu kakiaghombela, “Mukisoma ng'obhe nnando mu Matyeko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Libho lyaalilemite atendehi bha kuchenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Hinu lighalambuka na kubhegha libho likulu lya kitamiko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Bambo ndo ywakatendite nnando aghwo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">naghwo ndo nnando ghwa kukangaha muno kwa twenga!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Kya habhu nunguaghombela, “Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga ghwaabhuhwa kwa mwenga na kupeghwa bhandu bhangi bhanakutenda milando yakayipala Chapanga Mughubhutwa ghwake.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Yesu kakighendelela kulongela “Mundu ywakapala kughwegha mulibho ali kaadumuka hipalamande palamande, na libho alyo palimponekela mundu, mundu aywo kaahyaghika.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Mandundame akulu na Akaafalisayo paayihwite mihwano ya Yesu, bhaking'amula kukita kanguaghombela bhombe. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Kya habhu, bhakipalaha kihokonyo kya kunkamula, peni bhakiayoghopa bhandu kiyaha bhakimmanya Yesu kukita ndo mbuye ywa Chapanga.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa chekwa ya kutolela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Lukasi 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesu kakilongela nabho kangi kwa mihwano, kakiaghombela, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani ghungulihwana na mutwa ywakantendekelehite mwana ywake mulyo ghwa chekwa ya kutolela. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Kakialaghila andumindumi bhake bhabhakeme bhala bhaalalikitwe mu chekwa ya kutolela, peni bhakilema kuhika. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Mbole kakialaghila andumindumi bhangi pakalongela, ‘Mubhaghombele bhala bhaalalikitwi kukita chekwa yibhegha kala kwakya mwenga, njinja kala likambako lya senga na bhana bha senga bhanakuhata na hyakupechula.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Peni bhombe bhakilema, na bhakighenda, ayu kunng'unda ghwake, na yungi ku utendehi ghwake, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />amoo bhangi bhakiakamula bhala andumindumi bhake na bhakiatendela ndendelo ya honi na kuakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Yula mutwa kakikalala muno, kakialaghila machonda bhake bhakaakanjaghane bhala bhanakukoma na kukiyocha mwoto kitami kyabhe. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Mbole, kakiaghombela andumindumi bhake, ‘Chekwa ya kutolela yibhegha kala, peni bhala bhanualalikite bhakiyitikila ng'obhe kuhika. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Basi, nng'ende mu ngongano ya njila na mukaalalike bhohele bhamubhabhona, bahahike mu mulyo ghwa chekwa ya kutolela.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Bhala andumindumi bhakighenda mu njila na bhakiakungana bhandu bhoha bhaakonganite nabho, bhandu bha maha na ahakata, na lubhagha lwoha lwa chekwa lukimema ahenja.”<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Peni mutwa pakayingilite unyumba ngati kabhabhone ahenja, amwo kakimmona mundu yumu kahwala ng'obhe lipinda liinoghwa mu chekwa ya kutolela. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Mutwa kakinkonya, ‘Ghanja, ghukiyingila bhuli amu kyanga kuhwala lipinda lya kutolela?’ Yula mundu kakitama jii. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Ndo mutwa kakiaghombela andumindumi bhake, ‘Mummope mabhoko na maghulu na mukantaghe panje mulubhindu. Akwo kwabhegha na kililo na kuhyagha mino.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yesu kakiyomola pakilongela, “Kiyaha bhaalalikitwe atangalo, peni bhahaghulitwe bhamandina.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhomba sumu kwa Mutwa ywa Akaaloma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliki 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lukasi 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Mbole, Akaafalisayo bhakibhuka panji, na bhakighambelana atende niki kwakya kung'omeha Yesu kwa malagho ghake. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ndo bhakialaghila afwasi bhabhe papamu na bhandu bha kimati kya Helode nabho bhakinnkonya, “Nhunda, tungukumanya kukita ghwenga ndo mundu ywa maha, na kukita ghunguhunda njila ya Chapanga ya kutenda gha maha kyangali kummaghula mundu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Basi, ghutughombele, ghwenga ghunguhwacha bhuli? Tungunoghwa kunhomba sumu mutwa nkulu ywa Akaaloma ebu chepa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Peni Yesu kakimanya mahwachilo ghabhe gha uhakata kakiaghombela, “Mwenga maafyangu, kiyaha niki mungupala kundegha? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Mummonehe ligwala lya kuhomba sumu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Bhakinnyeghela ligwala liikemwa dinali, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />naywo kakiakonya, “Kibhungi aki na lihina ali ndo lya ghani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bhakinnyanga, “Lya mutwa nkulu ywa Akaaloma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Ndo Yesu kakiaghombela, “Mumpeghe mutwa nkulu ywa Akaaloma ghaabheghite gha Ywombe, na gha Chapanga mumpeghe ghaabheghite gha Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Paayihwite agho bhakikangacha, ndo bhakibhuka na bhakinneka.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kungunywa nhalo ghwa kuhyuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliki 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lukasi 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Linjubha alyo alyo Asadukayo, bhala bhaalongela kukita kahone kuhyuka kuhumu kwa bhaahweghite, bhakinhikila Yesu na kunkonya ngonyo paalongela, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Nhunda, Musa kakilongela, ‘Handa mundu pakahwegha kyanga bhana, nnongo ghwake kantole aywo nhumbu nnekwa ngati kampeghe bhana aywo nnongo ghwake ywakahweghite.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Hino, apa kwa twenga pakibhegha na alongo saba. Yula ywa kalongohi kakitolela nhumbu, naywo kakihwegha kyangali bhana, ndo nnung'una ywake kakinhala aywo nhumbu. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Yikibhegha ubhwabhu abhu kwa yula nnongo ywa ubhili na ywa ndatu, mbaka bhoha saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Mbole, yula nhumbu naywo kakihwegha. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Bhuli, linjubha lya kuhyuka, nhumbu aywo katabhegha nhumbu ywa ghani mu bhala alongo saba? Kiyaha bhoha bhakintola nhumbu aywo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Mwenga munguhokela kiyaha mungumanya ng'obhe Matyeko ebu likalama lya Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Kiyaha bhaahweghiti paapala kuhyuka bhaatolela kata ebu kutolelwa, ngati bhaabhegha handa mahoka bha Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Peni kwa ghula nnando ghwa bhandu kuhyuka mukisoma ng'obhe kila kyakalongilite Chapanga kukita, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Nenga ndo Chapanga ywa Ibulahimu, Chapanga ywa Isaka, na Chapanga ywa Yakobu?’ Ywombe chepa Chapanga ywa bhaahweghite, ngati ndo Chapanga ywa bhaabheghite na ubhumi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Lula lumati lwa bhandu paluyihwite agho, lukikangacha muno kwa mahundo ghake.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwilikiho ngulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliki 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lukasi 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Afalisayo paayihwite kukita Yesu kakianyamahia, bhala Asadukayo, bakikonganika papamu. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Yumoo ywa bhala ahunda bha Malaghilo, kakinkonya likonyo ngati kanteghe, pakalongela, <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Nhunda, ndo ngwilikiho yoki Mumalaghilo yiibheghite ngulu kupitingana hyoha?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yesu kakinnyanga, “Ghunpale Bambo Chapanga ywako kwa mwoyo ghwako ghwoha na kwa mwoyo ghwako ghwoha na kwa mahala ghako ghoha. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ayi ndo Ngwilikiho yinakunoghwa na kangi ya ulongohi. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Na ya ubhili ndo handa ayi, nalyo ndo ali, ‘Ghumpale nndamani ywako handa paghughupala ntima ghwako.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ngwilikiho ahi mbili hikamulilwa Mumalaghilo ghoha na ambuye bha Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngonyo kulinga Kilisito Nkombohi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliki 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lukasi 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Afalisayo paakwemukiti papamu, Yesu kakiakonya, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Munguhwacha niki kunninga Kilisito Nkombohi? Ywombe ndo Mwana ywa ghani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Bbombe bhakinnyanga, “Ywombe ndo Mwana ywa Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yesu kakiaghombela, “Yibhegha bhuli aywo Daudi pakalongohitwe na Nhuki ywa Chapanga kangunkema Kilisito, ‘Bambo?’ Kiyaha kakilongela,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />‘Bambo kakinng'ombela Bambo ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">ghutame mu mbande yanenga ya nnilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Mbaka paambala kubhahotola yomo amyanja bhako.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Handa Daudi kangunkema Kilisito, ‘Bambo’ Yibhegha bhuli Kilisito kabheghe mwana ywa Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Kahone mundu ywakahotolite kunnyanga lilagho. Kutandila linjubha alyo kahone mundu ywakayighite kunkonya kangi.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguakinya bhandu bhalindakile na mahundo gha Afalisayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maliki 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Lukasi 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Mbole Yesu kakiaghombela bhala bhandu atangalo papamu na ahundwa bhake bhaabheghite apo, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Ahunda bha Malaghilo na Afalisayo ndo bhaakamuhitwe makakala gha kufwambula Malaghilo gha Musa, <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Habhu, mungunoghwa kuayitikila na kutenda kyohele kyaabhaghombela. Peni nkotoke kutenda ghala ghaaghatenda, kiyaha bhombe angutenda ng'obhe ghala ghaaghalandamiha. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bhombe bhanguyibhopa mihiho mikulu na kuhibhika mu makombi gha bhandu, peni bhene angulema nga kuyikamula kwa hikonji ghabhe. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Bhombe bhangutenda ndendelo yabhe hyoha ngati abhonekane na bhandu, ghabhe bhanguhwala himatiko hinakubhegha na Matyeko gha Malaghilo muhibhungi hyabhe na mumabhoko na kutaliha hihundo hya mapinda ghabhe. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Bhangupala kutama mu hiteho hya pahala pa kuhokamilwa muchekwa na muhila hiteho hya kuhokamilwa munu munyumba hya kukonganila, <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Bhangupala kujambuhwa mumagulio na bhagupala bhandu bhaakeme ‘Nhunda.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Peni bhandu akotoke kuakema mwenga ‘Nhunda.’ Kiyaha mabhoha mwenga ndo afwasi bhangu na nhunda ywenu ndo yumu ghweka. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Na nkotoke kunkema ywohele ‘Tate’ mu nnima aghu kiyaha mmegha na Tate yumu, naywo kabhegha kunani. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Bhandu akotoke kuakema mwenga ‘Hilongohi.’ Kiyaha mmegha naywo kilongohi yumu ghweka, naywo ndo Kilisito. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Ywombe ywakabhegha nkulu mu mwenga yibhegha mbaka kabheghe nndumitumi ywenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Kiyaha mundu ywohele ywakaliyinula katahuluhwa na mundu ywohele ywakalihuluha katayinulwa.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangughulakalila ufyangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliki 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Lukasi 11:39-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:44">11:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:52">11:52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Kibhabhone mwenga ahunda bha Malaghilo na Afalisayo, maafyangu, kiyaha munguatatila bhandu nlyango ghwa Ghubhutwa ghwa kunani, kunu mabhene munguyingila ng'obhe, na bhala bhaapala kuyingila munguakanikiha. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Kibhabhone mwenga ahunda bha Malaghilo Afalisayo, maafyangu, mungulyegha munyumba ya adala alekwa, kunu mungulitenda handa bhamaha, na kwa ufyangu munguyupa mayupo mandandamaho. Habhu, maamokola kihyatu kikulu.”<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Kibhabhone mwenga ahunda bha malaghilo na Afalisayo maafyangu, kiyaha mungutindila mu milima na kuyomboka mahibha ngati kuntenda mundu yumu kabheghe Nnyahudi, na pakatenda kala kubhegha mwana ywa kumambe mala mbili kyanalumu.”<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Kibhabhone mwenga hilongohi maangabhona. Mwenga mungulongela, ‘Handa mundu pakalapa kwa lihina lya Nyumba ya Chapanga, kilapo akyo kyayaghi, peni pakalapa kwa lihina lya sahabu ya mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, mundu aywo kabhopwa mu kilapo akyo’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Mwenga mangalola ahilamahala. Ndo kyoki kiibhegha kikulu kupitingana kingi, yila sahabu ebu yila Nyumba ya Chapanga yinakutenda ayo sahabu yibheghe ya Chapanga? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Kangi mungulongela, ‘Mundu pakalapa kwa kindambi kya kuyambikila, chepa kilibhi, peni pakalapa kwa nyambi yiibhegha mukila kindambi, mundu aywo kangubhopwa na kilapo akyo.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Mwenga mangalola. Ndo kyoki kiibhegha kikulu mu ahyo, yila nyambi, ebu kila kindambi kya nyambi kiitenda ayo nyambi yibheghe ya Chapanga? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Habhu, mundu ywakalapa kwa kindami, kangulapa kwa akyo kindambi na ghoha ghaabheghiti unane ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Naywo mundu ywakalapa kwa Nyumba ya Chapanga, kangulapa kwa ayo Nyumba ya Chapanga na kwa aywo ywakatama mu Nyumba ayo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Naywo yunakulapa kwa kunani kwa Chapanga, kangulapa kwa kiteho kya Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga na kwa aywo yaakatama mu kiteho akyo.”<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Kibhabhone mwenga ahunda bha malaghilo na Akaafalisayu, maafyangu. Kiyaha munguatenda bhandu atule matulo gha lifungu lya kumi hata kwa manyahi ghanakunungila nyanyi, bisali na lihambanyungu peni munguyileka milando mikulu ya Malaghilo, handa bhula kutenda gha maha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga, luhungu na kuhyubhalila. Agho ghanguakwiliha kughatenda kyanga kughalibhalila ghangi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Mwenga hilongohi mangabhona, mungubhuha libhembe mukiywegho na mungummila nnyama ngamia.”<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Kibhabhone mwenga ahunda bha malaghilo na Afalisayo, maafyangu, kiyaha mungughulula nnobho na kipumbulu kwa panje, peni nkati mmema hilibhi muyimokolite kwa upoka na ghwimi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mwenga maafalisayo mangabhona, ng'ulule huti nkati ya nnobho na hipumbulu, ndo panje paabhegha nyanyi.”<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Kibhabhone mwenga ahunda bha Malaghilo na Afalisayu afyangu. Mungulihwana na mandogholo ghaalembitwe chokaa kya panje ghangubhonekana gha nyanyi peni nkati ghabhegha na mihupa ya bhaahweghite na hinyakali hyoha. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Ubhwabhu abhu, na mwenga kya panje mungubhonekana mmegha bha maha peni nkati mmema ufyangu na uhokelo.”<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulongela kulinga toso ya Afalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Lukasi 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Kibhabhone mwenga ahunda bha malaghilo na Afalisayo maafyangu. Mungughachengela mandogholo gha ambuye na kughalemba mandogholo gha bhaabheghite bha maha. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Na mungulongela, ‘Handa tungabheghite mumajubha gha aghohi bhetu, tungabheghite ng'obhe papamu nabho ng'obhe mu kuakoma ambuye.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Habhu munguyilimiha mabhene kukita mwenga ndo bhana bha bhandu bhaabhakomiti ambuye. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Basi, mughumemekehe nteko ghwa uhakata ghwa atate bhenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Mwenga kibheleko kya mayoka bhana lusungu, mayibhutuka bhuli toso ya mwoto ghwangahimika? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Kya habhu, nnole nunguayeghela ambuye na bhaabheghiti bha maha na bhaabheghite na malango na ahunda. Amoo bhangi matabhakoma na kubhabhamba, amoo bhabhe mutabhahyata hinjupunjupu mu nyumba hyenu hya kukonganila na amoo bhabhe mutabhabhingabhinga kuhuma mukitami kimu mbaka kitami kingi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Habhu, ghula mwahi ghwa bhaabheghite bha maha bhoha, ghuuyitikite munnima aghu, kutandila mwahi ghwa Abeli, ywakatendite ng'obhe uhakata, mbaka mwahi ghwa Sakaliya mwana ywa Balakia, yumunkomite pakati ya pakya Chapanga na kinambi kya lihabha, yabhahikila unani mwa mwenga. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Kulyaghila nunguaghombela agha ghoha ghaahika mukibheleko aki.”<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangualilila Bhandu bha ku Yeslusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Lukasi 13:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Mwenga mabhandu bha Yelusalemu, mubhakomiti ambuye na kuatuta kwa malibho bhala bhaalaghilitwe kwa mwenga. Pakiki nikilitumba kuakungana bhana bhako, handa bhula nguku pakungana bhana bhake mu mapabhatila yake, peni ghukilema. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Ghulole kaayileka Nyumba yenu yibheghe mang'obha. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Kiyaha nunguaghombela, mamona kangi ng'obhe mbaka lijubha lila panlongela, ‘Kanemelwa ywene yunakuhika kwa Lihina lya Bambo.’”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulongela yakya kuboghoyolwa kwa Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliki 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lukasi 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesu kakibhuka ku Nyumba ya Chapanga na pakabheghite kangughenda, ahundwa bhake bhaking'endela ngati bhakammonehe Machengo gha Nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Ndo Yesu kakiaghombela, “Bhuli, mungughabhona agha ghoha? Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, kahone hata libho limu lyahighala kubhegha apa unane mwa libho lingi, ghoha ghaaboghoyolwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naho hya manjubha gha kuuhiko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliki 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lukasi 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu pakabheghite katama ku kitumbi kya Miseituni, ahundwa bhake bhakinng'endela ngati abheghe ghweka chabhe, bhakinkonya, “Ghutughombele, milando ayi yaabwitukila pakiki? Na naho yoki yiipala kubhoneha kuhika kwa ghwenga na uhiko ghwa nnima?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yesu kakiayanga, “Mulindakile, mundu kakotoke kuakuluha. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kiyaha bhandu atangalo bhaahika kwa kulitumila lihina lyangu pabhalongela, ‘Nenga ndo Kilisito Nkombohi.’ Nabho bhataakuluha bhandu atangalo. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Maayihwa mihalo ya ngondo na mbwepo hya ngondo, mulindakile nkotoke kuyoghopa, kiyaha agho mbaka ghabwitukile, peni uhiko ghwene ghukali. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Bhandu bha nnima ghumu bhaatutana na bhandu bha nnima ghungi na bhandu bha ghubhutwa ghumu bhaatutana na bhandu bha ubhutwa ghungi. Kwaabhegha na lung'ahi lwa njala na milendemo ya lutupi munnima ghwoha. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Agha ghoha ndo handa kutandandila kwa lihingili.”<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Yesu kakighendelela kulongela, “Manjubha agho mwenga maakilukwa, ngati mpamandwe na kukomwa, na mwenga maakalalihwa na bhandu bha milima hyoha kwakya kunhyubhalila nenga. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Mumanjubha agho, bhandu atangalo bhaaleka kunyubhalila, na bhaakilukana kila yumu na nnyake na bhaabhapala ng'obhe kiyaha munyubhalila nenga. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Mbole bhaabwituka ambuye atangalo ahwangi, na bhataakuluha bhandu atangalo. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Kangi upalo ghwa bhandu atangalo ghwaapungula, kubhukana na kuyonjokeheka kwa ulemwa, <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />peni yula ywakabhegha nglii mukunyubhalila nenga mbaka kuuhiko ndo katalopoka. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Peni kukali nakuhika ghula uhiko, Nhalo ghwa Maha ghwa Ghubhutwa ghwa Chapanga ghwalandamihwa munnima ghwoha, ngati bhandu bhoha ghwaghumanye. Ndo ghula uhiko ghwaahika.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapungwo makulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliki 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lukasi 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Pamughubhona nnando ghwa kuyoghoha, ghuuyegha uhanjaghano, ghuyima mu Nyumba ya Chapanga handa pakalongelite mbuye Danieli, yunakusoma kangunoghwa kaghumanye nnando agho, <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />ndo bhala bhaabheghiti ku Yudea bhatughile ku hitumbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Na yula ywakabhegha kulinyakaha lwa nyumba kakotoke kuhuluka ngati kakatole kyohele mu nyumba yake. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Ywakabheghegha kung'unda kakotoke kubhuya ukaya kutola ngubho yake. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Kibhabhone kwa bhala adala bhaabhegha na ndumbo na bhaabhegha na bhana hinonono mumanjubha agho. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Nnyupe ngati kutugha kwa mwenga kukote kubhegha mu manjubha gha malili ebu Linjubha lya Kupumulila. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kiyaha mumanjubha agho kwabhegha na mapungwo makulu ghene ghanabwituka kata kuhuma kubhumbwa kwa nnima mbaka lelo, hangi ghaabwituka kangi ng'obhe. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Peni Chapanga kaghupungula kala mmalango ghwa manjubha agho, handa kangatenda habho ng'obhe kahone nga mundu yumo ywakapala kulopoka, peni yakya bhandu bhakaahaghulite manjubha agho Chapanga kaghapungula.”<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />“Mumanjubha agho handa mundu ywohele kataaghombela, ‘Nnole, Kilisito Nkombohi kabhegha apa ebu kabhegha kula,’ nkotoke kuhyubhalila. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kiyaha bhaabwituka makilisto ahwangi na ambuye ahwangi na bhaatenda naho ngulu na mihabho miyoloho ngati kuahokeha bhandu, payihotoleka mbaka bhala bhaahaghulitwe na Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mulindakile, nubhaghombela kala kukali na kubwituka kwa milando ayo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Hinu mundu ywohela pakaaghombela, ‘Kilisito kabhegha kula ku kibhala,’ nkotoke kughenda akwo. Ebu pakalongela, ‘Killisito kabhegha mu nyumba kati,’ nkotoke kuhyubhalila. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Kiyaha handa bhula ndetelehe hya njahe payibwitukila kuhuma kungeha na kubhonekana mbaka kulutipikiti luchubha, habho ndo yaabhegha kuhika kwake Mwana ghwa Mundu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />“Kiyaha pwohele paghubheghite ntumba, akwo ndo bhaakongana hiyuni ndapu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwa Mwana ghwa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliki 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lukasi 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Pindulu mbole manjubha agho gha mapughwo paghakinda, Chapanga kataluughalambuha luchubha kubhegha lubhindu, lubhalamwehi nagho ghwaanga'aliha ng'obhe na ndondwa yaaponeka kuhuma kunani, na ubhwabhu abhu Chapanga ghaatingihika makakala gha kunani. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Ndo yabhonekana naho ya Mwana ghwa Mundu kubhwelo, na bhandu bhoha bha munnima bhaakukulika, nabho bhaammona Mwana ywa Mundu pakahika kubhwelo pakabhegha na makakala na ukulu nkulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Naywo kataalaghila mahoka bhake kunu paapyemba lupalata, nabho bhataakungana ahaghulwa bhake kuhuma mu mbande hyoha ncheche ya nnima, kuhuma mu uhiko ghumu ghwa nnima mbaka uhiko ghungi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihundo kuhuma munkongo ghwa Ntini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliki 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lukasi 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Mulihunde kuhuma munkongo ghwa nkuyu, mapanyo ghake paghayanda kutomola mahamba, mungumanya kukita hula hibhegha ugheghela. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ubhwabhu abhu, pammona milando hyoha yingubwituka, mmanye kukita, Mwana ghwa Mundu kabhegha ugheghela. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, kibheleko aki kyaakinda ng'obhe mbaka milando ayi hyoha yibwituke. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Kunani na nnima ghwaakinda, peni malagho ghangu ghaakinda ng'obhe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kahone ywakamanya lijubha ebu lisaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maliki 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Lukasi 17:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">17:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Kwa nhalo ghwa linjubha lila na lisaa kahone ywakamanya, hata mahoka bha Chapanga, hangi Mwana, ngati nga Tate ghweka chake. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Mana handa payibheghite mumajubha gha Nuhu, ubhwabhu ndo ghabhegha kuhika kwa Mwana ghwa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kiyaha majubha ghala kukali na ngumbwa ngulu ya machi kughugubika nnima, bhandu bhakibhegha paakilyegha na kunywegha, paatolela na kutolelwa, mbaka mulinjubha lila Nuhu pakayingiliti mu ghula bhwato nkulu ghuukemwa, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />na bhakimanya ng'obhe kyohele mbaka payihikite yila ngumbwa ngulu ya machi na kuakokobhola bhoha. Ndo yabhegha ubhwabhu pakapala kuhika Mwana ghwa Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Bhandu abhili bhaabhegha kunng'unda, yumu katanyahulighwa na yungi katalekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Adala abhili bhaabhegha mu kuhyagha papamu, yumu kaanyahulighwa na yungi katalekwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Hino, mulindakile kiyaha mungumanya ng'obhe linjubha lyoki lyaahika Bambo ghwenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Peni mughumanye nnando aghu kukita, handa nkola kaya kangamanyite mu lisaa lyoki pakilo mwihi katahika, mundu aywo kangaghonjite ng'obhe na kuleka nyumba yake yiboghoyolwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Habhu na mwenga yinguakwiliha kubha kala, kiyaha Mwana ghwa Mundu katahika mu lisaa limulimanyiti ng'obhe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa nndumindumi ghwa kuhyubhalika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Lukasi 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesu kakighendelela kulongela, “Ndo ywoki ywakabheghite ndumindumi ywa kuhyubhalika na yuna mahala mwene bambo ywake kaammika kuyimilila andumindumi bhangi mu lubhagha lwake, na kabhapeghe hilyo lisaa lya hilyo? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Yabhegha tela nndumindumi yula ywene bambo ghwake pakabhuya katammona pakatenda habhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, katammika ndumindumi aywo kabheghe nnyimilila ghwa utopelo ghwake ghwoha. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Peni handa aywo nndumindumi ndo nhakata, naywo pakalongela mu mwoyo ghwake, ‘Bambo gwangu kangukabhalila kubhuya,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />mbole pakayanda kuatuta andumindumi ayaki na kuyanda kulyegha na kunywegha papamu na alobhi, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />bambo ghwa nndumindumi aywo katahika linjubha lyakamanyiti ng'obhe na lisaa lyakalimanya ng'obhe. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Bambo ywake atanhyata muno nndumindumi aywo na kunbhika mu ng'ebhu yimo na afyangu, akwo ndo katalila na kuhyanga mino.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa akabhali kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Yesu kakighendelela kulongela, “Manjubha agho, Gubhutwa ghwa Kunani kwa Chapanga ghwabhegha handa akabhali kumi bhaatoliti mambamba ghabhe na kughenda kunkingama bambo yunakutolela. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Nhano mu bhombe bhakibhegha ahila mahala, na nhano bhakibhegha na mahala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Bhala ahila mahala bhakitola mambamba ghabhe peni bhakitola ng'obhe na mahuta gha kuyonjokeha mu mambamba, <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />peni bhala bhaabheghite na mahala bhakitola mambamba ghabhe na mahuta ghangi mu kyupa. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Yula bambo yunakutolela pakakabhalililte kuhika bhala akabhali bhoha bhakitopelwa ng'ono na bhakighonja.”<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Kuuhiko, pakilo totolo pakibhegha na kyobho, ‘Nnole, bambo yunakutolela kanguhika, nng'ende panje mukankingame.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Ndo bhala akabhali bhoha bhakiyumuka na kughatendekeha mambamba ghabhe. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Bhala ahila mahala bhakiaghombela bhala bhaabheghite na mahala, ‘Mutupeghe mahuta ghenu kichoko, mambamba ghetu ghanguhimika.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Peni bhala bhaabheghite na mahala bhakiayanga, ‘Kata, kiyaha ghangutukwila ng'obhe twenga na mwenga. Mbaha nng'ende kwa bhanakuhemengana mukahemele mahuta ghenu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Bhala akamwali abhughabhugha paabheghite bhangughenda kuhemela mahuta, bambo yunakutolela kakihika. Bhala akabhali bhaabheghite kala, bhakiyingila unyumba papamu naywo mu chekwa ya kutolela na nlyango ghukitatwa.”<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Mbole, bhala akabhali babhughabhugha nabho bhakihika, na bhakikema, ‘Bambo, Bambo, ghutuhughulile nlyango.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Peni Bambo yunakutolela kakiayanga, ‘Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, nunguamanya ng'obhe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Yesu kakiyomola pakalongela, “Hinu mulindakile, kiyaha mungumanya ng'obhe linjubha ebu lisaa.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwano ghwa andumindumi andatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Lukasi 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Kangi Yesu kakighendelela pakilongela, “Kangi, Ghubhutwa ghwa Kunani kwa Chapanga ndo handa mundu ywakapalite kughenda kumwanja, kakiakema andumindumi bhake na kuapegha utopelo ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Yumu kakinpegha mihako nhano ya magwala, na yungi mihako mibhili ya magwala, na yungi nhako ghumu ghwa magwala, bhoha bhakipeghwa kwa makakala ghabhe, mbole ywombe kakibhuka. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Mbole yula ywakapeghitwe mihako nhano ya ligwala kakighenda kuyitendela mahengo na kakimokola mihako yingi nhano ya magwala. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ubhwabhu abhu yula ywakapeghitwe mihako mibhili ya maghwala kakimokola mihako yingi mibhili ya magwala. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Peni yula nndumindumi ywakapeghitwe nhako ghumu ghwa magwala, kakighenda na kakibukula libhumba mulutupi na kakighuhiha ghula nhako ghwa magwala ya bambo ghwake.”<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Mbole ya manjubha matangalo yula bambo ywa bhala andumindumi kakibhuya kutenda mmalango na bhombe. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Yula nndumindumi ywakapeghitwe mihako nhano ya magwala kakihika, kakiyegha mihako mingi nhano ya magwala. Na kakilongela, ‘Bambo ghukimbegha mihako nhano ya magwala, ghulole njokeheka mihako yingi nhano.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Bambo ghwake kakinng'ombela, ‘Ghutenda maha muno, nndumindumi ghwa maha na ghwa kuhyubhalika, ghutenda maha kwa hilibhi hichoko, ndaghubhika kubhegha nnyimilila ghwa hilibhi hitangalo. Ghuhike ghuyelelwe papamu na bambo ghwako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Mbole yula ywakapeghitwe mihako mibhili ya ligwala naywo kakihika. Na kakilongela, ‘Bambo, ghukimbegha mihako mibhili ya magwala. Ghulole nyonjokeha mihako yingi mibhili.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Bambo ywake kakinyanga, ‘Ghutenda maha munu, nndumindumi ghwa maha na ghwa kuhyubhalika, ghutenda maha mu milando michoko, ndaghubhika kubhegha nnyimilila ghwa hilibhi hitangalo. Ghuhike ghuyelelwe papamu na bambo ywako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Mbole yula nndumindumi ywakapeghitwe nhako ghumu ghwa magwala kakihika na kakilongela, ‘Bambo, Ningumanya kukita ghwenga ndo mundu n'nonopo munu, ghungubena pala paghupanditi ng'obhe na ghungukungana pala paghukwetite ng'obhe mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Hinu nikiyoghopa kukita pangi ndaghahobheha maghwala ghako, ndo nikighukulila nhako ghwako mulutupi. Ghulole, nhako ghwako aghu apa ghuutole utopelo ghwako.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Bambo ghwake kakinnyanga, ‘Ghwenga nndumindumi nhakata na ntotoho, ghukimanya kukita ningubena kila kimbatite ng'obhe na kukungana pala pangwetite ng'obhe mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Hinu, yikikukwiliha kughabhika magwala ghangu kwa bhanakubhuha liba, ngati pamuya ndole yiibheghiti yangu na mapongolo ghake. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Habhu, mumpoke aghwo nhako ghwa magwala na mukanpeghe ywakabheghite na mihako mbinda mabhoko yimu. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kiyaha ywohele ywakabhegha na kilibhi katapeghwa na kuyonjokehwa. Peni yula ywakabheghite ng'obhe na kilibhi na kila kyakabheghite nakyo katapokwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Na ayu nndumindumi nhakata muntaghe panje, mulubhindu, akwo kubhegha na kililo na kuhyagha mino.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Toso ya kuuhiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Pakahika Mwana ywa Mundu mu ukulu ghwake na mahoka bha Chapanga bhoha papamu naywo, apo ndo katatama mu kiteho kya utabhala kya ukulu ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Bhandu bha milima hyoha bhaakwemukana mu ulongolo ghwake, naywo kataabhika mbuhi ghweka na mene ghweka handa paatenda nhakila. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Kataabhika mene mu mbande yake ya nnilo na mbuhi mbande yake ya ngiya. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Ndo mutwa kataaghombela bhala bhaabheghite mu mbande yake ya nnilo, ‘Nhike mwenga muunemilitwe na Tate ghwangu, muumokole Ghubhutwa ghuutendikihitwe kwa kya mwenga kutandila kubhumbwa kwa nnima. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kiyaha pammeghiti na njala mukimbegha hilyo, panyumilitwe, mwenga mukimbegha machi gha kunywegha, na pameghite nhenja mukinngingama, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />pameghite uhula mukinhwaliha mapinda, pameghite ntamwa mukinlela, na pameghite mu kibhopo mukihika kuntyangila.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Ndo bhala bhaabheghite bha maha bhakinnyanga, ‘Bambo, ndo linjubha lyoki tukikubhona na njala na tukikulyegheha ebu ghuyumilwa ndo tukikunywegheha machi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Lijubha lyoki tukikubhona nhenja tukikukingama ebu uhula tukikuhwaliha? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Kangi lijubha lyoki tukikubhona ntamwa na twenga tukikubhika ebu paghubheghitea mu kibhopo tukikutyangila?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Naywo Mutwa kataayanga, ‘Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, kyohele ki mubhatendilite yumoo ghwa abha akaafuasi bhangu adoko, ndo mukindendela nenga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Mbole kataaghombela bhala bhaabheghite mu mbande yake ya ngiya, ‘Mmukane kwa nenga mwenga munkotolitwe, nng'endi mu mwoto ghwa nga kuhimika ghuutendikihitwi kala kwakya Nchipila na mahoka bhake. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kiyaha pameghite na njala, mukimbegha ng'obhe hilyo, nikinyumilwa, mukimbegha machi ngo'bhe, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Nikibhegha nhenja peni mukingingama ng'obhe, nikibhegha uhula peni mukinhwaliha ng'obhe, na pameghite ntamwa kunlela kata na pameghite mu kibhopo mukindyangila ng'obhe.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Ndo bhene nabho bhaanyanga, ‘Bambo linjubha lyoki alyo tukikubhona paghubhegha na njala ebu ghuyumilwa ebu nhenja, ebu uhula ebu paghubhegha ntamwa na mukibhopo na tukikuleka?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Mutwa kataayanga, ‘Kulyaghila nunguaghombela, pala pannemite kubhatangatila yumu ywa abha akaafuasi bhangu adoko, ndo mukilema kundendela nenga.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Hinu abho bhaayingila mukihyato kya manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko, peni bhala bhaabheghite bha maha bhaayingila mu ubhumi ghwa manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Lukila lwa kunkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliki 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lukasi 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohane 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yesu pakayomolite kughalongela malagho agho ghoha, kakiaghombela ahundwa bhake, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mungumanya kukita mbole ya majubha mabhili yaabhegha Pasaka, naywo Mwana ywa Mundu katakilukwa ngati kabhangalilwe mulupingika.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ndo hilongohi bha andundame na aghohi bha bhandu bhakikwemukana mu nyumba ya utabhala ya Ndundame Nkulu, lihina lyake Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Bhakighombana ngati bhankamule Yesu kwa lupwepo na kunkoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Peni bhakilongela, “Yikotoke kubhegha muchekwa, hela bhubho yaabwitukila bhulwa mubhandu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangupopohelwa mahuta akwo Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliki 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohane 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yesu pakabheghite ku Betania mulubhagha lwa Simoni ywakabheghite na maloha, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />nndala yumu kakinhikila na kyupa kya libho lya alabasita, kiimemite mahuta gha kunungila munu ghaabheghite gha ngalabha ngulu, kakighapopoha mu mutwe ghwa Yesu pakabheghite kangulyegha hilyo. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ahundwa bhake paabhonite agho bhakikalala, bhakilongela, “Kya niki tunguhobheha ghwa ngalabha ahi ngulu? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Mahuta agha ghangahemenganitwe kwa ngalabha ngulu na ligwala ayo bhangakamuhitwe makapukwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesu kakighamanya mahwacho ghabhe, na kakiaghombela, “Kiyaha niki mungunng'aha nndala ayu? Ywombe kandendela nnando ghwa maha muno. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Bhandu kapukwa mmegha nabho manjubha ghoha, peni maabhegha ng'obhe na nenga manjubha ghoha. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Pakambopokihiti agha mahuta mu mmili ghwangu, ngati kummika kala kwa kukulilwa kwa nenga. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ninguaghombela hoto, kwohele paghulandamihwa Nhalo ghwa Maha munnima ghwoha, nnando aghu ghwakautendite nndala ayu ghwaakambukwa, kwa ukulungwo ghwake.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kanguyitikila kunkiluka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliki 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lukasi 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Mbole Yuda Isikalioti, yumoo ywa bhala kumi na abhili, kakighenda kwa hilongohi bha mandundame <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />na kakikonya, “Mambegha niki handa ndankamuha Yesu kwa mwenga?” Bhakinkamuha hipalamande salasini hya madini gha fesa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Kutandila lisaa alyo Yuda kakipalaha ng'ebhu ya maha ya kunkiluka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulyegha mulyo ghwa Pasaka papamu na ahundwa bhake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliki 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Lukasi 22:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Lukasi 22:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohane 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Linjubha lya ulongohi lya chekwa ya mangati ghanga amila, ahundwa bhake bhakinhikila Yesu na bhakinkonya, “Ghungupala tughutendekehele kwoki pakulyeghela Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Kakiyanga, “Nng'ende kwa nnume yumu akwo ku kitami, na mukanng'ombele, ‘Nhunda kalongela habhu, lisaa lyangu liheghelela, na mulubhagha lwako ndalyegha Pasaka papamu na ahundwa bhangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Ndo ahundwa bhake bhakitenda handa paaghombilitwe na Yesu, nabho bhakitendekeha Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Payihikite makimuhi Yesu kakitama pakulyeghela papamu na bhala ahundwa kumi na abhili. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Na paabheghite bhangulyegha Yesu kakilongela, “Kulyaghila nunguaghombela yumu ywenu katangiluka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Bhene bhakihyongoloka muno, bhakiyanda kukonya yomu mbole ya yungi, “Bhuli Bambo, ndo nenga?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yesu kakialongela, “Yula ywakachwikite lingate papamu na nenga mukipumbulu, ndo katangiluka. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana ywa Mundu kangughenda handa payityekitwe mu Matyeko. Peni kimmone yula ywakankiluka yaabhegha mbaha kwa ywombe kangakotokite kubhelekwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Mbole, Yuda yula ywakankilukite Yesu kakilongela, “Bhuli nhunda, ndo nenga?” Yesu kakinnyanga, “Ghwenga ghulongela na kila kighukilongela ndo hoto.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulyo ghwa Bambo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliki 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Lukasi 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Akaakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Pabhaabheghiti bhangulyegha, Yesu kakitola lingate kakilumetula, na kakinnumba Chapanga, kakiapegha ahundwa bhake pakalongela, “Ntole, nlyeghe, aghu ndo mmili ghwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Mbole, kakighutola nnobho, kakilumba, kakiapegha pakalongela, “Nnyweghele mabhoha nnobho aghu. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Aghu ndo mwahi ghwa nenga ghuubhoneha ninganilo lyangu ndo hoto, mwahi ghuuyitika kwakya kuabhuhila ulemwa bhandu atangalo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Peni nunguaghombela, kutandila hinu ndanywegha kangi ng'obhe difwai ayi ya nsabibu, mbaka linjubha lila pambala kunywegha difwai ya hyono papamu na mwenga mu Ghubhutwa ghwa Tate ghwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Mbole, paayomolite kuyimba lwimbo, bhakibhuka kughenda ku kitumbi kya Miseituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulondola kukita Petili katankana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliki 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lukasi 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohane 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Basi, Yesu kakiaghombela, “Lelo pakilo bhoha maamutuka na maaneka, kiyaha yityekwa mu Matyeko, ‘Ndantuta yunakuhakila, na lumati lwa mene lwapwilinganika.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Peni mbole ya nenga kuhyuka ndabhalongolela kughenda ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petili kakiyanga, “Hata handa bhoha bhatakuleka, nenga ndakuleka ng'obhe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu kakinng'ombela Petili, “Kulyaghila nungukughombela, mupakilo ya lelo kukali na njogholo kubhika, ghwangana pandatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Peni Petili kakilongela, “Hata handa nungunoghwa kuhwegha papamu na ghwenga, ndakuleka ndwee.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Na ahundwa bhangi bhoha bhakilongela ubhwabhu abhu.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangunnyupa Chapanga ku kitogholo kya Gatisemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliki 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lukasi 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Mbole Yesu kakighenda papamu na ahundwa bhake mbaka ku kitogholo kiikemitwe Getisemane, ndo kakiaghombela, “Ntami apa nenga nungughenda pala kuyupa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Kakintola Petili papamu na bhala bhana abhili bha Sebedayu, naywo kakiyanda kuhyongoloka na kubhaghaya. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Mbole kakiaghombela, “Megha na kuhyongoloka mumwoyo hata ugheghela na kuhwegha. Ntame apa papamu na nenga nkotoke kughonja.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Kakighenda kutali kya mandina, kakighwegha makukama pakayupa, kakilongela, “Tate ywangu, handa yaahotoleka, nnobho aghu ghumbitile kutali, hangi yikotoke kubhegha handa mumbala nenga peni yibheghe handa paghupala ghwenga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Kakiaghendela bhala ahundwa bhake na kakiabhona aghonja kala. Kakinkonya Petili, “Yibhegha bhuli mwenga andatu nnepelwa kutama meho na nenga hata lisaa limo? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Nkotoke kughonja, ngati nnyupe nkotoke kuyingila mu mayigho. Kulyaghila nhuki ghubhegha kala, peni mmili ndo nnyoyoho.” <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Yesu kakialeka kangi na kughenda kuyupa kya ubhili kuyupa, “Tate ywangu, handa yinguhotoleka ng'obhe kimbamanda aki kikulu kikotoke kumbitila, hino, ghutende mughupala.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Pakabhuyite kangi, kakiakolela aghonja, kiyaha bhakitopelwa na ng'ono.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Habhu kakialeka, kakighenda kangi kuyupa kya undatu paakilongela malagho ghaghala ghala. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Mbole, kakiabhuyila bhala ahundwa na kakiaghombela, “Nkali mungughonja na kupumulila? Nnole, lisaa lihika na Mwana ywa Mundu kangukamuhwa mu mabhoko gha bhandu bhanaulemwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Nnyinuke, tughende. Nnole yula ywakangiluka kanguheghelela.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangukamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliki 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lukasi 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohane 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesu pakabheghitie kakali kangulongela, Yuda, yumu ywa bhala ahundwa kumi na abhili, kakihika pakalongohana na lumati lukulu lwa bhandu bhaabheghite na makechelo na hinduku bhaalaghilitwe na hilongohi bha andundame na hilongohi bha Akaayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Basi, aywo ywakapala kunkiluka kakiapegha kala naho kukita, “Mwene yumbala kumjambuha kwa kunkumbatila ndo munkamule.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Kamu, Yuda kakinhikila Yesu na kumjambuha, “Mwika Nhunda.” Mbole kakinkumbatila.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Ghanja, ghutende kila kighukihikilite.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Mbole bhala bhandu bhakinng'endela na bhakinkamula Yesu na kummopa. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Kamu, yumu ywa bhala bhaabheghite na Yesu pakabhonite agho, kakihomola kihimbi lwake, na kakintuta mmandwa ywa Ndundame Nkulu, na kunkechula lichikilo. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yesu kakinng'ombela, “Ghubhuyihe kihimbi muhala yake, kiyaha bhoha bhanakukoma kwa kihimbi bhaakomwa kwa kihimbi. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Bhuli, nungupala mmanye kukita ningahotolite kunnyupa Tate ywangu, naywo kanganyeghelite kyanalumu ya himati kumi na hibhili hya mahoka bhake bha kunani? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Peni, handa pandenda habhu, bhuli Matyeko gha Chapanga ghangatwihilikite bhuli ghaalongela agha mbaka ghabwituke?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Mu lisaa alyo Yesu kakilughombela lula lumati lwa bhandu, “Muhikila na makechelo na himbongambonga ngati mungamule nenga handa mpoka, manjubha matangalo nikitama ku Nyumba ya Chapanga panuahunda, kiyaha niki mukinngamula ng'obhe? <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Peni agha ghoha ghabwitukila ngati Matyeko ghaatyekitwe na ambuye ghatwihilike.” Ndo ahundwa bhake bhoha bhakibhutuka na bhakinneka.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mu ulongolo ghwa libalasa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliki 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lukasi 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">22:63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohane 18:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18:19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Bhala bhaankamulite Yesu bhakinnyegha kwa Kayafa ywakabheghite Ndundame Nkulu. Na akwo bhakibhegha ahunda bha malaghilo na hilongohi bha Ayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Petili kakintughila kya kutali mbaka ku lubhigho lwa nyumba ya Ndundame Nkulu. Kakiyingila mulubhigho lwa nyumba na kakitama papamu na machonda ngati kabhone kiipala kubwituka. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Basi, hilongohi bha Ayahudi, na andundame na libalasa lyoha likipalaha ayimiho bha uhwangi, ngati bhankome Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Peni bhakimokola ng'obhe nnando ghwohele, hata payibhele ayimiho atangalo ahwangi bhakibwituka. Kuuhiko bhakibwituka ayimiho abhili bha uhwangi, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />bhakilongela, “Mundu ayu kakilongela, ‘Ninguhotola kuyiboghoyola Nyumba ya Chapanga na kuyichenga kangi mu majubha mandatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mbole, Ndundame Nkulu kakiyima na kunng'ombela Yesu, “Bhuli ghwenga ghubhegha ng'obhe na kyakuyanga? Bhandu abha anguyimiha niki kwa ghwenga?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Peni Yesu kakinyamala jii. Ndo Ndundame Nkulu kakinng'ombela, “Ghulape muulongolo ghwa Chapanga yunaubhumi, ghutughombele handa ghwenga ndo Kilisito, Mwana ywa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yesu kakiyanga, “Ena, handa mughulongela. Peni nunguaghombela bhoha, kutandila hinu maamona Mwana ywa Mundu pakatama mbande ya nnilo ya Chapanga yunamakakala, pakahika mu mahundi gha kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Ndo Ndundame nkulu kakilakatula mapinda ghake pakalongela, “Ayu kangukundula! Kiyaha niki tungupala uyimiho ghungi kangi? Nnole, hinu mwenga nnyihwa agho makundulo. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Mwenga mungulamila bhuli nnando aghu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Bhakinnyanga, “Kangunoghwa kuhwegha.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Mbole bhakinhunila mata ku kibhungi na bhangi bhakinbhakula mabhako, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />ghwenga Kilisito, “Ghulondole, ndo ghani ywakakubhakulite?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kangunkana Bambo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliki 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lukasi 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohane 18:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Lisaa alyo Petili kakitama mulubhigho. Nndumindumi yumu nndala ywa Ndundame Nkulu kakinhikila na kakinng'ombela, “Na ghwenga ghukibhegha papamu na Yesu ywa ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Peni Petili kakikana muulongolo ghwa bhoha pakalongela, “Ningumanya ng'obhe kighukilongela.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Pakabheghite kangubhuka panje kuhika panlyango, nndumindumi yungi nndala kakimmona, na kakiaghombela bhandu bhaabheghite pala, “Mundu ayu kakibhegha papamu na Yesu ywa ku Nasaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Petili kakikana kangi kwa kilapo pakalongela, “Nenga nungummanya ng'obhe mundu aywo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Mbole kya mandina bhala bhaayimite pala bhakinng'endela Petili na bhakinng'ombela, “Kulyaghila ghwenga ndo yumu ywabhe, kiyaha kuyobhela kwa ghwenga kungulihwana na bhombe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ndo Petili kakiyanda kulikundula na kulapa, “Nenga nungummanya ng'obhe mundu aywo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Kamu njogholo kakibhika. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Petili kakihwachila lila lilagho lyakalongilite Yesu, “Kukali na kubhika njogholo, ghwangiluka pandatu.” Kakibhuka panje pakalila kwa kuchwina.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguyeghwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliki 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Lukasi 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohane 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Malabhila putiputi hilongohi bha andundame bhoha na hilongo bha Ayahudi bhakikongan kangi, bhatende luhila lwa kunkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Bhakimmopa lughoyi na bhakinnyegha kwa Pilato, ywakabheghite ntabhala ywa Akaaloma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kangulipopotola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18">Mandendelo 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Mbole Yuda ywene ywakankilukite Yesu, pakabhonite kukita Yesu katoswa, kakihyongoloka munu, kakibhuyiha hipalamande salasini hya magwala hyakapeghitwe na hilongohi bha andundame na hilongohi bha Ayahudi. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Kakilongela, “Ndenda ulemwa, kiyaha nughukiluka mwahi ghuutendite ng'obhe uhokelo ghwa kukomwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Ndo bhakinnyanga, “Aghwo chepa nnando ghwa kughuhwachila twenga, habhu ghumanye ghumwene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Ndo Yuda kakihitagha hila hipalamande hya magwala ku Nyumba ya Chapanga, kakibhuka na kakighenda kulipopotola mwene.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Bhala andundame akulu bhakighatola ghala maghwala na bhakilongela, “Yingunoghwa ng'obhe kuhangangana magwala agha na magwala gha Nyumba ya Chapanga, kiyaha magwala agha ghahombwa ngati mundu kakomwe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Basi, mbole ya kughombana, bhakilamula kuhemela nng'unda ghwa kingandu kya kubhumbila hyombo hya lutupi, ngati pabheghe pakuakulila ahenja. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ndo mana mbaka lelo bhandu bhangughukema nng'unda aghwo nng'unda ghwa mwahi.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Ndo likitwihilika lila lilagho lya mbuye Yelemia kukita, “Bhakitola hipalamande salasini hya magwala, bei yakapangilitwe na bhandu bha Isilaeli, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />bhakihemelela nng'unda ghwa kingandu kya kubhumbila hyombo hya lutupi, handa bhula Bambo pakakwilikihite.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato kangunkonya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliki 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Lukasi 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohane 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Linjuba alyo alyo Yesu pakayimite muulongolo ghwa Pilato, nkulu ywa nkoa ywa Akaaloma, naywo kakinkonya Yesu, “Bhuli, Ghwenga ndo Mutwa ywa Akaayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu kakinnyanga, “Ghwenga ghungulongela.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Peni hilongohi bha andundame na hilongohi bha Ayahudi paankokilite kakiyanga ng'obhe lilagho.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ndo Pilato kakinkonya, “Bhuli, ghunguyihwa ng'obhe ngokelo ahyo highukokelwa?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Peni Yesu kakinnyanga ng'obhe hata kwa lilagho limu, kya habhu ntabhala kakikangacha munu.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaangutoswa kiho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliki 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lukasi 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohane 18:39—19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Basi, yikibhegha hitohe mulinjubha lya chekwa ntabhala ywa Aloma kummopola mmopwa yumu ywakahaghulitwe na lumati lwa bhandu. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Manjubha agho kakibhegha mmopwa yumu nhakata, ywakakemitwe Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Basi, lumati lwa bhandu palukonganite, Pilato kakiakonya, “Mungupala nubhabhopolele ywoki, Balaba ebu Yesu ywene ywakakemwa Kilisito?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Kiyaha kakimanya kukita Yesu kakikamuhwa kwa ywombe kiyaha bhakimmonela tama.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Pilato pakatamite pa kiteho kyake kya toso, nhumbu ywake kakintaghila lilobhe ali, “Ghukotoke kuliyingiha mungokelo ywa mundu ayu ywa maha, kiyaha lelo mbamandika muno maloto kwakya ywombe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Peni hilongohi bha andundame na aghohi bhakilunyegheleha lula lumati lwa bhandu kukita ayupe ngati kabhopolelwe Balaba na Yesu kakakomwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Nkulu ghwa nkoa kakiakonya kangi, “Ndo ywoki mu abha abhili mungupala nibhahughulilile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Bhakiyanga, “Balaba.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilato kakiaghombela, “Hinu, ndende niki kwa ayu ywakakemwa Kilisito?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Bhakinnyanga, “Ghummambe mulupingika.”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilato kakiakonya, “Kiyaha niki? Katenda uhokelo ghwoki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Peni bhombe bhakighendelela kuyobha kyobho, “Ghummambe mulupingika.”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato pakabhonite katahotola ng'obhe kutenda kyohele, na kukita bhulwa ghunguyonjokeheka, kakitola machi, kakikuha mabhoko ghake muulongolo ghwa lula lumati lwa bhandu, pakalongela, “Nenga megha ng'obhe munnando ghwa kiho kya mundu ayu, maamanya mabhene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Bhandu bhoha bhakiyanga, “Chapanga katuhyate twenga na bhana bhetu kwa kiho kya mundu ayu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Ndo, kakiabhopolela Balaba na mbole ya kukwilikiha kuntuta Yesu hinjupunjupu hya liyula lya ndomondo hiikwatilitwe ndoana, kakimmuha ngati kabhambwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Machonda bhangunhwangila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliki 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohane 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Mbole, machonda bha Pilato, bhakinnyegha Yesu muludamu lwa utabhala, na machonda bhoha bhakintindila. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bhakinhula mapinda ghake na bhakinhwaliha lipinda lya salabati, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Mbole, bhakitendekeha kilemba kya mihomi na bhakinhwika mumutwe ghwake. Bhakinpegha nhimbati mu kibhoko kyake kya nnilo, bhakichutama mayughwa muulongolo ghwake paalongela, “Mwika, Mutwa ywa Akaayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bhakinhunila mata, na bhakighutola ghula nhimbati mu mabhoko ghake na bhakintuta mu mutwe ghwake. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Mbole ya kuntendela agho, bhakinhula lila lipinda, bhakinhwaliha kangi lipinda lyake, na bhakintola ngati bhakammambe mulupingika.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubhambwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliki 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lukasi 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohane 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Paabheghite munjila, bhakikongana na mundu yumu ywa ku Kilene, lihina lyake Simoni, nabho machonda bhakinkwilikiha kalugheghe lula lupingika. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Bhakihika pahala paakemitwe Goligota, fwambulo yake pahala palihuhu lya mutwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Bhakinpegha difwai yiihanganganitwe na lusunga. Peni Yesu pakapahite kakilema kunywegha. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Paammabite kala, bhakighabhana mapinda ghake kwa kutenda usimbi. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Mbole, bhakitama ngati bhankingikihe. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Unani mwa mutwe ghwake, mulupingika, bhaibhika lipapi liilembitwe, “AYU NDO YESU, MUTWA YWA AKAAYAHUDI.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Mbole Apoka abhili bhakibhambwa papamu na ywobe kila mundu mulupingika lwake, yumu mbande yake ya nnilo na yungi mbande ya ngiya ya Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Bhandu bhaabheghite bhangupita ugheghela na apo, bhakinligha kunu paanokola mitwe yabhe na kunheka, paalongela, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />“Ghwenga, ghuupala kuboghoyola Nyumba ya Chapanga na kuchenga kwa manjubha mandatu, hinu ghulilopole ghumwene na ghuhuluke muupingika. Handa ghwenga ndo Mwana ywa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Ubhwabhu abhu, hilongohi bha andundame na ahunda bha Malaghilo na aghohi bhakinhwangila, paalongela, <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Kakialopoha bhangi, peni kanguhotola ng'obhe kulilopoha mwene. Ywombe ndo Mutwa ghwa Isilaeli. Hinu, kahuluke kuhuma mulupingika ndo twaanhyubhalila. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Kakinndumbila Chapanga, hino, Chapanga kanlopole handa kangupala, kiyaha ywombe kakilongela, ‘Nenga ndo Mwana ywa Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Na bhala apoka bhaabhambitwe papamu na Yesu bhakinligha ubhwabhu abhu.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiho kya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliki 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lukasi 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohane 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kutandila saa sita mbaka saa tisa nnima ghwoha likbhegha lubhindu totoloo. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Payihikite saa tisa Yesu kakilila kwa lilobhe likulu, “<char style="tl">Eloi, Eloi lama Sabakitani?”</char> Fwambulo yake, “Chapanga ywangu, Chapanga ywangu, bhuli ghunguneka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Amoo bhandu bhaayimite pala paayihwite agho bhakilongela, “Kangunkema Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Kamu, yumu ywabhe kakibhutuka lubhilo na kuyegha libhoya liihanganganitwe na siki, kakiyibhika muludenge na kakinpegha Yesu ngati kanyweghe.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Bhangi bhakilongela, “Munneke, ngati tubhone handa Eliya katahika kunlopoha.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Mbole Yesu kakilila kangi lilobhe likulu, ndo kakihwegha.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Lisaa alyo alyo, lipasia lya Nyumba ya Chapanga likibaluka hipalamande hibhili, kutandila kunani mbaka pahi. Nnima ghukilendema na matalabha ghakibaluka. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Mandogholo ghakigubutuka na mibhili ya bhandu bha maha yikihyuka. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Mbole ya Yesu kuhyuka bhakubhuka mumandogholo na bhakiyingila ku kitami king'anyimo na kubhegha bhandu bha atangalo.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Ndo yula machonda kilongohi na bhala bhaabheghite papamu naywo paakinkingikiha Yesu, paabhonite nnima ghungulendema na ghoha ghaabwitukilite, bhakiyoghopa na bhakilongela, “Kulyaghila ayu kakibhegha Mwana ghwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Apo pakibhegha na adala paalolekeha kya kutali. Abho bhakintughila Yesu kuhuma Galilaya ngati bhantumikile. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mubhombe bhakibhegha Malia mundu ywa kuhuma ku Magidala, Malia mama ywabhe Yakobu na Yosefu na mama ywabhe bhana bha Sebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mmili ghwa Yesu ghungubhikwa mulindogholo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliki 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lukasi 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohane 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Payihikite makimuhi, kakihika mundu yumu yunautopelo ywakakemitwe Yosefu, kuhuma ku Alimataya, na aywo kakibhegha nhundwa ywa Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />kakinng'endela Pilato, kughuyupa mmili ghwa Yesu. Pilato kakikwilikiha kapeghwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosefu kakighutola ghula mmili ghwa Yesu, kakighubhilingiha sanda huhu mbulete, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />kakighubhika mulindogholo lya hyono lyakalihonguliti mwene mulitabhala. Mbole, kakibingiliha libho likulu mu nlyango ghwa lindogholo na kakighenda. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Malia ywa ku Magudala na yula Malia yungi bhakitama ugheghela ghwa lindogholo.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lindogholo lingukingikihwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Kilabho yake, ndo linjubha lya kupumulila, hilongohi bha andundame na Afalisayu bhakinng'endela Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />bhakilongela, “Nkulu, tungukulungwa kukita yula nkubhuhi, kukali ya kuhwegha kakilongela, ‘Mbole ya majubha mandatu ndaahyuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Basi, ghukwilikihe ngati lindogholo likingikihwe mbaka linjubha lya ndatu. Hela bhubho, ahundwa bhake bhatahotola kughuyibha mmili ghwake na kuaghombela bhandu kukita kahyuka. Ukubhuhi aghwo ghwa uhiko ghwaabhegha nhakata kyanalumu kupitingana ghula ghwa kalongohi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato kakiaghombela, “Mwenga mmegha na machonda akingikiha. Nng'ende mukalikingikihe lindogholo handa bhula mummanya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Kya habhu, bhakighenda na machonda ngati bhakalikingikihe lindogholo kwa makakala ghoa, bhakibhika mango mu lila lindogholo na kubhika ukingiki ho.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kuhyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliki 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lukasi 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohane 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Mbole ya kupita Linjubha lya Kupumulila, na payihikite malabhila putiputi ya lijubha lya ulongohi lya juma, Malia ywa kuhuma ku Magudala na yula Malia yungi bhakighenda kulilolekeha lila lindogholo. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Kamu, pakibhegha na lulendemo lukulu lwa lutupi, kiyaha lihoka ywa Bambo kakihuluka kuhuma kunani na kakighenda kulindogholo, kakilibingiliha lila libho na kakilitamila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Kibhungi kyake aywo lihoka ywa Chapanga kiking'alima na mapinda ghake ghakibhegha mahuhu mbuletee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Bhala machonda bha lindogholo bhakiyoghopa muno, bhakiloghoya munu na bhakibhegha handa ahwegha.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Yula lihoka ywa Chapanga kakiaghombela bhala adala, “Nkotoke kuyoghopa, kiyaha nungumanya kukita mungunpalaha Yesu ywakabhambitwe mulupingika. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Kabhegha ng'obhe apa, kahyuka, handa pakalongilite. Nhike mupalole pala pakaghonjihitwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Basi, nngende kwa kuyumbatika mukaaghombele ahundwa bhake kukita, ‘Kahyuka, naywo kabhalongolela kughenda ku Galilaya. Akwo ndo mammona, nkotoke kulibhalila aki kinubhaghombela.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Habhu, bhala adala bhakibhuka pala palindogholo, paabhegha na bhwaghalili peni bhakibhegha na uyelelo nkulu, bhakibhutuka lubhilo ngati bhakaaghombele ahundwa bhake mihalo ayo.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Paabheghite bhangughenda, pindulu, Yesu kakikongana nabho, na kakilongela, “Mwika.” Bhala adala bhakinheghelela, bhakighakamula maghulu ghake na bhakintundamila. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Ndo Yesu kakiaghombela, “Nkotoke kuyoghopa. Nng'ende mukaaghombele alongo bhangu aghende ku Galilaya, akwo ndo bhamona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Machonda bhangughenda kulongela kyaakibhonite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Bhala adala paabheghite bhangughenda, amoo bha machonda bhaabheghite bhangukingikiha lindogholo, bhakighenda ku kitami na bhakiaghombela hilongohi bha andundame milando hyoha yiibwitukite. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Mbole, bhala andundame bhakikongana na hilongohi bha Akaayahudi na mbole ya kughombana, bhakiapegha bhala machonda ngalabha nyoloho <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />bhakiaghombela, “Mwenga mukalongele naha, ‘Ahundwa bhake bhakihika pakilo, bhakihika kuuyibhammili ghwake, twenga patubheghite tungughonja.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Na handa nhalo aghu pakayihwa ntabhala ywa Akaaloma, twenga twaayobhela naywo kataahyata ng'obhe.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Habhu, bhala machonda bhakiyitola yila ngalabha na bhakitenda handa paaghombilitwe na andundame. Nhalo aghu ghukwila kwa Akaayahudi mbaka lelo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguabwitukila ahundwa bhake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliki 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lukasi 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohane 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mandendelo 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Ndo bhala ahundwa kumi na yumu bhakighenda mbaka ku Galilaya ku kila kitumbi kyakaalaghilite na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Paammonite, bhakintundamila, peni amoo bhabhe bhakibhegha na bhwaghalili. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yesu kakiahikila ugheghela na kakiaghombela, “Ngamuhwa makakala ghoha kunani kwa Chapanga na munnima. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Basi, nng'ende mukaatende bhandu bha milima hyoha abheghe ahundwa bhangu, pamuabatisa kwa lihina lya Tate, na lya Mwana na lya Nhuki ywa Chapanga. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Na muahunde kuyighungilu milando hyoha yinibhakwilikihite mwenga. Kulyaghila nenga megha papamu na mwenga manjubha ghoha mbaka ku uhiko ghwa nndaluko.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>